<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="toc3">Jer.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jeremiah Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="mt">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jeremiah Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Jeremiah au Isaiah nzwa Judah Kenlien ha samrang lo eh Tinggwang ne qu kelu rehangme ge. Pa pe bata keraibe mmi ngkai hegwang keyi Josiah nkang gade teigwang, pa Huda ga minadung de Tinggwang da ngngwa cailigwang kera tei. Aipaucai Jeremiah au renam keteume nah renet muiteume penui pe samdung ziemne penui rata kedime dade cune kengngi ga ladi. Aidung pelane gade Tinggwang Jeremiah de gumlu cine pa kenlienme dage samrang nah Tinggwang de nlum kelume lung taumla lu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jerusalem 586 BC bekum ngkap kedidau, Jeremiah minadung de ngngwa bamdi delwe Egypt ga penuide ngngwa miedi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jeremiah samdung peting kerai kekam rehi gade kekwaswa kemakne, Judah rasam Hegwangmedung penai Heleuhha gade pei lude ci relui lubui.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Jeremiah de kequ (1:1-9)</para>
  <para style="io1">Judah mau kebam (2:1-6:30)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kerecaki, hezai nah samkakkelu (7:1-12:17)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hebaang teikera cisiak kedi (13:1-18:23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jeremiah muiteume de renia kecu (19:1-29:32)</para>
  <para style="io1">Teuncuhdaikelu sampet kebeu (30:1-33:26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hegwangram kauna kedi (34:1-39:18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Egypt ga kemie (40:1-45:5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Sangme Leuhdung ziemne samliadung (46:1-51:64)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem kaukedi (52:1-34)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1" />
  <para style="s">Jeremiah de Qu kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1" />Laisiukwak aide au Benjamin leuhme deu ga Anathoth nam ga Rampaube kerecaki cingkume ge Hilkiah napei Jeremiah ne rang kegai ha laisiukwak. <verse eid="JER 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2" />RAMPAUBE Judah gwangpei Amon napei Josiah Judah deu ga hegwang tei kelu mmi kereiehkecum bekum Jeremiah dage marang gai. <verse eid="JER 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3" />Judah gwangpei Josiah napei Jehoiakim hegwang keteidau pe da marang dai, Judah gwangpei Josiah napei Zedekiah hegwang tei kelu mmi kereiehket bekum kecang. Cipau kum kei mengei bekei Babylonia reugwame ne Jerusalem me de hebaang tei kera ngngwa tetdi.<verse eid="JER 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4" />RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang eh rang,<verse eid="JER 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5" />“Ih ncu npui henabam gage damgai kemak dwa ncu kedetlu da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 1:5">ncu mna lu kemak dwa Ih ncu teu ntsam luda; Ih ncu heleuhdung dage caihakecibe teigai beu dida.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:15">Gal. 1:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6" />“Ah, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang!” Ih ranggai, “Ih dainzwa marang zie bi cima, Ih henazu reu kecune.”<verse eid="JER 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7" />Dede RAMPAUBE a dage ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 1:7">“Aide rangso, ‘Ih henazu reu.’ Ih ncu lang kegai leune ga nang mie bi maisia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 1:7">nah Ih ncu ranglo kebeu leune rang beulu!<verse eid="JER 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8" />Penuide hingso, kedanemene ncu kelibeu kerane Ih ncu ngngwa la zielu—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 26:17, 18:9, 10</char></note><verse eid="JER 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9" />Pecai RAMPAUBE pe ba hetwa pet, a mui tung eh a dage rang, “Cu au, nang rang maikesiabe Ih a samdung ncu peula.<verse eid="JER 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10" />Henai Ih ncu heleuhdung nah hegwangramdung de</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 1:10">pai mpet nah teu ngkaulu kera, teimsia nah keliengi lu kera, tei ncuh nah linglu kebui cidung reu kengkieng peula.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 10:11">Keu. 10:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11" />Pecai RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang eh, rang, “Jeremiah, nang daipai ngau no?” Ih keli gai, “Almond bang kiak ge.” <verse eid="JER 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12" />RAMPAUBE a dage ranggai, “Nang ngau dauda, kedanemene Ih a samdung teicang kerane kwa eh bam.”<verse eid="JER 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13" />Pecai RAMPAUBE sam a dage keteu, “Nang daipai ngau no?” Ih keligai, “Ih tingtünle bie lige nswak bam eh ngau lie, nah cide au ailam bie lwa gwang lai eh bam dida.” <verse eid="JER 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14" />RAMPAUBE a dage ranggai, “Hangdeu aika lungh kebam pelane reu ga kekap tingtünle de nswak gwang zie da. <verse eid="JER 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15" />Kedanemene Ih tingtünle kebam heleuh pelane de gwang lulo qu kebamne. Penui gwang delwe Jerusalem rieki kimuiki gage penui hegwangbam nah herie twagwa kebam teicuh luzie nah Judah namceu kedadung pelane. <verse eid="JER 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16" />Ih a minadung de saja peu zie kedanemene penui kemau tei kedine, penui acu püt dida, hera kedadung dage kehengui rugai di, nah mamiedung penui ba le teilwe reca dida. <verse eid="JER 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17" />Nkatei ncu mteilu! Cuhlu nah penui dage Ih ncu ranglo kebeu leune rang beulo. Cu penuide hing tadi, mecaige Ih penui dwade ncu tei ngngi gai beuzie!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:35">Luk. 12:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18" />Pielo! Henai Ih ncu hangdeu leune ga rie kelu namdi, hegeu tsiage, nah hetageu herie ge Judah gwangpeidung, kedime, cingkume, nah hangdeu minadung de renia kera teibeu dida. <verse eid="JER 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19" />Penui ncu gwaketang, dede penui ncu ngam di gailak, kedanemene Ih ncu kelibeu kera n da la zielu—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai.”<verse eid="JER 1:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2" />
  <para style="s">Israel Tinggwang de Pütkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 2:1" />RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang eh, rang,<verse eid="JER 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 2:2" />“Sam aide Jerusalem ga mina leune dage sah gai lulo. ‘RAMPAUBE aide rangla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:2">Nang hena dau ncu ngngwa samkakkelu samsang de Ih nsung bam, anai kenautak keludau nang dai kenzwa gede acu hung bi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:2">nang hetaideu ga a caisui mie keladau, ling gai kemak deu ga kahgwang.<verse eid="JER 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3" />Israel de au RAMPAUBE ziemne keu ntsam pwabam, Israel nang agu rünne lie!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:3">Caugamme luhlüt tsi raitube tyei bi penuide mmaula; kengkap penui reuga gwangla—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai.’”<verse eid="JER 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4" />RAMPAUBE sam kingnei lulo, nnui Jacob pautsame, nnui Israel leuhme.<verse eid="JER 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Nnui paume acu kemmau sam daidung teugwang no, penui a dade tet nreu dino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:5">Penui mamie kemtadung reca gwang nah penui kemta kaudung ge tei kedi?<verse eid="JER 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6" />Penui aide keteu ma, ‘Egypt deu gade anuide de ngngwa mpet kebeu RAMPAUBE si no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:6">RAMPAUBE daiga lano, anuide hetaideu gade ngngwa mpet kebeube, Arabah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hetaideu </char></note> nah hekwaki deudung ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:6">kecangh nah kemui kecok le pui kebam deu ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:6">migede tetkah kemak nah migede lungh la kemak deu ga?’<verse eid="JER 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7" />Ih nnuide Carmel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hangdeukeyi</char></note> deu ga ngngwa gwanglu, luhlüt nah makeyi kedadung tyei kehega lu kera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:7">Dede nnui gwang luge, nnui a deu tei heradi nah Ih nnuide kepeu nam de nnui kemneu teidi.<verse eid="JER 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8" />Cingkume aide keteu ma, ‘RAMPAUBE daiga lano?’ nah hezaidung kecime acu malie tadi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:8">Cingkume acu renia di. Caihakecime Baal tinggwang zi gade marang di nah kemta miedung reca di.<verse eid="JER 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9" />Cine Ih cude nnui dage kemmau samdung teugwang zie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai—nah Ih nnui leuhme dage kemmau samdung teugwang zie.<verse eid="JER 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10" />Kittimme duigwadeu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kittimme duigwadeu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cyprus duigwadeu</char></note> ga miecu nah pielo. Samgwamedung de Kedar deu gage langgailo nah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:10">madaude pedwa le aikenzwa tei mi mebi pielo.<verse eid="JER 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11" />Heleuh keda ge de madaude pe rabedung rehiak ni, penui kesang kemak rabedung liede?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:11">Dede a minadung, Tinggwang penuide herüt teugwang kebeube de penui ziemne magede teigai kelak rabedung ge le acu teu rehiakdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:23">Rom. 1:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12" />Cine Ih tingde ngaukehing mlai gailo aja kai, miswakegah nah ngaukehing tei kera—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai.<verse eid="JER 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13" />Kedanemene a minadung a dage kemau kena tei kedine: Penui keringdui rwak gade a dade nreu tetdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:13">nah penuikatei penui ziemne duibung kuilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:13">duibung kerekak be dui kette bam gai kelak be.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:13">Jer. 17:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14" />Israel hebaangme ge ni? Pe mpaube ki gade pecu mna ni? Daitei eh sui pe ngauraume pecu tei kaumie dino?<verse eid="JER 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15" />Hinghonadung pe dage mrung gai. Penui kwa cisüt eh pe deu ngaukehing ge teidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:15">Pe namdidung de tei ngkap di eh migede lungh kemak deu ge teidi.<verse eid="JER 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16" />Delwe Memphis nah Tahpanhes namdi ga minadung ne pe peura teipang dizie.<verse eid="JER 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17" />Nang aide nkatei nreu gage teugwang gai meni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:17">nang RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang de pütdi, pa ncu n lampui saugwang keladau?<verse eid="JER 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18" />Cine, daitei eh Egypt ga kemie lampui ga tet lano nah Shihor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nile</char></note> dui sak no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:18">Daitei eh Assyria ga kemie lampui ga tet lano nah Euphrate reuki dui sak no?<verse eid="JER 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19" />Nkatei n kesia ne ncu saja peu zie, nah nang a dade n kenlum gah kedine ncu mmau zie. Cide au dai kenzwa gede ka bi nah mau bi nang ci luzie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:19">nang RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang de mlai kedi dau, nah a mie hing ta kedi dau—aide reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ne ndu kegai.<verse eid="JER 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20" />Nang ndaa gede n ngwanggai pung kelade Ih ne lwak beu; Ncu kang pwa kebam ria de Ih ne hiakbeu. Dede cu de nang ainzwa rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:20">‘Ih n ta teilak!’ kideu kehu leune nah tsingbang kemdiak kangga kebam leune da nang keumie, nang kemmhabo.<verse eid="JER 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21" />Ih ncu kubebang kedetkelu ge nzwa petsi yitube gade linggai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:21">Dainzwa eh nang nkatei ncu tei msia lu dino, kubebang kemtabo?<verse eid="JER 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22" />Nang hereuki gade nkatei ncu tei mcilu liede mede sabu ngkiengtube teu pia de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:22">n kemaudung au a dwa gade kehera ge—aide RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ne ndu kegai.<verse eid="JER 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23" />Nang dainzwa eh, ‘Ih hera ma! de eh ranglu lai. Ih Baal cai suima de kecu’?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:23">Langkamdung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hinnom chabak</char></note> ga nang tei kegai de pielo! Nang daipai teibi pielo—nang au ut ge luga aika pak kela ge,<verse eid="JER 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24" />nang au renaam gadha ge nzwa, lum keludau tingkai nghui lala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:24">Pa lum kedidau cau pecu kezeu lulai? Peseu pecu neu kedibe magede keherei kera gah; kereha kera tingdau pecu ngau mui lula.<verse eid="JER 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25" />N pi de tei nnei diso mede n rwak de peu hereu diso!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:25">Dede nang ranggai, ‘Aide ga keregui gah! Ma, Ih sangme rabedung de a sui la nah penui cai sui zie!’<verse eid="JER 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26" />Kerega gede tui luge ngngam di kela nzwa eh, Israelme pelane de ngngam dizie—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:26">penui, penui hegwangmedung, penui hegwangme napeidung, nah penui cingkumedung nah caihakecimedung!<verse eid="JER 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27" />Aidungde ne tsingbang dage rangla ‘Nang a pei da,’ nah tangtsu dage, ‘Nang ne acu mna beuda.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:27">Penui penui zu mene penui cai lebie le a tai lebie nreu gaila. Iciuliede, keherei dau keludau penui rangla, ‘Cuhlwe anuide kelibeu lo!’<verse eid="JER 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28" />Nnuikatei nnui ziemne tei kelu rabedung de daiga lano? Nnui keherei dau keludau, penuide peu nnuide kelilu penui tei lubui cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:28">kedanemene n namdidung kebam kieege n rabedung de ci kieege bam kecune, Judah!<verse eid="JER 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29" />Cine daitei Ih kemau tei lie de eh acu mmau lano? Nnui pelane a dage kemau teigai da—aide RAMPAUBE ne rang ndu kegai.<verse eid="JER 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30" />Ih nnui minadung de kemta gage saja peu. Ih penuide ledeu kebeu de luuneu ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:30">Hingho pe rata kebam ge nzwa nnui caihakecime de daptset dida!<verse eid="JER 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31" />Nnui aipau ceheu ga lungh kebamme! Ih rang kebam de kingnei lulo, RAMPAUBE sam! Israel dade Ih hetaideu ge dini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:31">mede kemui kecok deu ge ni? Daitei eh a minadung a dage, ‘Anui tet zang digo, anui n da madaude cailigwang dai lakta?’ de eh rangzie no.<verse eid="JER 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32" />Mipui hena kebam ge pe heteiheta de nsung tadi lani, lakciupui ge pe peuzui pai de?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:32">Dede a minadung peikap gai kelak tingbaziedung acu nsungta dida!<verse eid="JER 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33" />Nnui dainzwa nnui mraime de zui zie bi kecu ci kesang lie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:33">Nnui mipui siatume de nnui lampui ga ledeu beu.<verse eid="JER 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 2:34" />Nnui painidung au kegame nah mau kemakme jaidung le keniak teula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:34">Mina aidungde marega la eh tui luma.<verse eid="JER 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 2:35" />Dede nang rangla, ‘Ih mau ma; RAMPAUBE rata au a dade nreu tet bi dizie.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:35">Dede pielo! Ih nnui dage saja teugwang beu zie kedanemene nnui, ‘Ih kemau tei ma,’ de eh rang kelane.<verse eid="JER 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36" />Nnui zai lidi kecu aide daitei teu mlasüt bamno?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:36">Assyria suisiet tei kegai nzwa nnui Egypt suisiet bai tei dizie.<verse eid="JER 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37" />Nnui cikade ngngam eh nnui peu taksu eh mpet dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:37">kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui nlum kelame de mlai kedine, iciu eh nnui penui dade kengha ngau melu kerane.”<verse eid="JER 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1" />“Mige pe nau de tadi, nah pa tetdi eh mi kedame nau dicai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:1">pa cipau pui da cailigwang zie ni? Cipau deu de hera cangsiak dilak ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:1">Israel nang helipui ge pe nraime kekiee ge kebam nzwa lungh dida; nah nang a da cailigwang dai zie ni?—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 24:1-4</char></note><verse eid="JER 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2" />Lamlwatwang ga pie gailo! Cika nang kemmha ta tei kemak heni gede bam ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:2">Nang puidiki kuung ga n nraime de kwa gwang, Arabme ge hetaideu ga kwa kebam nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:2">Nang helipui zai reli kesiabe hangdeu de tei hera dida.<verse eid="JER 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3" />Cine tingruidung de kaam dida nah heriak tingrui gwang beu ma;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:3">dede nang au helipui ge nzwa da; nang au hengam gah lie.<verse eid="JER 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4" />Nang cu a dage rang meni: ‘A pei! A hena dau gade a zangna yitube!<verse eid="JER 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5" />Pa perata lamui zieni? Kekam kecangde pa deiga bam mui zieni?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:5">Pielo! Aide nang ne ranggai da, dede nang teilu kebui kemau leune teila!”<verse eid="JER 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel Masangkemak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6" />Josiah hegwang tei kebamdau RAMPAUBE a dage ranggai, “Nang Israel masang kemak tei kedi ngau mi? Pa lamlwa kecehu leune ga hang delwe tsingbang kendiak bang kang leune gade helipui ta nzwa tei dida. <verse eid="JER 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7" />Ih ranggai, ‘Pa ma aidungde pelane tei kedi cai, pa a da cailigwang kerabe,’ dede pa cailigwang ma. Masang kemak pe tipui Judah hegwangram ma aidungde ngau da. <verse eid="JER 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8" />Cine Ih masang kemak Israel kemmha ta tei kedine pecu ta kedi laisiu ge pwa peu eh ngau da, cinzwa eh Ih pecu lang gidi. Judah masang kemak sinapui, hing ma. Pa de mie delwe helipui ge nzwa teidi. <verse eid="JER 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9" />Pa de ngngam mezing. Pa hangdeu be tei hera di, nah pa tangtsukangdung nah tsingbangdung de reca eh kemmha ta teidi. <verse eid="JER 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10" />Pecai aidungde pelane cai, Judah, masang kemak sinapui, a da caili kegwang ciem tei kebam rünne, pa masang ma—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai.”<verse eid="JER 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11" />Pecai RAMPAUBE a dage ranggai, “Masang kemak Israel au masang kemak Judah swa masang ki! <verse eid="JER 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12" />Mie eh sam aidungde Israel tingtün lebie da ranglia beulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:12">‘Cailigwanglu, Masang kemak Israel!—aide RAMPAUBE ndu kegai—Ih nnuide a rata bammui lak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:12">Kedanemene Ih masang lu—aide RAMPAUBE ndu kegai—Ih kelungta a rata dilak.<verse eid="JER 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13" />Nang mau di delie de ranglu, kedanemene nang RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang de renia kecune;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:13">nang tsingbang kendiak pelane kang gade sangme de n lampuidung ngngwa mzi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:13">Nang a kwa kingnei luma!—aide RAMPAUBE ndu kegai.’”<verse eid="JER 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14" />A da cailigwanglo, masang kemak minadung!—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai—Ih n nahpei!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:14">Ih nnuide renam ramsang gade hangge nah paupak ramsang gade hangna de ngngwa luzie, nah Ih nnuide Zion deutu gage ngngwa cailigwang zie! <verse eid="JER 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15" />Ih nnuide a samzai ketei hegwangme peu zie, nah penui maci nah kecikecet teu eh nnuide teu zie. <verse eid="JER 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16" />Cidau nnui lungh hing luzie nah hangdeu be ga petsi bui luzie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai, mina “RAMPAUBE samkak bung!” ha de rang silak. ‘Ma aide penui mlung ga gwang silak mede penui nsungta dizie; cide teu maisia ta kedi kecang dizie mede penui keda gede tei lak.’ <verse eid="JER 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17" />Cipau tingdau, Jerusalem de, ‘Aide RAMPAUBE hegwangbam,’ lie de eh qu zie, Jerusalem ga RAMPAUBE zi gade heleuh pelane cika acu reca kera gwang ngkwa zie. Penui mlung ketak nah kesia penuide rang kebeu be tei lak.<verse eid="JER 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18" />Cipau tingdau, Israel au Judah de ngngwa ncüt luzie, nah penai ngngwa tingtünle nam langgi kedi gade Ih nnui paume de penui gum lai eh kebam kepeu deu de ga cailigwang dai luzie.<verse eid="JER 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19" />“Ih rang kegai au, ‘Ih ncu a napei nzwa ngngwa luneu la nah ncu hangdeu keyi ge peu neula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:19">heleuh keda leune ga kebam swade mapwa hezuyitube!’ Ih aide rang lubui, ‘Nang acu “A pei” de eh qu zie.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:19">Nang a cai sui kera gade nreu tetdi lak delie de eh Ih rang lubui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:3-7">1 Pet. 1:3-7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20" />Dede pe nahpei dage masang kemak nau ge nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:20">nang a dade masang luma, Israel leuhme—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai.”<verse eid="JER 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21" />Makwa ge hangdeu langkie gade siu da, Israelme hap kebam nah penui nggia kie kebam!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:21">Kedanemene penui kemau teilung lungh kedine; penui RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang de nsung tadi.<verse eid="JER 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22" />RAMPAUBE rangzeu “Cailigwanglu, masang kemak minadung! Ih nnuide tei masang eh ngkei beuzie!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:22">Minadung keligai “Ainie! Anui n da gwang zie, kedanemene nang au RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang! <verse eid="JER 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23" />Kideutudung gade kenret gwang kesang, lamlwatudung gade cilu kemak kwa ge;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:23">RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang au Israel de rikebeu be kesang.<verse eid="JER 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24" />Dede Baal hengam rabedung de kereca ziemne anui paume tei kegaidung de ngkap dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:24">penui kaunedung nah meurün haudung, penui napeidung nah napuidung!<verse eid="JER 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25" />Anui ngngam ga kauzeu digo. Anui ngngam de peu anuide halu, kedanemene anui RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang dage kemau tei gai delu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:25">Anui nah anui paumedung, anui hena ting gade cu kecang, RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang kwa kingnei luma!”<verse eid="JER 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1" />“Nang cailigwang cai, Israel—aide RAMPAUBE ndu kegai—iciucai nnui a da cailigwang kerabe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:1">Nnui Ih ngkau kela mamiedung de keu gidi delwe a dade tet mdei daidi meliecai,<verse eid="JER 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2" />Nnui masang, mzui, and kesamsang lu, nnui ‘RAMPAUBE ringbam,’ de eh sampet keludau.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:2">Iciulude heleuhdung pe dade penuikatei penuide samlam beu luzie, nah penui pe dade ndu luzie.”<verse eid="JER 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3" />RAMPAUBE Judah nah Jerusalem ga mina hangge ge dage rangla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:3">‘Nnuikatei nnui luh pulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:3">nah hetupuidung kakgage ling so.<verse eid="JER 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4" />RAMPAUBE dage nnuikatei nnui hegeurum gailu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:4">nah nnuide tei mci gailu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:4">Judahme peidung nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme, meliecai a rata au mi nzwa heu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:4">nah migede cide tei mmütlu kera gah dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:4">nnui kemau tahdung ziemne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 10:16, 30:6</char></note><verse eid="JER 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nreule de Kengkap</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5" />Judah gage ndu gailo nah Jerusalem ga peu siulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:5">“Hangdeu be ga telui kwa gailo,” de eh ranglo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:5">“Gwang ncütlu. Anui rie pwa kebam namdidung ga mie go,” de eh ranglo.<verse eid="JER 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6" />Saulia kegai pailim pwa ncuhlu nah cide Zion gage sau gailu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:6">nah kwaklu kerane paklu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:6">Pak mene bam so, kedanemene Ih kengkap</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:6">ngauraume tingpeule gade nah kengkap kedi ge teugwang la dida. <verse eid="JER 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7" />Hingho ge pe mbai bam gade mpet la</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:7">nah ngauraume heleuhdung de ngkap kelabe tetpet dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:7">Pa pe bam gidi eh n deu gage kehing teugwang kera gwangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:7">n namdidung de kengkap nam ge nah migede lungh kemak nam ge tei di kera.<verse eid="JER 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8" />Cine rosopai bahlu, delwe hei eh haplu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:8">Kedanemene RAMPAUBE rata kesia de anui dade nreu di melu.<verse eid="JER 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9" />Cidau cipau benai aide tei zie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—hegwangpeidung nah kedime penui keku gah dizie. Cingkume de keheu dizie nah caihakecime penui swagah dizie.’” <verse eid="JER 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10" />Cine Ih ranggai, “Ah! RAMPAUBE Tinggwang. Nang mina aidungde nah Jerusalem de cwa cangsiak dida, ‘Nnui ziemne lungciep bam zie.’ Dede kingtie ge penui teilung ga bam dida.”<verse eid="JER 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11" />Cipau tingdau mina aidungde nah Jerusalem ziemne aide ranggai zie, “Hetaideu langkam gade tingkai kelum ge a mina napuidung dage guigwang zie. Cide ciurie kegui ge lak mede penuide tei mci lak. <verse eid="JER 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12" />RAMPAUBE aja gade gwang kela tingkai de au ciswa ci gwa zie. Cide au RAMPAUBE pekatei pe minadung reu gage tutiak gai beuzie.” <verse eid="JER 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13" />Pielo, pa hemwadung nzwa gwaketang bam, nah pe bagidung au rahang ge nzwa. Pe kündung au lingriedung swa mzet ki. Anui au kap dida, kedanemene anui au kau di delu! <verse eid="JER 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14" />Jerusalem n mlung gade kemau de hui dilo, ciciu de ncu kelilu kera ziemne. Dai tiege nang kemau lungcet mning eh bam laino? <verse eid="JER 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15" />Kedanemene makwa ge Dan namdi gade samlia teugwang la, nah kengkap gwang kela de au Ephraim lamlwatudung gade siu bam. <verse eid="JER 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16" />Heleuhdung de peu aide cet mting gailo: Pielo, Jerusalem dage deudi kemdei gade gwang eh Judah namdidung dage hereu teigai kerane ngauraume sah gailai eh kebam de reci gailu. <verse eid="JER 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17" />Penui ta kelu luh de pie twagwa kebam reketme nzwa zie, kedanemene pe minadung RAMPAUBE de renia kedine—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai— <verse eid="JER 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18" />nah nkatei tei kegai nah n tah le ma aidungde n dage teigai luda. Aide ncu peu kegai saja zie. Cide dai kenzwa gede kehing ge zie no! Cide ne n mlung reu dida.<verse eid="JER 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19" />A mlung! A mlung! Ih a mlung ga keteei de liagai lakta. A mlung au kekok süt bam dida. Ih mlei mene bam gai lakta kedanemene Ih teluidung kwa siu kecune nah reutak kwadung. <verse eid="JER 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20" />Kekap ket cai kedage gwang; deudi pelane kauzeu dida. Anui paikidung au tei ngkap zette dida, anui kehezupaidung kaknage gade tei msia dida. <verse eid="JER 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21" />Ih daitie ge reutak kehung piebam laino nah teluidung kwa kecu kwa siu bam laino? <verse eid="JER 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22" />A minadung au maang—penui au acu cima. Penui au kemieme nah penui da kecikecet gah. Penui kesia tah tei kecime, dede keyibe au teici lama.<verse eid="JER 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23" />Ih hangdeu de pie gai. Ainie! Cide au hangdeu kemrwa deu. Cika tinggimdung ziemne kebaa gah kecune. <verse eid="JER 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24" />Ih lamlwatudung ga pie gai. Ainie, cidungde mlai eh bam, nah kideutudung mlai mlüt mpet bam. <verse eid="JER 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25" />I piegai, Ainie, cika mide gah, nah tingkam nruinedung kecang de lim tetdi. <verse eid="JER 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26" />I piegai. Ainie, matsi luhdung de hetaideu nah RAMPAUBE dwa gade namdidung leune tei ngkap di, pe lunghop dwa gade.” <verse eid="JER 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ranggai, “Hangdeu pelane kengkap ge tei dizie, dede Ih cide pelane ngkap zing dilak. <verse eid="JER 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28" />Aide ziemne, hangdeu be hap zie nah tinggimdung mui dizie. Ih a kecet de ndulia kedine; Ih caisim lak; Ih cide tei mene talak. <verse eid="JER 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29" />Hekün teu kelame nah lakpi pwa kelame kwa siulu eh mina leune pak dizie. Minadung ge hegung gage pak gai zie, kedame hetialwadung ga mra hang zie. Renam leune mta dizie, nah migede cidung ga lungh dailak. <verse eid="JER 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30" />Nang cu au kap di delu, nang daipai tei lai? Nang paigie ge teu liede, kecak hetei heta le nkatei ncu mtei liede, nah n miak giak mdi lu liede, mipei ncu hengim keladung de ncu mlai dida. Meliene, penui ncu teitsetdi lai eh bam dida. <verse eid="JER 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31" />Cine Ih kehap kwa ge siu, Zion napuidung kemna tedteei mipui ge neraibe de mna eh mra kebam kwa nzwa. Cide au pa hap eh ngngi kecün kecu nzwa. Pa pe ba kezanglwe rang eh, ‘Ainie, ada kehing ge gwang zieda! Mide teiketsetme aidungde ziemne Ih au mnei reureu dida.’”<verse eid="JER 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5" />
  <para style="s">Mige de Masang ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1" />RAMPAUBE Jerusalemme dage rangzeu, “Jerusalem lampuikidung ga pak mie culo; pebamdung de pie twagwa gailo. Pecai pielu nah aide cet gailo:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:1">Nnui migede petaube tei bam eh nah masang eh bam kecu ngau lucai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:1">iciu cai Ih Jerusalem mau gidi beuzie.<verse eid="JER 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2" />Penui, ‘RAMPAUBE lunghbam,’ de eh rang liede dede penui au kenret rang.”<verse eid="JER 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3" />RAMPAUBO, nang makesang peeila meni? Nang minadung de dapgai, dede penui teei ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:3">Nang penuide ngam cangsiak dida, dede penui keledeu kegaide luulu meidi. Penui penui zu tsura swa teitak dida, nah penui penui maudung pet rau dida.<verse eid="JER 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4" />Cine Ih rangdi, “Aidungde au kegahme rünne kesang.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:4">Penui au kemieme, kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE lampuidung cima, nah penui Tinggwang zaidung de.<verse eid="JER 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5" />Ih mina kengking teu kelame da mie zie, nah penui da Tinggwang samdung rang ndu lia zie, kedanemene penui au RAMPAUBE lampuidung, Tinggwang zaidung ci kebamne.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:5">Dede penui pelane RAMPAUBE hezaidung mlai di; penui pelane Tinggwang dage ngngwa riangkeu kebam hegeuria de teicak di.<verse eid="JER 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6" />Cine hegung gade hingho ge penuide gwaketang zie. Arabah gade heneu ge ne penuide tei ngkap dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:6">Kaudauna ge penui namdidung de renia eh gwang zie. Migede penui namdi be gade hegwa le petcai penuide teurak dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:6">Kedanemene penui maudung au kiee zu kedine. Penui kenlum kegah tah keteidung de au penli gah.<verse eid="JER 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7" />RAMPAUBE Judahme dage keteu, Ih daitei mina aidungde mau gibeu laino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:7">N namedung acu püt dida nah kesang kemak rabedung de sampet teidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:7">Ih penui pok tei nggei beu, dede penui kemmha tah teidi nah penui kekiee ge helipuidung kiga tet nlüt.<verse eid="JER 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8" />Penui au ha neu kela hekündung. Penui pumteih hengim pung eh rwala. Pe kidabe nau rip de hengim bam.<verse eid="JER 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9" />Cine Ih penuide saja peu lak ni—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:9">nah heleuh ai kenzwabe dade akatei a hekum peei kerabe meni?<verse eid="JER 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10" />Pe kubeluhdung ga mie lu nah cide tei msia di. Dede cidungde ngkap zing diso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:10">Pe kiakdung su di, kedanemene cipau kiakdung de RAMPAUBE dade gwang melu.<verse eid="JER 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11" />Kedanemene Israel nah Judah ga minadung acu cwasüt di delu—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="JER 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12" />Judah nah Israel ga minadung RAMPAUBE ha kenretpe rangdi nah penui ranggai, “Pa au magede teilak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:12">keherei ting gede anui reuga gwang lak, nah anui kingtie nah herakum ngau lak.<verse eid="JER 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13" />Caihakecimedung tingkai dizie, sam be penui da gah, cine peu penui rang kegaibe penui da teicang lu.”<verse eid="JER 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14" />Cine RAMPAUBE, reugwame reu Tinggwang aide ranggai, “Nang sam aide rang kedine, pielo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:14">Ih a sam n mui gage miheu nzwa teigai beuzie, nah mina aidungde hetsing nzwa zie! Kedanemene cide ne penuide ngkap dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:29">Jer. 23:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15" />Israelme! Ih heleuh gede peu nnuide gwaketang kerane kemdei gade ngngwa gwang zie da, Israel leuhme—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:15">cide au kengking heleuh ge, heleuh kecing ge! Cide au nnui pe led cikemak leuh ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:15">mede penui kerangbe nnui cilak.<verse eid="JER 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16" />Pe lakpitsi bung au ngkei pwa kebam herau nzwa da. Penui pelane reugwamedung.<verse eid="JER 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17" />Cine penui nnui tsiudung nah ketyeipokdung tyei luzie, penui nnui napeidung nah napuidung de de teitset dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:17">Penui nnui meurün haudung, nnui tum haudung de daptset dizie; penui nnui kubebangdung nah tangzütbangdung gade petsi tyei zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:17">Rie pwa kebam nah nnui nlum kebam namdidung de tei kingtie le ngkap dizie. <verse eid="JER 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18" />Dede cipau tingdau liede—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—Ih nnuide ngkap cangsiak di kera a lungning ma. <verse eid="JER 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19" />Israel nah Judah, ‘Daitei RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang ma aidungde anui dage teigai no?’ de rang kegaidau nang, Jeremiah penui dage rang zie, ‘Nnui a dade nreu tetdi delwe nnui deu gade sangme rabedung gwa tei kecu nzwa, nnui nnui deu kemak gade cikemakme gwa tei zie.’<verse eid="JER 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20" />Jacob leuhme dage reci gai beulo nah cide peu Judah ga siulu. Aide rangbeu lu,<verse eid="JER 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21" />‘Aide kingneilu, nnui kecikecet kegah kemiemedung;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:21">nnui miak bam dede ngau gailak, nah nnui kwen bam dede nnui ma siu gailak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 28:26, Mrk. 8:18</char></note><verse eid="JER 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22" />Nnui acu hing meni—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—mede a dwa gade mbeu di meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:22">Ih heciang le pwa jaaidi deurai kai kelu nzwa, cide lwakah petgai kelak herai bam teilu kera kaibeu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:22">jaaidi mlai pet lubui, dede cide gwa le kahpet gailak. Dui nswakdung mrung lubui dede cidung kahpet gailak.<verse eid="JER 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23" />Dede mina aidungde au penui lung tak. Penui acu renia eh nreu tet dida.<verse eid="JER 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24" />Penui penui mlung gade aide rang lama, “RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang de herüt peu go, tingrui teugwang beu kelabe—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:24">kezi tingrui nah keri tingruidung—peting siak dau, anui ziemne riet pwa kela luhlüt mtakkak ting teibeu mui kelabe.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:17">Bat. 14:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25" />Nnui kemaudung ne aidungde tei gwang kera ka mzeu dida. Nnui maudung ne makeyi nnui da gwang kera tei mtak dida.<verse eid="JER 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26" />Kesiame a minadung kakga lungh bam. Penui nruinedung de keulu kera kwa kebamme nzwa piebam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:26">penui baih ge mtei gai nah mina de tuila.<verse eid="JER 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27" />Nruine perak lungga puiting kebam nzwa, penui kidung au cwa kelu niadung de le puibam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:27">Cine penui au ngking nah hei lula.<verse eid="JER 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28" />Penui lui yi dida; penui pumteih yi eh reba ha bam. Penui kesia ketei penli gah. Penui minadung kie be kiebeu lama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:28">mede nggianadung kie. Penui keherei kelame de kemzuibe peu meliede penui ma hei lula.<verse eid="JER 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29" />Ih aidungde ziemne penuide saja peu lak ni—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:29">nah Ih akatei a ziemne heleuh aikenzwa ge dade hekum peei lak ni?<verse eid="JER 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30" />Ma kehing nah miswakegah ge Israel deu ga tei dida.<verse eid="JER 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31" />Caihakecime kecwa samdung rang, nah cingkume penuikatei penui kengking le kedi tei bam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:31">A minadung aikenzwa be penui sui yila, dede kekam benai daipai tei di zieno?’”<verse eid="JER 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Ketangbam Kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1" />“Benjamin leuhme mina, kwaklu kerane peeilu, Jerusalem gade paklu eh. Tekoa namdi gade telui kwagai lu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:1">Beth Hakkerem nam gade saulia pwacuh gailu, kesiabe au tingpeule bie de gwangla; ma kengkap kedi ge gwangla da.<verse eid="JER 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2" />Zion namdi, hezukeyi nah nnwa kebam de tei msia dizie.<verse eid="JER 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3" />Hegwangmedung pe reugwame de ngngwa cika ramzeu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:3">penui ramzeukidung le namdi de tei twagwa zie; nah hangge ge kecu penui sui ga ramzeuki teizie.”<verse eid="JER 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4" />“Jerusalem gwaketang kera mteilu. Cuhlu, tingna dauge gwaketang zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:4">Ri ham dida, tingbazie cangdi lauda, iciu eh tinghegi ting kaumie gwangdi zeuda.<verse eid="JER 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5" />Dede anui tingmui gwaketang mie pe kengking reketbam tei msia dizie.”<verse eid="JER 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6" />Kedanemene reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla: “Pegu tsingbangdung bilu, delwe Jerusalem de twagwa eh gwaketang kerane mteilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:6">Aipau namdide gwa kera petau, kedanemene cide au mide ngaukerau kecu le puidi delu.<verse eid="JER 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7" />Tekwa ge dui kemci lwa bam kela nzwa, ciu eh aipau namdi de gade ma kesiabe mpet bammui la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:7">Kehebwak nah petaukemak pelung ga pui; kemra nah rejamdung a dwaga lamui dida.<verse eid="JER 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8" />Hezaikeyibe luulu, Jerusalem, meliecai Ih n dade nreu tet dizie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:8">nah Ih ncu kengkap ge tei dizie, mina lungh kemak deu ge dizie.”<verse eid="JER 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla, “Penui kubeluh ga bang kenzeu de nzwa Israel ga bang kenzeume de tui hekwa luzie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:9">N ba ketwa pet dai eh kubeluh gade kubetsi rai lulo.<verse eid="JER 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10" />Caugame dage Ih rangbeu nah mriak lulo beu de penui kingneilu zie no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:10">Pielo! Penui kwendung au hegeurum ma; penui kingneilu tadi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:10">Pielo! RAMPAUBE sam gwang penui de ledeu kera gwang, dede penui cide luneu tadi.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:51">Bat. 7:51</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11" />Dede a da RAMPAUBE rata de bam dida. Ih cide pung leubam dida. Pa a dage rang, “Lampuiki ga henamedung reu gage ruigai di</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:11">nah heluibwamedung dage. Kedanemene mina pelane de penau de si eh keuteu dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:11">nah kecingme pemmi kiee kedime de si.<verse eid="JER 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12" />Penui kidung kedame da gwang dizie, penui luhdung de nah penui naudung de ncüt eh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:12">Kedanemene Ih a bale hangdeu aide ga lungh kebamme de gwaketang zie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndukegai.<verse eid="JER 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13" />RAMPAUBE ndukegai penui keceu gade ditume pelane masangkemak mahei de hengim.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:13">Caihakecibe gade cingkube kecang, pelane mide kecwa tah teila.<verse eid="JER 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14" />Pe zi nage gade penui a minadung zamdung tei ngkei gai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:14">rang eh, ‘Kezuyi, Kezuyi,’ cika kezuyi gah kebam dau.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:10">Eze. 13:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15" />Penui kemneu tei kedi dau ngngam la ni? Penui au ngngam lama; penui dainzwa eh mizu gie dila bi ci lama!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:15">Cine penui de kau kedime kakga kau dizie; penuide saja kepeu dau penui de de teu nghung dizie, RAMPAUBE ranggai.”<verse eid="JER 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla, “Puihai ga saplwe pielo; puigwadung daiga bambi keteu lo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:16">‘Lampui keyi daiga no?’ Cika mie eh nnui ziemne kemtak bam ge peeilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:16">Dede minadung cu, ‘Anui mie lak,’ dedi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:7">Hez. 32:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17" />Ih nnui ziemne telui kwa kingnei kera reketme de kedet pwabam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:17">Dede penui keligai, ‘Anui kingnei lak.’<verse eid="JER 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18" />Cine, heleuhdung, kingneilu! Pielu, nnui zierangmedung, penuide dai nzwa di zie bi.<verse eid="JER 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19" />Siulu, kideube! Pielo, Ih mina aidungde dage kengkap teugwang beu zie da—aide penui kecet ziehi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:19">Penui a sam nah hezai mnei ma, meliene penui cide mlai dida.”<verse eid="JER 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20" />“Sheba cuikui gade perim kehengui aide a ziemne pekie dai zieno? Mede kideu kemdei gade kegwang marim kehengui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:20">Nnui keru ratakdung Ih lulak, mede nnui recadung de lu gailak.<verse eid="JER 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21" />Cine RAMPAUBE aide rang, ‘Pielu, Ih aipau Judah minadung de puikam kaibeu zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:21">Penui cipau reu gade kau mie zie—pe peime nah pe napeidung. Lungh kebamme nah penui kidame liede gah dizie.’<verse eid="JER 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22" />Cine RAMPAUBE aide rang, ‘Pielu, tingpeule deu gade mina gwangla da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:22">kideu kemdei gade heleuh kengking hereu mtei bam dida.<verse eid="JER 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23" />Penui lakpidung nah hengeidung keu ncuh luzie. Penui au zaisia nah keku kehung gah.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:23">Penui kwa duidi kemra nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:23">nah penui hekündung gade tetla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:23">ncu regi kerane, penui ngngwa hereu tei kera mtei luda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:23">Zion napui.’”<verse eid="JER 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24" />Anui penui ha de siu da nah anui badung ziakte dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:24">Lungrei ne anuide hena tedteei nzwa gumpwa dida.<verse eid="JER 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25" />Luhdung ga mie so, nah lampuidung ga tet so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:25">kedanemene ngauraume kingtiedung nah kehing le twagwa pwa bam dida.<verse eid="JER 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26" />A leuhmedung, rosopai ba lu nah mimüt ga mlak lu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:26">kepumlibe ziemne suisiet kehap nzwa keteei kwa kwalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:26">kedanemene ngaurau kengkapbe anui da zette gwang zie delu.<verse eid="JER 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27" />“Ih ne ncu teilu, Jeremiah, a mina de kedak pielo, nang hegeu kedakpie kera nzwa, ciu eh nang penui lampuidung pie nah kedak pie zie.<verse eid="JER 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28" />Penui au minadung kakgade penui lungh taktume, mi ha kenretpe rang rwapwa kelame.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:28">Penui pelane hetageu nah hegeu nzwa tak delwe samsang kemak tah teila.<verse eid="JER 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 6:29" />Mimütpingdung mi ne ru lum swet dida; mi ne hegeu de ru nggah dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 6:29">Penui de tei mci bam de kemta da, kedanemene kesiabe keu mpet di melu.<verse eid="JER 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 6:30" />Penuide le pwa rangkanggeu mlai kedibe de eh qu zie, kedanemene RAMPAUBE penuide mlai di delu.”<verse eid="JER 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7" />
  <para style="s">Masangkemak Renet au Kemta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1" />RAMPAUBE Jeremiah dage sam rang kegai, <verse eid="JER 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2" />“RAMPAUBE kirie ga saplwe sam aide rang lulo! ‘Nnui Judahme pelane, RAMPAUBE de reca zielie pe kirie ga kelwetme, RAMPAUBE sam kingnei lulo. <verse eid="JER 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israelme Tinggwang, aide ranggai: Nnui kelungh zai nah nnui teikeladung petau teilu, ciude Ih nnuide peu aipau deu ga lungh bam luzie. <verse eid="JER 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4" />Nnuide kecwa samdung de nlum sita dilu, “RAMPAUBE Kerecaki aika bam! RAMPAUBE Kerecaki aika bam! RAMPAUBE Kerecaki aika bam!” de rang eh. <verse eid="JER 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5" />Kedanemene nnui kelungh zaidung nah teikeladung petau tei lacai; nnui hangge ge dade kemzeube tei lucai, <verse eid="JER 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6" />nnui hangdeu aika lungh kebamme, sangme, nggiana nah hemipui qwadung luteu tadi, mede aika ge kemzeume jai tei lwagai tadi, nah nnui ziemne siadi kera hera kedadung de reca tadi cai, <verse eid="JER 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7" />iciucai Ih nnuide peu aipau heni ga, Ih ndaa nnui paumedung de kelungta teu lungh kera peu kedi deu ga peu lungh zie. <verse eid="JER 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8" />Ainie! Nnui au nnuide nghalu kemak kecwa samdung nlum la. <verse eid="JER 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9" />Ma rega, mide teitset, nah mmha la ni? Nnui kenret sam teu reset nah Baal dage marim kehengui reca teigai beu lani, nah nnui cikemakbe hera kedabe caisui lani? <verse eid="JER 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10" />Pecai nnui a zi teu qukela aipau kerecaki ga gwang saplwe, “Anuide kelilu da,” de eh rang la ni, iciu eh nnui kengkau ta aidungde leune teilu kerane? <verse eid="JER 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11" />Aipau kerecaki, a zi teu qukela de süt ketyeime bam lie nnui cetla ni? Dede ainie, Ih cide ngau dida—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 21:13, Mrk. 11:17, Luk. 19:46</char></note><verse eid="JER 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12" />‘Cine Shiloh nam ga kebam a kiga mielo, Ih raitu gade a zi kai kenzeu de ga, nah Ih cika a mina Israelme zaisiet ziemne daipai teibi pielo. <verse eid="JER 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13" />Cine cu, nnui heta kesia tei keladung ziemne, Ih peting peting dau nnui de ranglia, dede nnui kingnei ma. Ih nnuide gwanglo qugai, dede nnui keli beuma—aide RAMPAUBE ndugai. <verse eid="JER 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14" />Cine, Ih Shiloh ga tei kegai nzwa, a zi teu qu kebam aipau kide, nnui nlum kebam ki, Ih nnui paupaime nah nnuide kepeu ki aide gage de teigai zie. <verse eid="JER 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15" />Ih nnui sinamedung, Ephraim leuhmedung pelane de a dwa gade langgi kedi nzwa nnuide de langgi dizie.’<verse eid="JER 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16" />Jeremiah, aipaume ziemne kekie teiso, nah penui nding tei eh hap, mede kekie teiso, nah a dage kiegai helo, kedanemene Ih n kwa kingnei laklu. <verse eid="JER 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17" />Nang penui Judahme namdidung ga nah Jerusalem puidikidung ga penui dai tei labi ngau meni? <verse eid="JER 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18" />Hename tsing peei hekwala, nah mipeime mi tei! Mipuime penui tinggimdung gwangpui lie qu kela rabepui ziemne tangku ru kera tokkui henet bam, nah a rata tei kerane hera kedadung dage zau reca ruigai beula. <verse eid="JER 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19" />Penui a rata tei kesang lani?—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—penuikatei penui rata teibam meni, ciu eh penui reu ga hengam teugwang gai kera? <verse eid="JER 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20" />Cine RAMPAUBE Tinggwang aide rangzeu, ‘Pielo, a rata nah lunghop kerecaki ni aide gage ruigai zie, mina nah makaune da, luhdung ga tsingbang nah hangdeu ga matsi da. Cide heu zie nah madaude tei mmüt gailak dizie.’<verse eid="JER 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang aide rangla, ‘Nnui keru recadung de nnui ratakdung gage kai ncüt lulo nah hetei cidungde tyeilu. <verse eid="JER 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22" />Ih nnui paupaime de Egypt gade ngngwa kempet dau, Ih penui dade magede teu maisia dima. Ih keru reca nah ratakdung ziemne aja gede kai beuma. <verse eid="JER 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23" />Ih penuide aja aide rünne pwapeu, “A kwa kingnei lu, iciude Ih nnui Tinggwang luzie nah nnui a mina luzie. Cine Ih nnuide rang kebeu leune mzailu, ciude nnui ziemne yi luzie.” <verse eid="JER 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24" />Dede penui kingnei ma mede penui lung kaima. Penui lung kesia nah helung ketak lungning de teu eh penui lungh, cine penui yisi meliene sia reureu di. <verse eid="JER 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25" />Nnui paupaime Egypt gade tet mpet kedi benai gade henai kecang, Ih nnui dage a kilame pelane, a caihakecime de nnui dage langgai. Ih penuide langgai daidai gai. <verse eid="JER 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26" />Dede penui a kwa kingnei ma, mede penui lung kaima. Meliene, penui lung takdi. Penui au penui paupaime swade sia kidi.’<verse eid="JER 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27" />Penui dage sam aidungde ranglia lulo, dede penui n sam kingnei lak. Aidungde penui dage ndu gai lulo, dede penui ncu samli peulak. <verse eid="JER 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28" />Penui dage ranglo: Aipau heleuh de au RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang kwa kingnei la kemakme nah samzai teila kemakme. Kesangbe gah dida nah penui mui ga bamsi meda.<verse eid="JER 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29" />Oh Jerusalemmedung, nnui peutam biet nah taidi eh nnui peutam kelien gi dilu. Hangdeutu gade tsaibai lei teilu. Kedanemene RAMPAUBE heleuh aide de pe rata eh mlaidi nah pütdi delu.<verse eid="JER 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dapketset Langkam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30" />“Judah namedung a miakdwa gade kemau tei dida, a zi teu qukela kerecaki gage penui ngkaukela mamiedung kai eh tei hera dida, de eh RAMPAUBE ranggai. <verse eid="JER 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31" />Pecai penui nlumkemakme recabam Ben Hinnom langkam ga, Topheth gage teilu. Penui aide mipeime nah mipuime mi gage keru reca teibeu kerane teigai—Ih cide teilo samkai beu ma, mede cide a lung gade gwang ma. <verse eid="JER 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32" />Cine pielo, tingbadung gwangla da—aide RAMPAUBE ndugai—Topheth mede Ben Hinnom langkam de eh qu si lakta. Cide Teiketset Langkam dizie; penui Topheth gage ketsai paaudung kung kera pebam gahdi kemaktane kung zie. <verse eid="JER 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33" />Ketsai paaudung de tingkam ruine nah kideu ga makaune taktyei ge dizie, nah migede cidungde de gwa gidi kera gah dizie. <verse eid="JER 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34" />Ih Judah ga namdidung nah Jerusalem ga puidikidung ga suiyi nah renga kecu kwa, lakciubepei nah lakciubepui suiyi kwa peu penli tei dizie, kedanemene hangdeu de mta mrwa dizie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hos. 2:11, Jer. 16:9</char></note><verse eid="JER 7:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1" />Cipau tingdau—aide RAMPAUBE ndu kegai—penui Judah gwangpeidung, kedime, cingkume nah caihakecime, nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme radung herau gade keu mpet dizie. <verse eid="JER 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2" />Penui cidungde naimiak, hekei nah tingkam ga hegidung baa gage keu zangra gai zie; cidungde de minadung hung, penui gwatei, ma keteu nah reca gwang. Penui radungde hekwa mede kung dailak. Penui au kideu reu ga mateu nzwa bam dizie. <verse eid="JER 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3" />Heleuh kesiabe aide gade baang kelume pelane, Ih penuide gwakedi bam leune gade baangkelume, penui penui ziemne kering meliene ketsai kedet luzie—aide Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ndugai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:6">Keu. 9:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4" />Cine penui da ranglo, ‘RAMPAUBE aide rangzeu: Mige kaudi ge cuh dailu la meni? Mige gahdi ge cailigwang kera teila meni?<verse eid="JER 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5" />Daitei sui Jerusalemmedung, kenlum kegah gage nreu gaidi no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:5">Penui mamiedungde ping pwabam nah a da nreu cailigwang raula.<verse eid="JER 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6" />Ih a lung kai eh kingnei da, dede penui petaube rang ma; migede pe kesiadung ziemne helung sia ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:6">migede, “Ih dai tei di no?” de eh keteu ma. Penui pelane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:6">hekwen ge hereu gage pak kegai nzwa penui mie keneu ga miela.<verse eid="JER 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7" />Tinggim ga duirui kecang de peting siakpe ci bamla; nah cinzwa eh tamhau, tanghaine, nah duiruine dungde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:7">Penui peting siakdau limhui bamla, dede a minadung au RAMPAUBE zaidung cima.<verse eid="JER 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8" />Nnui dainzwa, “Anui au maci, RAMPAUBE zai anui da bam kecune,” de eh ranglu lai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:8">Kesang, pielo! Laisiu keraume mide kecwa kerau tiedung ne mide kecwa tatei dida.<verse eid="JER 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9" />Ma kecime ngngam dizie. Penuide kebwakdi nah keu dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:9">Ainie! Penui RAMPAUBE sam mlai dida, cine penui maci dai kemmi ge bam no?<verse eid="JER 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10" />Cine Ih penui naudung de kedame de peu zie, nah penui luhdung pwa kedame de peu dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:10">kedanemene ceutu gade ditube kecang, penui pelane de makesang kemak giedung hengim la! Caihakecime gade gwang cingkume kecang pelane kenret ta teila dida.<verse eid="JER 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11" />Penui a mina zamdung mana ge teingkei beu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:11">“Kezuyi, Kezuyi,” de rang kezuyi gah liede.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:10">Eze. 13:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12" />Penui kemneudung tei kedine ngngam lani? Penui ngngam ma; penui dainzwa ge mizu gie dila bi cima! Cine penuide kau kedime kakga kau dizie; penuide saja kepeu dau, penuide teu henah dizie, Ih RAMPAUBE rangla.<verse eid="JER 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13" />Ih penuide keugi ciak dizie—aide RAMPAUBE ndu gail—kubebang ga kubetsi bamlak, mede tangzüttsibang ga tangzüttsi bamlak. Penei regui dizie, nah Ih penuide peu kebeudung de gah dizie.<verse eid="JER 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14" />Judahme hangge ge dage rang eh, Anui daitei aika ntum bam no? Gwang mbaulu; anui riekelu namdi mie delwe cika tsai zingde bamdi go.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:14">Kedanemene RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang anuide tei zingde dizie. Pa anuide peu heiring sak zie, anui pe dage kemau teigai kedine.<verse eid="JER 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15" />Anui lungciep regui bam, dede makeyi gede bamlak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:15">Anui tei kengkei tingge regui bam, dede pielo, ngau kehing bam dizie.<verse eid="JER 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16" />Dan namdi gade ngauraume hekwendung kemra kwade siu dida. Penui hekwen kengkieng dungde mlai gaige kideu pelane keswak dila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:16">Kedanemene penui gwang eh hangdeube nah pe mabamdung ngkap dizie, Jerusalem namdi nah cika lungh kebamme de.<verse eid="JER 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17" />Cine pielo, Ih nnui kakgage henei langgai la, nnui kemeu gai kelak henei kerabedung.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:17">Cidungde nnuide nsau zie—aide RAMPAUBE ndu gai.’”<verse eid="JER 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18" />A lungrei au penli gah, nah a mlung mateei bam dida.<verse eid="JER 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19" />Ainie! Kideu kemdei gade a mina napui kemra kwa siu da! RAMPAUBE Zion ga gah ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:19">Pe hegwangpei cika bam meda ni? Iciucai daitei penui mamie tei kelube nah pemi kegah sangme rabedung le a rata tei no?<verse eid="JER 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20" />Minadung mragai, “Hepwak ting cang dida, luhlüt cang luda, dede anuide kelilu ma.”<verse eid="JER 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21" />A mina napui de tei rezam kedine acu de rezam dida. A mina napui dage ma siasüt kecu tei kegaidung ziemne Ih hap nah a lung sia dida.<verse eid="JER 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22" />Gilead cuikui ga daru gah ni? Mide teingkei kerame gah ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:22">Daitei a mina napui de teingkei beu meno?<verse eid="JER 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1" />A peu gade dui lwapet lula liecai, nah a miak miakdui reuki ge liecai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:1">Ih tingmui tingba a mina kekiee gede teitset kedi ziemne hap neulie.<verse eid="JER 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2" />Mina kangge hetaideu ga hebeuhme de peu mtaklu kebui nige acu peu cai, Ih a mina de gidi eh ladi kera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:2">Ih penuide gidi neulie, penui pelane au kemmha ta tei nah mide tuigaibeu kela maage kecune.<verse eid="JER 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3" />RAMPAUBE ndugai, “Penui kenret lakpi penui mleudung le teila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:3">dede penui masang ziemne penui kideu ga lungh ngking luma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:3">Penui kesia ge gade kesia kedage teila. Penui acu cima.<verse eid="JER 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4" />Mina leune kidame dade mriaklu maisia nah nnui siname keheibe de nlum so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:4">Kedanemene siname leune mide cwa kelame ge nah kidame leune mide rangmsia lalu.<verse eid="JER 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5" />Keheibede pe kidabe de rang msia nah kesangbe rang meda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:5">Penui mleudung mide kecwadung ledeu la. Penui kemau ketei gade mnei dida.<verse eid="JER 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6" />Nnui au mide kecwa tadung kakga bamla; penui mide kecwa ziemne acu mlai dida—aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.”<verse eid="JER 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangzeu, “Pielo, Ih penuide tei heci dai nah kedak pie zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:7">kedanemene a minadung tei kedine, Ih daipai tei si lai?<verse eid="JER 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8" />Penui mleudung au lakpitsi kemzaubedung; penui masang kemakbedung rangla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:8">Penui muile penui kidame de kezuyi sam teu mpaula, dede penui mlungdung gade au kenret kera kwa bamla.<verse eid="JER 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9" />Aidungde ziemne Ih penuide saja peulak ni—aide RAMPAUBE ndugai—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:9">nah Ih heleuh aikenzwa ge ziemne hekum peeilak ni?<verse eid="JER 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10" />Ih kideutudung ziemne hei eh hap zie, nah tseheidung ziemne tsaibai lei teizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:10">Kedanemene cidungde ru dida, cine migede cika tet kahgwang gailakta. Penui makaune kwa gede siu lakta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:10">Tingkam ruinedung nah makaunedung pak ciau dida.<verse eid="JER 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11" />Cine Ih Jerusalem de tei pwa ralie kebau ge dizie, cide maiserungdung mbai bam dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:11">Ih Judah deu ga namdidung de ralie nidung nah mina lungh kemak deudung tei dizie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:2">Isa. 25:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12" />Cauge maci eh aide ci lulai? Cau dage RAMPAUBE rang gai eh peu pecu aide rang ndu lai no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:12">Daitei eh hangdeu teimsia di, nah cide hetaideu ge nzwadi eh mina kahgwang gailak dino?<verse eid="JER 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13" />RAMPAUBE ranggai, “Ih penui dwa gage kaikebeu hezai de gi kedine, nah penui a sam kingnei ma mede cide ga tet kemakne, <verse eid="JER 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14" />dede penui lung ketak teupung eh penui peime ledeu kebeu nzwa Baal caisui kedine. <verse eid="JER 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15" />Cine reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israelme Tinggwang, aide ranggai, ‘Pielo, Ih aipaume de peu kekaa hei tyei zie nah heiring sak zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 69:21, Jer. 23:15</char></note> <verse eid="JER 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16" />Pecai Ih penuide nah penui paupaime cikemak heleuhdung dage tei zanggai dizie. Ih penuide ngkap cangdi kemaktane penuide renia kera reugwame langgai zie.’”<verse eid="JER 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide ranggai, “Aide cet gailo: tsaibai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:17">lei keteime de qu gailo; peu penuide gwanglo. Mipui kehapme de qu gailo; peu penuide gwanglo.<verse eid="JER 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18" />Penuide peu kelwa gwang anui reu gage tsaibai lei tei gailo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:18">ciu eh anui miakdui le puilu nah anui miakkum ga miakdui lwalu kerane.<verse eid="JER 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19" />Kedanemene Zion ga kehap kwa siu da, ‘Anuide dai kenzwa gede tei msiadi deno!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:19">Anui ngngam zu dida, kedanemene ngauraume anui kidung tei ngkau kedine anui hangdeu cide gi dida.’<verse eid="JER 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20" />Cine nnui mipuidung, RAMPAUBE kwa siu lulo; pe mui gade samlia kegwang de kingnei gailo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:20">Nah nnui napuime de misuikesia lei keteu beulo, nah nnui kidabe pui hangge gede tsaibai lei keteu beulo.<verse eid="JER 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21" />Kedanemene ketsai hebakidung gade gwang dida; cide anui hegwang kidung ga lüt dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:21">Cide hegwale de hename de nah heluibwame de puidikidung gade ngkap dida.<verse eid="JER 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22" />Aide ndu gailu, ‘Aide RAMPAUBE ndu kegai—mina ketsai paaudung luhdung ga mateu nzwa kau dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:22">nah luhgwetme mei penui cai gage gwet kau kenzeu nzwa dizie, nah cidungde pwa hekwalu kera migede gah.’”<verse eid="JER 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla, “Makecime de peu pe maci ziemne hegie diso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:23">mede hereu keteibe pe kengking ziemne. Ma keheibe de peu pe mahei ziemne hegie diso.<verse eid="JER 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24" />Mige maleune gade hegie lacai, peu pecu acu ci kesang nah acu ci kela rünne gade hegielu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:24">Kedanemene Ih au RAMPAUBE, a keku au lidi lama, Ih kideu ga kemzuibe nah petaube tei kelabe. Ih aidungde ga a suiyi la—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:24">aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Cor. 1:31, 2 Cor. 10:17</char></note><verse eid="JER 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 9:25" />“Pielo, tingbaziedung gwang zeu—aide RAMPAUBE ndugai—pumteihbe rünne gade hegeurum kelame de saja peu kera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:25">Rom. 2:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 9:26" />Ih saja pwa Egypt, nah Judah, Edom, Ammon, Moab, nah mina pe peutam biet dui zu kedime de saja peu zie. Kedanemene heleuh aidung pelane hegeurum luda, nah Israelme pelane samkak kelude mzai meda.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:51">Bat. 7:51</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 9:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang nah Mamiedung</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1" />Israelmedung, “RAMPAUBE nnui dage sam reci kegaide kingnei lulo.<verse eid="JER 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘Heleuh kedabe lampuidung pwa so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:2">nah tingkam ga ma rehidung de ziemne nnui lung keherei so, heleuh kedabedung au aidungde ziemne penui swagah la liede.<verse eid="JER 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3" />Kedanemene cipaume renet zaidung au pe kemmi gah.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:3">Penui tsingbang ge renaamkang gade bi ngkaulwe cide tsing rui kelabe ne ruilu.<verse eid="JER 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4" />Pecai penui cide kecak nah rangkanggeu le tei hezuyilu. Penui peu kaudi kelakne hegeuteisang nah gojal le gialu.<verse eid="JER 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5" />Penui bale teikelu cidungde au reciedung tanggaine luh ga kebam nzwa da, kedanemene cidungde au marang gailak, nah teupung mie maisia kedanemene penui tetgai kelakne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:5">Cidungde de hingso, kedanemene penui makesia teugwang gailak lu, mede cidungde makeyi kette tei gailak.’”<verse eid="JER 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6" />RAMPAUBO migede nang kenzwa ga. Nang au di, nah n zi au di nah ngkieng lie.<verse eid="JER 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7" />Cau ncu hing meno, heleuhdung gwangpei? Nang aide ngaubui siak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:7">kedanemene heleuhdung ga macitumedung pelane kakga mede hegwangramdung pelane ga migede nang kenzwa gah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:4">Keu. 15:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8" />Penui pelane nzwakap, penui maang nah mie, penui tsing le teikelu mamie reca la.<verse eid="JER 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9" />Penui Tarshish gade rangkanggeu kedeu kelu, nah Uphaz gade bata tei kecime nah hegeu ta keteime ne teikelu kecak teugwangbeu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:9">Penui paidung au gieremang nah nzai. Ma aidungde pelane matei kecime ne tei ciau.<verse eid="JER 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10" />Dede RAMPAUBE au Tinggwang kesangbe. Pa ringkela Tinggwang nah kelungta hegwangbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:10">Pe rata kegai dau kideu mlai dila, nah heleuhdung pe rata lia gailak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:6">Nah. 1:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11" />Nang penuide ainzwa rang zie, “Rabedung ting nah kideu tei kemakbedung</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:11">kideu aika nah tinggimdung kang gade de gah dizie.”<verse eid="JER 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12" />Dede Tinggwang pe kengkieng le hangdeu teilu, nah pe macile kideu teilu, nah pe kecikecet le tinggimdung tei mdi lu.<verse eid="JER 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13" />Pekwa au tinggim dungga dui kenra tei, nah pa kideu penli gade mwangrimdung keu ncuhlu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:13">Pa tingrui ziemne tingkehepik de teigai nah tingkai de pe mabung gade lungmpet beula.<verse eid="JER 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14" />Mina pelane maang dida, nah maci bam meda. Hegeule matei kelame de pa teikelu mamiedung ne tei ngngam dila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:14">kedanemene pa teikelu miedung de au kenret; cidung ga kering gah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:17">Jer. 51:17</ref>,<ref loc="JER 51:18">18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15" />Mamiedung de au kemta, mide rangmsia kelame ta; hetu ketiak benai penuide ngkap dizie.<verse eid="JER 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16" />Dede Tinggwang, Jacob mpaube, au mamie cidungde nzwa ma, kedanemene pa ne ma pelane damgai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:16">Israelme au pe mapwame, pe zi au Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE.<verse eid="JER 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17" />Nnuide mine twagwa kedi ga lungh kebammedung, nnui niadung keu hekwalu, delwe hangdeu gade tet dilu.<verse eid="JER 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE aide rangla, “Pielo, Ih cupia au hangdeu aika kelunghme de kelien gidi lai bam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:18">Ih penuide peu keherei zie, nah penui cide cilu zie.”<verse eid="JER 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19" />Ainie suisiet ada bam dida! Kedanemene a radung pang nah a zam de siaki kedine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:19">Cine Ih ranggai, “Aide au rei kesang, dede Ih lialu bi maisia.”<verse eid="JER 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20" />A paiki tei ngkau dida, nah paiki riadung pelane tüt dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:20">Penui a name de a dade ngngwa tet dida, cine penui lungh bamsi meda. Migede a paiki kam kera mede teucuh beu kera gah da.<verse eid="JER 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21" />Kedanemene meurün kekwame au maang nah penui RAMPAUBE de peei lama;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:21">cine penui lungh kiee luma, nah penui kauhau pelane zangra la dida.<verse eid="JER 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22" />Samci ge gwang lada, “Pielo! Cide gwang lada, nnui disüt kecuge tingtün lebie de gwang lada</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:22">Judah namdidung tei msiadi nah maiserung mbai bamdung teidi kerane.”<verse eid="JER 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremiah Kekie</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23" />RAMPAUBO, migede pekatei pe teilung mpaube kemak Ih ci. Migede pekatei pe puisau tei lama.<verse eid="JER 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24" />RAMPAUBO, kemzuibe teu eh acu ledeu beulo, dede n rata gade so mecai nang acu tei msiadi zielu.<verse eid="JER 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25" />Ncu ci kemakme heleuhdung nah n zi qugai kemakmedung dage n rata rui gailo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:25">Kedanemene penui Jacob de mnwa nah tyei luda ciu eh penui pecu ngkap cangsiak dida, delwe pe namdung teimsia dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 79:6">Lei. 79:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 79:7">7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 10:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11" />
  <para style="s">Samkak Gicak kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 11:1" />RAMPAUBE dade Jeremiah da sam gwang, rang eh, <verse eid="JER 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 11:2" />“Kingnei lu aipau samkak kelu samdung, nah Judah ga mina hangge ge dage ndugai beulo nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme de de. <verse eid="JER 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 11:3" />Penui da ranglo, ‘RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang aide rang: Keheibe de aipau samkak kelu samdung de kingnei kemakme de reset dida. <verse eid="JER 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4" />Aipau samkak de au Ih nnui paume de Egypt deu hegeu ru lwa kera miheu ge nzwa ge gade ngngwa mpet kelu benai gade Ih aja kai kebeude da. Ih rang, “A kwa kingnei lu nah Ih aja kai kebeudung tei lulo, kedanemene nnui a mina zie nah Ih nnui Tinggwang zie.” <verse eid="JER 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5" />A samzai teilu iciude Ih nnui paume dage sampet tei kelude kaizeu luzie, sampet kelu cide Ih penuide tungdui nah heliadui lwa kebam deu de peu kera, henai nnui lungh kebam ga.’” Iciu eh Ih, Jeremiah, keli eh rang, “Yeo, RAMPAUBO!”<verse eid="JER 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6" />RAMPAUBE a dage rang, “Aidungde Judahme deu namdidung ga nah Jerusalem ga puididung ga ndu gailo. Aide ranglu, ‘Samkak kelu samdung kingnei lu nah mzai lalu. <verse eid="JER 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7" />Kedanemene Ih nnui paupaime de Egyptme deu gade ngngwa mpet kelu benai gade henai kecang de ajadung kaibeu bam, Ih penuide rang mriak daidai eh penuide, “A kwa kingnei lu,”’ degai. <verse eid="JER 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8" />Dede n paume kingnei ma mede cet gai de ma. Keheibe de pe lung ketak nah pe lungning kesia teu tetla dida. Cine Ih aipau samkak de ga resetdung de peu penui da gwang kera tei. Dede penui cu de a sam mzai ma.”<verse eid="JER 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9" />Pecai RAMPAUBE a dage rang, “Judah ga minadung penai Jerusalem ga lungh kebamme kakga heciem tei eh ngaulu. <verse eid="JER 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10" />Penui paume kemau tei keladung ga cailigwang di, a sam kingnei mene nah cide meliene penui hera keda caisui tei reca di. Israelme penai Judahme Ih penui paume de ngngwa samkak kelu de teipang dida. <verse eid="JER 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11" />Cine RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘Pielo, Ih penui dage kengkap kai zie, kengkap cide gade penui mria di gailak. Ciciu eh penui acu qu zie, dede Ih penui de kingnei beu tadi zie. <verse eid="JER 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12" />Judah ga namdidung nah Jerusalem ga lungh kebamme mie penui ne ratak tei kela rabedung de qu zie, dede penui de kengkap tingdau cidungde ne keli gailak. <verse eid="JER 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13" />Judah n ziemne au, ngu hera kedadung kiee pwa namdidung nsam dida. Nang Jerusalem gage kengngam ratak bamdung nah Baal ziemne marim kehengui ratak bamdung pe lampuikidung kiee ge tei gai. <verse eid="JER 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14" />Cine Jeremiah, nang nkatei, aipaume ziemne kekie tei so. Penui keleu gade hei hap eh kie so. Kedanemene Ih kengkap dau penui acu qu kegai de Ih kingnei lak.<verse eid="JER 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15" />Daitei Ih hung kelame, makesia kekiee cet bam eh kerecaki ga bam lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 11:15">Nnui ratak tei kegai heteikang nnui de ngha gailak. Nnui makesia tahdung ketei gade nnui suiyi la.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:16">Lei. 50:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16" />Ndaa RAMPAUBE penui de Olive bang penei keyi, nah petsi keyi ge lie eh qulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 11:16">Dede pa cipau reu gage mi ntau gai de heratingkai kwa nzwa dizie; pe kiakdung de cum dizie. <verse eid="JER 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, nnui de ling kegaibe heta kesiadung Israelme penai Judahme tei kedi ziemne kengkap kai gaila—penui Baal de ratak tei kegaine a rata di.’”<verse eid="JER 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremiah de Kemmau Ciemkeriem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18" />RAMPAUBE acu peu aidungde ci gai, cine Ih cibam. Nang, RAMPAUBE, penui tadung de peu acu ci. <verse eid="JER 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19" />Acu au meurünna ge nzwa makau gitset kelame da ngngwa mie. Penui a dage tei gai kera riem pwa kelade Ih cima, “Anui tsingbang petsi si eh tei msia digo! Anui pecu keugi digo lunghkebam deu gade peu pe zi de nsungta di kerane.”<verse eid="JER 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20" />Ciuliede reugwame reu RAMPAUBE au kemzuibe teu tutiak tei mina mlung nah kecet pie la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 11:20">N rata penui dage kekai de Ih zierang tei zie, kedanemene Ih ne n dage a ha kaibeu lu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 7:9, Keu. 2:23</char></note><verse eid="JER 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE n teilung peei kela Anathoth nam ha ainzwa rang, “Penui rang, ‘Nnui RAMPAUBE zi gade caiha rang gailak, mecai nnui anui ba gade tsai zie.’ <verse eid="JER 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22" />Ciziemne reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ainzwa rang, ‘Pielu, Ih penuide saja peu zie da. Penui rehang keyidung kingtie gade tsai zie. Penui napeime nah napuimedung herakum gade tsai zie. <verse eid="JER 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23" />Ih Anathothme dage kengkap keugwang zie, nah penui da saja kegwang dau, migede ringbam gailak.’”<verse eid="JER 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12" />
  <para style="s">Jeremiah Kencam</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1" />Keheidau de Ih ncu ngngwa kesamlim kecudau de, RAMPAUBE, nang au masangla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:1">Ih n dage ncam kera kiebe ranglia maisia: Daitei kemaume ma teidau lu lano? Mina kenlum kegame leune ma teidau lula.<verse eid="JER 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2" />Nang penuide linggai nah penui penui mah himlu. Penui au penui tsi kei jüja bam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:2">Nang penui mui dwaga mna bamla, dede penui mlungdung gade mdeila. <verse eid="JER 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3" />Dede, RAMPAUBO, nang acu cibam. Nang acu ngaula nah a mlung n lambie ge kedak pie la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:3">Meurün de daptset kera nzwa a ngauraume de ngngwa tet dilu, nah daptset kera benai ziemne penuide mteilu!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 17:3">Lei. 17:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4" />Cika kelunghmedung kesia dene daitie ge kideube cangh nah luhdung ga mabangdung regui bam zieno?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:4">Hekaunedung nah nruinedung de keu tetdi da. Kesangbe au minadung rangla, “Anui dage daitei gai bi Tinggwang ngau lak.”<verse eid="JER 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Kesangbe, Jeremiah nang magade reugwamedung de ngngwa pak nah penui leudi liecai, nang dainzwa hekündung de renia lu laino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:5">Nang madukemak deu gade kau dicai nang Jordan reuki taiga renaam ziu gade dainzwa zie no?<verse eid="JER 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6" />Kedanemene magade n siname nah n pei kilungme ncu cwa dicai nah sahbak eh rang mci gai cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:6">penui n dage makeyibedung ranglia liede penuide nlum so.<verse eid="JER 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7" />RAMPAUBE rangla, Ih a ki <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ki </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israel</char></note>de gi dida; Ih mabam gum kerame de<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mabam gum kerame de: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kedetkelu heleuh de</char></note> nsungta dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:7">Ih acu kehungbe pui de pe ngauraume ba gage kai dida.<verse eid="JER 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8" />A maa kegumme a dade hegungkang ga hingho nzwa dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:8">pa pekatei pe kwa le acu renia kera mtei luda, cine Ih pecu ngaunghet.<verse eid="JER 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9" />Ih kehung a minadung au nruine ge, lingcingnadung ne petu pelane gade gwaketang kecu ge nzwada.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:9">Nruine de tuityeilu kerane mie delwe renaamkaune leune de qu hekwalu.<verse eid="JER 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10" />Meurün kekwame kekiee ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Meurün kekwame kekiee ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sangme kedime</char></note> ne a kubetsi luh tei msia dida. Penui a deu pelane dau msiasüt dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:10">Penui a deu hezukeyi de teipwa hetaideu ge teidi.<verse eid="JER 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11" />Penui pecu teipwa gi kedi ge tei dida. Ih pe ziemne hei eh hap; pecu gi dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:11">Hangdeu pelane de gikedi tei dida, kedanemene migede cide ziemne helung nei ta dida.<verse eid="JER 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12" />Hetaideu kehu leune ga tei ngkau kera minadung gwanglu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">kedanemene RAMPAUBE kingtie au tei ngkap eh kideutu ket lamde kedale gwang.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">Kideu cika ringkela kaune ziemne kwaklu kera gah.<verse eid="JER 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13" />A minadung wheat taa gai dede hetudung luhlwetlu. Penui au penui tahdung gade leu sütdi dede magede gie luma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">Cine RAMPAUBE rata nnui gie kelu de ziemne ngngam lulo.”<verse eid="JER 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14" />RAMPAUBE aide a kidame leune de renia eh rangla, mina kesiame Ih a mina Israel de peu gum kedi mabam dede ketang kecune, “Pielo, penuide penui deu gade keu mpetdi lai eh kebamde Ih delie nah Ih Judahme de penui kak gade teu mpet dizie. <verse eid="JER 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15" />Ih heleuhdung de pai mpet kedicai Ih penuide ngaunggia beu dai zie nah penuide ngngwa cailigwang dai zie; Ih penui hangge ge de, pa gum kera nah pe deu de keu caili beu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:3">Hez. 30:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16" />Magade heleuh cidungde sünne eh a mina lampui ci lucai a zi gade sampet eh ‘RAMPAUBE ringla’ de penui a minadung de Baal zi teu sampet eh ledeu kebeu nzwa cai, ge penuide a minadung kakga heni ge peuzie. <verse eid="JER 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17" />Dede keheibe de kingnei mecai, iciucai Ih cipau leuh dede paimpet dizie. Cide paidi bizie nah ngkap dizie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.”<verse eid="JER 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13" />
  <para style="s">Langcimpai Kiakang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1" />RAMPAUBE aide a dage rang, “Mie delwe langcimpai helungpaini ge luilu nah cide n kia gage kailu, dede cide dui gage kai raiso,” debeu. <verse eid="JER 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2" />RAMPAUBE rang kebeu nzwa Ih helungpaini ge luilu nah Ih cide a kia gage kailu. <verse eid="JER 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3" />Pecai RAMPAUBE sam pe kenabe a da gwangdai, rang eh <verse eid="JER 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4" />“Nang lui kelu helungpaini de keulu n kia ga kebamde, cu cuhlu delwe Euphrate reuki ga mie lo. Cika tangtsu kepang koiki ge gage cide hebai dilo,” dedi. <verse eid="JER 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5" />RAMPAUBE ne acu rangkebeu nzwa Ih Perath ga mie cide hebai di. <verse eid="JER 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6" />Zie kekiee ge cai RAMPAUBE a dage rang, “Cuhlu delwe Perath ga caili mielo. Cikade helungpaini de keulu Ih ncu hebai lulo kebeude,” dedi. <verse eid="JER 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7" />Cine Ih Perath<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiu kesa ga</char><char style="fqa">Perath </char> de <char style="fqa">Euphrates </char> dela. </note> ga caili mie nah Ih kebai gai kedi helungpaini de kui mpetlu, nah ainie cide teimsia dida sia cangsiak dida.<verse eid="JER 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8" />Pecai RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang rang eh cu, <verse eid="JER 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9" />“RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Ih Judah nah Jerusalem ngang süt eh kela de ainzwa eh ngkap dizie. <verse eid="JER 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10" />Judah kemaume aidungde a sam kingnei rau kelame, penui mlung ketak ga tet kelame, hera kedadung caisui eh penuide reca kera nah cidung da keumie kelame, penui aipau helungpaini de nzwa dizie pe keyi kegah de nzwa. <verse eid="JER 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11" />Kedanemene paidui mikia ga kang mtip kela nzwa, cinzwa Ih Israelme nah Judahme pelane de peu acu kezui mtip kera teibeu—aide RAMPAUBE ne rang ndu kegai—a minadung tei kera, acu hezi keyi, hetwa, nah herüt teugwang beu kera. Dede penui a sam kingnei luma.<verse eid="JER 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12" />Cine nang penui dage sam aide rangbi maisia, ‘RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla: Duibung leune de zau le teipui zie.’ Penui n dage rang zie, ‘Duibung leune de zau le teipui kera anui ci kesang meni?’ <verse eid="JER 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13" />Cine penui dage ranglo, ‘RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Pielo, Ih aipau deu ga kelunghme leune de peu zau sak kemie le pui di kera, hegwangmedung David hegwang bam ga kebamme, cingkume, caihakecime nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme leune. <verse eid="JER 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14" />Iciu eh Ih hangge ge reu gage kedeu gai zie, mipeidung nah hename ncüt eh—aide RAMPAUBE ne rang ndu kegai—Ih penuide nggia lak mede a lung sialak, nah kengkap gade penuide bang beulak.’”<verse eid="JER 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15" />Israelme, RAMPAUBE ranggai beuda. Ngangdi mene, kingnei sünne lu.<verse eid="JER 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de rütlu pa kemuibe teugwang di kemak dwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:16">nah pa peu nnuide tingmui lamlwa gade kaukedi dwage.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:16">Kedanemene nnui kebaa reguila, dede pa heni de tei muiting dizie, kemui mwa ge tei dizie.<verse eid="JER 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17" />Cine magade nnui kingnei mecai, Ih akatei hap zie nnui ngang kelade ziemne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:17">A miak hap bi zie nah miakdui lwa zie, kedanemene RAMPAUBE minadung de hebaang tei kedine.<verse eid="JER 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18" />“Hegwangpei nah hegwangpui dage ranglo, ‘N hegwang bam gade nghunglu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:18">kedanemene kendu peurwa nnai peu gade nghai mie di delu,’ de eh.<verse eid="JER 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19" />Negev ga namdidung de ngkui dizie, cide ngkei kera migede gah. Judahme leune de hebaang tei dizie, hebaangme teiciak dizie.<verse eid="JER 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20" />N ngauraume tingpeule gade gwang kelabe de pielo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:20">Pa ne kepeu n minadung dai ga lano, n dade hezu yisüt kecu minadung?<verse eid="JER 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21" />Nang n zangme lie cet kela minadung de Tinggwang nreu kedi tei kedidau nang daipai rang lai no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:21">Aidungde kemna tedteei, mipui kemna dau keteei nzwa nda gwang kera pemdeube de meni?<verse eid="JER 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22" />Iciu eh nang n mlung gade rang lubui, ‘Daitei ma aidungde a dage teigai zeu no?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:22">Cide n bata kesia kekiee ge ziemne mige n lituidung tei hakdi nah ncu teu teidi.<verse eid="JER 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23" />Ethiopia ga mina ketiakme ge penui geu pegiak de tei kedi lubui ni, mede kaudauna giakdung tei kedi lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:23">Iciucai, nnuikatei kesiabe le nnui zai teibam liede, keyibe tei lubui.<verse eid="JER 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24" />Cine Ih penuide tsiurie de hangdeuketsai tingkai ne guipung kela nzwa teizang dizie.<verse eid="JER 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25" />Aide Ih nnuide peu dida, Ih kepeu zai de—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:25">kedanemene nnui acu nsungta dida nah kecwa de de nlum dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:13">Jer. 2:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26" />Cide ziemne Ih ne n lituidung gau dizie nah n hengamdung de ngau dizie.<verse eid="JER 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27" />Ih nang kemmha de ngau da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:27">kideutudung ga nah luhdung ga n kemaudung nah helili kecu de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:27">nah kengkau aidungde Ih ngau da!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:27">Jerusalem, n dade suisiet! Ncu tei mci dailu kera daitie ge zie no?”<verse eid="JER 13:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14" />
  <para style="s">Duicang, Herakum, Kiengtie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1" />Aide RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah da kegwang dui kecangh ha,<verse eid="JER 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2" />“Peu Judah de haplo; pe namdidung de peu kaudi lo. Penui penui deu ziemne hap eh sah bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:2">penui Jerusalem ziemne hap reureu bam dida.<verse eid="JER 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3" />Judah kedime dui peei kera penui kilame de langgai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:3">Penui hekwaki ga mie, ge dui ngau luma. Penui pelane teidaulu mene cailigwang;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:3">penui ngngam nah hengam pungdi eh penui peu gum di.<verse eid="JER 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4" />Aide ziemne hangdeube rekakti, kedanemene kideube ga tingrui kemakne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:4">Luh kepumedung ngngam eh penui peudung kezui.<verse eid="JER 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5" />Hetipui kecang de pena de luhdung gage pütdi nah penuide gidi, cika tsehei gah kecune.<verse eid="JER 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6" />Magede kegah langkiedung ga renaam gadhadung sap nah penui maiserungdung nzwa tingkai ga ngicün bam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:6">Penui miakdung peta tei ma kedanemene cika tsehei kegah ne.”<verse eid="JER 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7" />Anui maudung mdu eh anuide mmau liede, RAMPAUBE n zi gade tei beulo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">Kedanemene anui kenlum kegah tadung kiee reureu bam; anui n dage kemau tei dida.<verse eid="JER 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8" />Nang Israel Keregui be, keherei kelu tingdau pecu kelikelube,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">nang daitei hangdeube gade sangme ge nzwa laino, hegwame ge rwapwa eh zeuziu ge rünne bam kegai nzwa?<verse eid="JER 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9" />Daitei nang pe swagah eh kelame ge nzwa dino, mede reugwame ge kelilu kera kengking kegah nzwa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">Nang anui kakga la, RAMPAUBO, nah anui reuga n zi de qu. Anuide püt diso!<verse eid="JER 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10" />RAMPAUBE aide minadung aidungde dage rangla: “Penui rwa pwala neula, penui ciciu kecu gade penui pi teu caili lama.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:10">RAMPAUBE au penuide pesui meda. Cu au penui tah kesiade peu nsung luzie nah penui maudung ziemne saja peu zie. <verse eid="JER 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11" />RAMPAUBE a dage rang, “Mina aidungde keleu gade makeyibe kie so. <verse eid="JER 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12" />Penui mmwang liede, Ih penui kesah kwa kingnei lak nah penui keru ratak nah ketyeipok ratak pwapeu de Ih cidungde a suiyi lak, kedanemene Ih cidungde kingtie, herakum nah rapia le tei nggah dizie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:18">Eze. 8:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13" />Pecai Ih rang, “Oh, RAMPAUBO! Ainie! Caihakecimedung minadung dage rangla, ‘Nnui kingtie ngaulak; nnui ziemne herakum bamlak, kedanemene Ih aipau heni de ga kwak kelu kesangbe peu zie.’” <verse eid="JER 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14" />RAMPAUBE a dage rang, “Caihakecimedung a zi gade kecwa sam rangla. Ih penuide langgai ma mede Ih penuide aja gede mede penui dage maranglo peu ma. Dede kecwa mangaudung nah kemtabe penuikatei penui lungdung gade kecwa caihadung penui n dage rangla.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:6">Eze. 13:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15" />Cine RAMPAUBE aide rangla, “Caihakecime a zi gade caiha rangla dede Ih ne langmpet kemakpe aipau deu ga kingtie mede herakum bamlak lie rang kelame, caihakeci aidungde kingtie mede herakum gade gah dizie. <verse eid="JER 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16" />Iciu eh penui ne ranggai kebeume de helingpwa Jerusalem puidiki gage kai dizie herakum nah kingtie de ziemne, kedanemene migede penuide kung kera gah dizie, penui naudung, penui napeidung mede penui napuidung, kedanemene penui kesiadung Ih penui dage rui gai zie.<verse eid="JER 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17" />Jeremiah, aipau sam de penui dage ranglu: ‘Peu tingmui tingba a miakdui lwalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:17">Peu penuide mtak so, kedanemene a mina kemci napui kau mdisüt zie delu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:17">kedi ge nah yi gai kelak zam ge.<verse eid="JER 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18" />Ih luh ga miede, cika kingtie ne teitset kedidung bam!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:18">Ih namdi be ga gwang cai, cika herakum ne teikegai mateeidung bam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:18">Caihakecime nah cingkume hangdeu be ga rwala nah penui cima.’”<verse eid="JER 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19" />Nang Judah de mlai cangsiak di deni? Nang Zion de ngaunghet ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:19">Daitei anuide tei keherei zie no anuide tei kengkei kegah ga? Anui kezuyi de regui, dede cika pe keyi gede gah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:19">nah tei ngkei ting ge ga, dede pielo, cika kehing rünne.<verse eid="JER 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20" />RAMPAUBO anui maudung anui paume kemneidung n dage rangla, kedanemene anui ncu renia eh mau dida kecune.<verse eid="JER 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21" />Anuide mlai diso! N zi ziemne, n hegwangbam kendu de gage hengam tei diso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:21">Nsung gailo nah anuide ngngwa samkak de teipang diso.<verse eid="JER 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22" />Heleuhdung gu pemi teikemak mamiedung ne tingrui teugwang ni? Mede tinggimdung katei tingrui lang nghung lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:22">RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang nang ne meni? Anui ncu kwabam, kedanemene nang ne ma aidung pelane teigai.<verse eid="JER 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1" />Cipaucai RAMPAUBE a dage rangdi, “Moses mede Samuel a dwaga sapbam liede, Ih mina aidungde dage ngaugia pwalia si lakta. Judahme de a dwade langgi dilo, peu penuide tetdi kerane. <verse eid="JER 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2" />Iciude penui n dage rang zie, ‘Anai daiga mielai?’ Iciude nang penui dage rang maisia, ‘RAMPAUBE aide rangla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:2">Tsai kerame ziemne ketsai da mie maisia; kingtie ziemne kecume kingtie da mie maisia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:2">Herakum ziemne kecume herakum da mie maisia; nah hebaang tei kerame hebaang ketei ga mie maisia.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:10">Keu. 13:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3" />Kedanemene Ih penuide zi mdai teigai zie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—kingtie kangge de teitset kera, heteudung kangge de gwagi kera, tingkam ruinedung nah kideu teikuudung kangge de tyei lu nah ngkapdi kera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:8">Keu. 6:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4" />Ih kideu ga hegwangram leune dage kehing ge teigai zie kedanemene Judah gwangpei, Hezekiah napei Manasseh, Jerusalem dage tei kegaide ziemne.<verse eid="JER 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5" />Kedanemene caune ncu nggia zieno, Jerusalem? Cau n ziemne helungsia laino?<verse eid="JER 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6" />Nang acu nsungta dida—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—nang a dade caili dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:6">Cine Ih a bale ncu tei zie nah ngkap dizie. Ih ncu ngaunggia kecude leu dida.<verse eid="JER 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7" />Cine hangdeube namdi rieki gade Ih tsingdap le penuide keuntsam dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:7">Ih peu penui suisia bam dizie. Ih a minadung de ngkap dizie, penui penui lampui gade cailigwang dai melu.<verse eid="JER 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8" />Ih penui hemipuidung de jaaidi kungga heciang swa kiee eh teigai zie. Rehangme puidung de renia eh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:8">kengkap be tingnari dau langgai zie. Ih zette eh kekeheu nah kehing penui reu gage kai zie.<verse eid="JER 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9" />Mipui pena hang hena kebam de sia eh mnei dizie. Pecu keheu dizie. Tingkeba dau de pe tingnaimiak nlüt dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:9">Pa ngngam nah hengam pung dizie, kedanemene bang kelume de penui ngauraume kebam gade Ih kingtie dage peu dizie—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:9">aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.”<verse eid="JER 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10" />A pui a dage suisiet! Kedanemene nang acu mnalu. Ih hangdeube ga mide renia nah kesamlim kelame ge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:10">Ih migede de releu beu ma mede migede a dade releu ma dede penui pelane acu reset.<verse eid="JER 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11" />RAMPAUBE rangla: “Keyibe ziemne Ih ncu kelilu lakni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:11">Ih n ngauraume de peu kengha kie kera teibi zie kengkap nah keherei tingdau.<verse eid="JER 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12" />Mige hegeu zum lubui ni? Bamkapde hegeu tingpeule de hetageu ncüt kelube?<verse eid="JER 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13" />Ih n ngauraume de n mahei nah n mabam peu mta sütteu dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:13">Ih aide tei zie kedanemene n mau leune ngu herai leune gade tei kedi de ziemne.<verse eid="JER 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14" />Iciu eh Ih nnuide peu cikemakme deu ga nnui ngauraume gwa teizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:14">kedanemene mi ge heu cuh zie, cide a lunghop gade ncu mmau eh mi twa cuh kegai.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiudung kesa ga</char><char style="fqa">Ih nnuide peu nnui ngauraume gwa tei zie, </char> de mene <char style="fqa">Ih nnui ngauraume de peu nnuide nggnwa teu dizie</char> de eh bam. </note><verse eid="JER 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15" />RAMPAUBO, nang cibam! Acu nsung eh acu nghalo. Acu mneu kelame de renia eh hekum a ziemne teugwang beulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:15">Nang au nlung tie, dede penuide peu acu ngngwa tet diso; Ih n zi ziemne keherei eh ngngam kecu ci lulo.<verse eid="JER 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16" />N samdung ngaulu, nah Ih cidungde luulu da. N samdung a dade a suiyi ge</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:16">nah a mlung suiyi ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:16">kedanemene Ih n zi de teula, RAMPAUBO, reugwame reu Tinggwang.<verse eid="JER 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17" />Ih hengyi renga kebamme kakga bam ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:17">Ih akatei rünne bam kedanemene n kengkieng ba de ziemne nang acu rata le peu puibam.<verse eid="JER 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18" />Daitei acu peu teei jüja bamno nah a zam yi gailak dino, daitei cidungde ngkeilu meno?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:18">Nang a dade kecwa duidung nzwa zieni, cangdi kela duidung?<verse eid="JER 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19" />Cine RAMPAUBE aide keligai, “Jeremiah, nang n mau pet lucai, Ih ncu teu cailigwang beuzie nah nang a dwaga sap eh a gwa tei zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:19">Magade nang pemi kehungdung gade kemiedung teuntsam lucai, nang a samgwame ge nzwa zie. Minadung n da cailigwang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:19">dede nang penui da caili mielak.<verse eid="JER 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20" />Mina aidungde dade Ih ncu teipwa hetageu tangdeu kuitiep lula kemakpe nzwa teibeu zie, nah penui ncu renia eh hereu tei zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:20">Dede penui ncu ngam gailak, kedanemene Ih ncu kelilu kera ngngwa la—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—<verse eid="JER 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21" />kedanemene kesiame ba gade Ih ncu kelilu zie nah zaisietme ba gade ncu ri luzie.”<verse eid="JER 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16" />
  <para style="s">Kengkap Tingba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1" />Pecai RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang dai eh rang, <verse eid="JER 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2" />Pa a dage marang, “Nkatei n ziemne henau teiso, nah heni aikade nkatei n ziemne n napeidung mede n napuidung bamso. <verse eid="JER 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 16:3" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE heni aide gade mna kelu napeidung nah napuidung, penuide telakpung kelu puidung, nah mipeidung aipau deu gage penuide mna kera tei kegaimedung dage aide rangla, <verse eid="JER 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 16:4" />‘Penui ketsai mateei gade tsai zie. Penuide hei mede kunglak. Penui hangdeu ga niara nzwa zie. Kedanemene penui kingtie nah herakum gade kekambe dizie, nah penui paaudung au tinggim ga nruine nah kideu ga teikuudung taktyei tei dizie.’<verse eid="JER 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang eh rang, ‘Hei eh kebam kiga lütso. Penui ziemne hei mede kenggia kecu keulia kera mieso, kedanemene a kezuyi, keku nah ngaugia mina aidungde dade keu tetdi delu, aide RAMPAUBE ne rang ndu kegai. <verse eid="JER 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6" />Kedime de nah keceume de aipau deu gade tsai zie. Penuide kunglak nah migede penui ziemne hei lak mede penui ziemne migede pekatei penuide dang mede pe lungrei liagai kerabe penui peu tai lak. <verse eid="JER 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7" />Ketsaime de hei kebamme de tei relui gai kera migede ketyeipok peu lak nah migede ziune kelu piak pwa pe pei mede pe pui de peu lak. <verse eid="JER 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8" />Nnui hengyi kebam ki gega penuide ngngwa bam eh tyei mede sak kera mie lak.’ <verse eid="JER 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9" />Kedanemene reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla, ‘N miak kena dwaga pielo nnui tingdau nah aipau heni ga a suiyi kwa nah misuikeyi kwa, lakciupei kwa nah lakciupui kwa penli tei dizie da.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:23">Keu. 18:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10" />Cipaucai nang sam aidung pelane mina aidungde dage pau beuzie, nah penui ncu rangzie, ‘Daitei RAMPAUBE anuide renia eh kengkap kedi aidung pelane kaino? Anui RAMPAUBE Tinggwang dage daipai kesia ge nah kemau ge teigai no?’ <verse eid="JER 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11" />Cine penui dage ranglo, ‘Kedanemene nnui paumedung acu gi kedine—aide RAMPAUBE ne rang ndugai—nah penui hera kedadung da mie penuide reca nah penui da keumie. Penui acu gidi nah a zai kainzeu ma. <verse eid="JER 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12" />Dede nnui nnuikatei de nnui paume swade kesiadung teusi gwang, kedanemene pielo, hangge ge kecu pe mlung kesia ketak ga tetla, cika migede a kwa kingnei ma. <verse eid="JER 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13" />Cine Ih nnuide hangdeu aikade kelienpwa nnui cikemak deu gage kai dizie, nnui mede nnui paumedung cikemak, nah nnui cika tingmui tingba hera kedadung de reca zie, kedanemene Ih nnuide magede ngha lak.’<verse eid="JER 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14" />Cine, ainie, tingbaziedung gwang lada—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—cidau, ‘RAMPAUBE ring kela nzwa, Egypt deu gade Israelme de ngngwa mpet kebeube,’ de eh rangsi ta dizie, <verse eid="JER 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15" />dede, ‘RAMPAUBE ringkela nzwa tingpeule bie deu gade nah penuide teizang kegaibe deu gade Israelme de ngngwa cuh kebeube.’ Kedanemene Ih penui paume de peu kedibe deu de ga penuide ngngwa cailigwang beuzie.<verse eid="JER 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16" />Ainie! Ih heka keteime kekiee ge de gwang mina aidungde de tui lulo langgaila—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—penui heka tui kela nzwa Judah minadung de tui mpet zie. Aipaucai Ih rehume kekieege de langgai zie iciu eh penui penuide lamlwatu leune ga peei zie nah kideutudung ga nah tsupop koikidung ga. <verse eid="JER 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17" />Kedanemene a miak au penui lampui leune ga la; a dwa gade penuide hebai gailak. Penui sietdung de a miak dwa gade hebai gailak. <verse eid="JER 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18" />Ih keraibe penui sietdung de nah kemau ziemne ci kena kieege peu caili zie. Penui luneu kemak rabe miedung teu a deu tei hera, nah penui a magum de luneu kemak rabedung le teipui kedine.”<verse eid="JER 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19" />RAMPAUBO, nang a kengkieng be nah a kemsiube, kengi tingdau acu gum kwak kebeube.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 16:19">Kideu penlidung gade heleuhdung n da gwang eh rang zie, “Kesangbe anui paumedung mide kecwa de gumlu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 16:19">Penui au mrwa; penui da gie kecu gah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:25">Rom. 1:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20" />Mina penuikatei penui ziemne rabedung tei lani? Dede cidung au rabedung ma.”<verse eid="JER 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21" />Cine pielo! Ih penuide peu cilu kera aipau tingga tei gai zie, Ih penuide peu a ba nah a kengkieng de cilu kera tei gai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 16:21">iciu eh a zi au RAMPAUBE lie kecu penui ci luzie.<verse eid="JER 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Judah mau au hegeu kemzau tie tangtsu pemikehung kebam mui ge le rau teula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:1">Cide penui mlung kwak gage nah penui recabam kimiakdung gage heri teula.<verse eid="JER 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2" />Penui namedung kecangde penui recabam nah herabepui Asherah tsiadung nsungla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:2">cidungde kideutu kehudung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nlum kemak reca nidung</char></note> ga tsingbangdung tai ga bam.<verse eid="JER 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3" />Deudi kenza a lamlwatu ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:3">nah Ih n ngauraume de n mahei nah n mabam leune de ketang eh peu dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:3">nnui kehubamdung si eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:3">kedanemene nnui deu pelane gage nnui kemau teigai kedi de ziemne.<verse eid="JER 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4" />Ih nnuide peu kedi mapwa de nnui tei nggah dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:4">Ih nnuide pwa nnui ngauraume ba gage kai dizie, nnui cikemak deu gage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:4">kedanemene nnui mi mtaupwa a rata gage kai, cide kelunghta heu bam zie.”<verse eid="JER 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Mina de nlum kelame au reset pung zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:5">pa pe teih le pe kengking tei dede pe mlung be RAMPAUBE dade nreutet dida.<verse eid="JER 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6" />Kedanemene pa au Arabah ga tseheibang keceuna ge nzwa nah makeyibe kegwang ngaulak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:6">Pa tsura ni hetaideu ga bam zie, magede lunghla kemak deu ga.<verse eid="JER 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7" />Dede RAMPAUBE de nlum kelume au samlam pung, kedanemene RAMPAUBE au pe keregui be.<verse eid="JER 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8" />Kedanemene pa au tsingbang ge duireukung gage ling kegai nzwa, pe mahdung hereu gwale him pet zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:8">Cide kelum kegwang dau hinglak, kedanemene peneidung au mdiak bammui la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:8">Cide tingrui kegah dau lungrei bam lama, nah cide petsi kei kecu mtak lak.<verse eid="JER 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9" />Mi mlung au ma kedabe swa mide cwa kila. Cide au sia; caune cide cilu laino?<verse eid="JER 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10" />Ih au RAMPAUBE mi lungbe peei kelabe, mlungdung kedakpie kelabe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:10">Ih hangge gede pe zai rehi gade peula, pe bata tsi de rehi gade.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pet. 1:17, Keu. 2:23, 20:12-13, 22:12</char></note><verse eid="JER 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11" />Nruine ge pane mbum kemak bumdung gum lubui. Mina kangge masang kemak gade hei lubui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:11">dede pe tingbadung pempie ge cang kedidau, mahei cidungde pecu pütdi zie nah kekam le pa kemieme ge dizie.”<verse eid="JER 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12" />“Anui kerecaki au hegwangbam kendu bam ge, raitu gade kehu ge.<verse eid="JER 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13" />RAMPAUBE au Israel gu kereguibe. Ncu gikedi leune de hengam gage kai dizie; n dade nreu tet kedime zi kideu gage raugai dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:13">kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE, keringdui rwak de gi kedine.<verse eid="JER 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14" />Acu tei ngkei beulo, RAMPAUBO, iciude Ih yilu zie! Acu keli lulo, nah Ih keli luzie. Kedanemene nang au a ketwa lei lie.<verse eid="JER 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15" />Pielo, Judahme a dage kerang, ‘Daiga RAMPAUBE sam lano? Cide peu gwanglo!’<verse eid="JER 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16" />A ziemne au, Ih meurün kekwabe n caisui kela gade pak tetdi ma. Ih kengkap tingba de de regui ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:16">Nang cibam a muileu gade ndu lia kegaide, cidungde nang kebam gade rang.<verse eid="JER 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17" />A dade kengngi ge diso. Kengkap tingba benai nang acu kegumbe.<verse eid="JER 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18" />Acu gwa kelame de peu ngngam dilu, dede peu acu ngngam diso. Peu penuide penui sui siasüt dilu, dede acu peu a sui siasüt diso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:18">Penuide renia eh kengkap tingba langgai lo nah kengkap aide kena kiee ge teu eh penuide teizang dilo.”<verse eid="JER 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sabbath Mci Bamkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19" />RAMPAUBE aide a dage rang: “Mie delwe mina kirie ga saplu Judah gwangpeidung nlüt nah mpet daidi kela ga, pecai Jerusalem kiriedung leune ga. <verse eid="JER 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20" />Penui dage ranglo, ‘RAMPAUBE sam kingnei lulo, Judah gwangpeidung nah Judah ga mina leune, nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme aipau kiriedung gade nlüt kela leune. <verse eid="JER 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla: “Nnui teilung de ziemne sünne lu nah Sabbath<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme kemtak tingba</char></note> tingba dau hepüt ge de Jerusalem riekidung ga punggwang kerane punglak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:10">Jhn. 5:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22" />Kemtak benai hepüt ge de nnui kilung gade pung gwang so. Mata gede teiso, Sabbath tingba de teu ntsamlu, Ih nnui paumedung de aja kai kebeu nzwa.”’ <verse eid="JER 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23" />Penui kingnei ma mede helung kaima, dede penui lung takbak di iciu eh penui a kwa kingnei ma mede a keledeu de luuma.<verse eid="JER 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24" />Magade nnui kesang tei eh a kwa kingneilu liecai—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—nah aipau namdi kiriedung ga Sabbath benai hepüt ge de punggwang mecai, meliene Sabbath de keu ntsam pwa RAMPAUBE de peulu nah cidau mata ge de tei mecai, <verse eid="JER 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25" />iciucai hegwangpeidung, hegwangpei name nah David hegwangbam ga bam kelame aipau namdi riekidung ga Judah ga minadung nah Jerusalem namdi ga kelunghme penui nah penui muiteume bagidung nah hekündung reuga cwa eh gwang zie, nah aipau namdi de ga minadung lungh bammui luzie. <verse eid="JER 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26" />Penui Judah namdidung gade gwang zie nah Jerusalem twagwa kebam gade, Benjamin deu gade nah hangdeu kehenadung gade, lamlwatudung gade nah Negev gade gwang zie, penui mei reca nah perim kehengui, ketwa reca teu eh RAMPAUBE kiga gwang zie. <verse eid="JER 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27" />Dede nnui a kwa kingnei mecai, Sabbath tingba keu ntsam kera de nah hepüt kerüt pung kelak de nah Jerusalem riekidung ga Sabbath benai lüt kelak de, iciucai Ih kiriedung gage mi mtau gai zie, nah cide ne Jerusalem kudadung de ngkap dizie, nah cide tei mmüt gailak dizie.”<verse eid="JER 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18" />
  <para style="s">Liketeibe ki ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1" />RAMPAUBE dade Jeremiah da sam gwang eh rang, <verse eid="JER 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2" />“Cuhlu delwe li keteibe ki ga mielo, kedanemene Ih ncu peu cikade a sam kingnei zie,” debeu. <verse eid="JER 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3" />Cine Ih li keteibe kiga mie nah ainie! Li keteibe kemruita teu matah teibam. <verse eid="JER 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4" />Dede pa lidei gade li tei kebam de li keteibe ba gade siadi, cine pa cide lidei tei dailu delwe li kedage tei dailu, nah pa li cide teipwa mania pe miakngau gade keyi ge teilu.<verse eid="JER 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5" />Pecai RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang eh rang, <verse eid="JER 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6" />“Ih nnui Israelme dage aipau li keteibe de nzwa teigai lakni?—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai. Ainie! Li keteibe ba ga lidei kebam nzwa eh, nnui Israelme a ba ga bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:21">Rom. 9:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 18:7" />Peting ge ga, Ih heleuh ge mede hegwangram ge ha rang mci lia lubui, cide Ih gwa gi dizie, cide tei msia dizie, mede tei ngkap dizie. <verse eid="JER 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 18:8" />Dede Ih heleuh ha rang mci kegaide kemau gade nreu lucai, Ih kengkap de cika teugwang gai zie lie cet kelude mtak dizie.<verse eid="JER 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 18:9" />Keda tingdau, Ih heleuh ge mede hegwangram ge ha madungge rang mci lia lubui, cide Ih tei ncuh beu kera mede linggai kera. <verse eid="JER 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 18:10" />Dede cide a kwa kingnei mene a miak dwa gade kesiabe teicai, iciucai Ih penui dage makeyi teigai zie lie rang kebeude mtak dizie. <verse eid="JER 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11" />Cine cu, Judah ga minadung dage nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme dage ranglo, ‘RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Pielo, Ih nnui dage kengkap ge teigai lai zeu da. Ih nnuide renia keraciem mariem ge teigai zie da. Mi hangge ge kecu kemau lampui gade kemau petlu iciude nnui lampui nah nnui tei kelade ne nnuide makeyi teugwang beuzie.’ <verse eid="JER 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12" />Dede penui keli zie, ‘Aide pe keyi gah. Anuikatei mariemdung de nzwa eh teizie. Anui hangge ge kecu kesiabe tei zie, ketak mlungbe teineu kelade.’<verse eid="JER 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘Heleuhdung de keteulo cauge ma aikenzwa siu lano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:13">Kemci Israel ngaukehing ge tei dida.<verse eid="JER 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14" />Lebanon ga buising madauge tsura deutudung pütdi ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:14">Lamlwatu reuceudung kemdei gade lwa gwang kelade sia di lani, kengkung reuceudung de?<verse eid="JER 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15" />Dede a minadung acu nsungta dida. Penui penui mapeu pwa kemta rabemiedung de peu nah penui penui lampui gade kaumie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:15">penui ndaa lampui de gi dida lampui ketsam ge ga tet kerane.<verse eid="JER 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16" />Penui deu de kehing ge dizie kelungta luu gai kelak ge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:16">Tetkah kegwang leune mbeu dizie nah penui suiga eh penui peungum zie.<verse eid="JER 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17" />Naimiak kepetle kaigui nzwa eh Ih penui ngauraume dwa gade penuide teizang dizie. Penuide kengkap tingba benai Ih penuide a zu pung lialak dede a caile punglia zie.’”<verse eid="JER 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18" />Cine minadung hangge ge de rangla, “Gwanglu, anui heciem riem eh Jeremiah de mmau go, kedanemene hezaibe cingkume dade madaude gah di laklu, mede makecime ne rang kebeude, mede caihakecime samdung de. Gwanglu, anui au anui samdung teu pecu ketang go nah pa rang ndu kegaidung gage anui lung kai ta go.”<verse eid="JER 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19" />A ma pie eh acu ngha lo, RAMPAUBO, a ngauraumedung a ha rang kebam de siu gailo.<verse eid="JER 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20" />Penui dage yi kegaide ziemne kengkap de le a ziehi kesang zie deni? Kedanemene penui a ziemne makoiki ge kuilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:20">Ih n dwa ga sap eh penui ziuyi ziemne kerangde nsung gailo, n rata de penui dade caili di kerane.<verse eid="JER 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21" />Cine penui namedung de pwa herakum gage kailo nah penuide pwa kingtie teu kelame ba gage kai dilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:21">Ciu eh peu penui mipuidung de kap kedi nah hemipuidung tei dilu, nah mipeidung de teitsetdi nah rehangmedung de peu hereu gade kingtie le teitsetdi lu.<verse eid="JER 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22" />Peu penui kidung gade kengngi kwa siulu nang zette eh penuide renia kera ketuime de ngngwa kegwang dau.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:22">Kedanemene penui acu tuilu kera makoiki ge kui luda nah a pi ziemne hetakdung hebai pwabam.<verse eid="JER 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23" />Dede nang, RAMPAUBO, penui mariem leune cibam acu renia eh teitset kera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:23">Penui kesiadung nah kemaudung gibeu so. Penui maudung n dade kemai diso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:23">Iciu meliene, penuide n dwa gade kelien gi dilu. Nang n rata kebam dau penui dage n ta tei gailo.<verse eid="JER 18:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1" />RAMPAUBE aide ranggai, “Miecu nah nang Jewme muiteume nah cingku kecingme de ngngwa keladau lidei li ge luilu. <verse eid="JER 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2" />Delwe Ben Hinnom Langkam ga Pang kedi Li Kirie kenlüt ga tet pet cu, nah Ih n dage rang lai eh kebam samdung de cikade sah lo. <verse eid="JER 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3" />Ranglo, ‘RAMPAUBE sam kingnei lulo, Judah gwangpeidung nah Jerusalem namdi ga kelunghmedung! Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rang bam, “Pielo, Ih aipau bam ga kengkap teu gwang lai eh bam dida, nah siu kelu leune kwendung ga cide tung tau zie. <verse eid="JER 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4" />Ih aide teigai zie kedanemene minadung acu püt zingdi nah aipau bam de tei hera kedine. Aipau bam gade penui ci kemak keda rabedung dage penui ratakdung tei gai beu zie. Penui, penui paumedung, nah Judah gwangpeidung liede aipau bam gage mau kemakme jaile tei puidi. <verse eid="JER 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5" />Penui Baal gu reca bam kecehu bamdung tei lwe mi gage pe napeimedung de ru eh pe dage keru ratakdung teigai, Ih ne aja kaibeu kemakpe mede rang beu kemakpe, mede cide akecet ga nlüt kemakpe.<verse eid="JER 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6" />Cide ziemne, pielo, petingba ziedung gwang la dida—aide au RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—aipau bam de de Topheth, Ben Hinnom Langkam de eh qu sita kedi dau, kedanemene cide au giketset langkam dizie. <verse eid="JER 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7" />Aipau bam gade Ih ne peu Judah nah Jerusalem mariemdung kemta tei dizie. Ih ne peu kingtie gade penui ngauraumedung dwa gade penuide kau zie nah penuide teitset zie lie peei kelamedung ba gade. Pecai Ih ne penui gu ketsai paudung tinggim ruinedung nah kideu teikuudung dage pwa peu dizie. <verse eid="JER 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8" />Pecai Ih ne aipau Jerusalem namdi dede ngkap kedi ge tei dizie nah kengkau ge tei dizie, kedanemene cika kah kegwang leune de keheu dizie nah penui mateeidung leune ziemne kengkau tei zie. <verse eid="JER 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9" />Ih penuide peu penui napeidung nah napuidung teih tyei zie; mige ge kecu pe kidabe teih twagwa kebam gade tyei zie nah penui ngauraumedung penui da keherei teu gwang kegai gade nah penuide teitset kera peei kelamedung dade.”’<verse eid="JER 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 19:10" />Pecai nang ncu ngngwa tet kecumedung miakngau gade lidei li tei pang zie. <verse eid="JER 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 19:11" />Nang penui dage rang zie, ‘Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Ih ma aide gapte aipau medung nah aipau namdi dage tei gai zie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—Jeremiah ne lidei li de tei msia di eh tei lamlui dai gailak kedi nzwa. Minadung ketsaime de Topheth langkam gage kung zie ketsaime ziemne pebam gah di kemaktane. <verse eid="JER 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12" />Ih aipau namdi de Topheth nzwa tei kegai dau ma aide nzwa Ih aipau namdi gage nah cika kelunghmedung dage tei gai zie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai— <verse eid="JER 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13" />cine Jerusalem kidung nah Judah gwangpeidung au Topheth nzwa dizie—kidung leune cau game ki pereudung gade mci kemak minadung tinggim hegidung leune de reca nah keda rabedung dage zau reca rui gai.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:42">Bat. 7:42</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14" />Pecai Jeremiah Topheth gade tetdi, RAMPAUBE ne pecu caihasam rang kera lang kegai ga. Pa RAMPAUBE kigu ga saplu nah pa mina pelane dage ranggai, <verse eid="JER 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15" />“Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla, ‘Pielo, Ih aipau namdi ga nah cide ga namceudung pelane ga kengkap teu gwang lai eh bam dida Ih cide de renia eh rang kebeu nzwa, kedanemene penui helungbe tak bam nah a samdung kingnei ta kedine.’”<verse eid="JER 19:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20" />
  <para style="s">Jeremiah nah Pashhur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1" />Cingkupei Immer napei Pashhur—teuswa kela kedihbe—RAMPAUBE kerecaki dwa gade Jeremiah caihasam rang kebam siulu. <verse eid="JER 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2" />Cine Pashhur ne caihakecibe Jeremiah de tuilu delwe dap nah RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga Benjamin Rieki Nreule tai gage kang lwe kai dilo aja kaibeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:36">Heb. 11:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3" />Pecai benai Pashhur Jeremiah de kai pwa kebam ni gade teu mpetlu. Ge Jeremiah pe dage rang, “RAMPAUBE au nzi Pashhur lie eh qu ma, dede Magor Missabib lie de eh qu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">twagwa kebam pelane ngaukehing ge</char></note>. <verse eid="JER 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE aide rang, ‘Pielo, Ih ncu kehing kauge tei gai zie, ncu nah nang hung kelamedung pelane dage, kedanemene penui au penui ngauraumedung gu kingtie gade kau zie nah cide penui miakdung le ngau zie. Ih Judah pelane de Babylon gwangpei ba gage kai beuzie. Pa ne penui de Babylon ga tuiteu mie peu hebaang tei zie mede penuide kingtie le renia zie. <verse eid="JER 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5" />Ih pecu aipau Jerusalem namdi mabam pelane peu zie nah cide gu maheidung pelane, cide gu pemi kehungdung leune nah Judah gwangpeidung gu mabam mahei hekwa kenzeu pelane peuzie. Ih ma aipaudung de nnui ngauraumedung ba gage kai beuzie nah penui ne cidung tuiteu pwa dizie. Penui cidung de keu luzie nah Babylon gage cidungde keugwang zie. <verse eid="JER 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6" />Dede nang, Pashhur, nah n kilung medung de hebaang tei kera tuiteu tet dizie. Nang Babylon ga mie zie nah cika de tsai zie. Nang nah nang hung kelame leune, penui dage nang kenret caihasamdung ranggai kebeume de cikage kung dizie.’”<verse eid="JER 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremiah Kencam</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7" />“O Rampaubo, nang acu cwa dida, nah Ih akatei de cwa kedi tei dida. Nang au a swa ngking ki, nah nang acu ngam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:7">Ih tingba pelane mina nuineu tei; mileune acu henui tei dida.<verse eid="JER 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8" />Kedanemene Ih marang kegai dau, Ih qu pet gai nah ndu gai, ‘Zaisiet nah kekap.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:8">Ge RAMPAUBE sam de ziemne acu rang msia nah henui tei lamui dida.<verse eid="JER 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9" />Magade Ih akatei, ‘Ih RAMPAUBE de mning si lak ta. Ih pezi gade marang si lakta,’ de eh rang cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:9">Cide au a lung ga mi ge nzwa dizie, a radung ga kebam nzwa. Cine Ih cide ketip di kera laikai tei dede Ih tei luma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Cor. 9:16</char></note><verse eid="JER 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10" />Ih mina leune twagwapung kebam gade kehing samkiee cütla kedi siu. ‘Paubeu! Anui cide paubeu maisia!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:10">A da mna kebammedung Ih kau di kera pie bam. ‘Pecu cwa lu de cilak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:10">Cinzwa cai, anui pecu ngam luzie nah pecu anui kum peei luzie.’<verse eid="JER 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11" />Dede RAMPAUBE au reugwame ngkieng süt kecume ge nzwa ada la, cine acu gwa kecumedung kau dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:11">Penui acu ngam gai lak. Penui au hengam tei süt dizie, kedanemene penui ngkienglu gai kelakne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:11">Penui da penli kegah ngngam bam dizie, cide madau gede nsungta lak.<verse eid="JER 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12" />Dede RAMPAUBE gwamedung, nang makesangme de piela nah pe kecet nah pe mlung ncet pie la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:12">Peu acu penui dage hekum kepeei de ngaulo kedanemene Ih a ha pwa n dage kaidi delu.<verse eid="JER 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13" />RAMPAUBE dage lei teilo! RAMPAUBE de twalo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:13">Kedanemene pa mine tei keherei kelamedung de kesiamedung ba gade kelilu.<verse eid="JER 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14" />Peu acu kemna benai de reset punglu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:14">Apui ne acu kemna tingba de peu samlam pung so.<verse eid="JER 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15" />A pei de paulia kegaibe de peu reset punglu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:15">cau aide ranggai bi, ‘Mipeina ge nda ge mna beu zie,’ suiyi kedi ge peu kegaide.<verse eid="JER 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16" />Peu cipau pei de de RAMPAUBE ne namdidung ngkap kedi nzwa dilo nah pa penui dage ngaugia keulia ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:16">Peu pecu tingcang nuge kehap kwa siulo, tingna dau hereu ketei kwa,<verse eid="JER 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17" />kedanemene acu mnalu kemakne gage pa acu teitsetdi melu, ciciu eh a pui za gade a rau tei eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:17">kelungta tetlak kecu za ge tei kera.<verse eid="JER 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18" />Daitei lu eh kehereidung nah lungsiet ngau kera acu mna mpet lu no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:18">ci nzwa eh a teilung hengam le pui kera?”<verse eid="JER 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang Zedekiah Kekie Mlaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1" />Hegwangpei Zedekiah Malkijah napei Pashhur nah cingkube Maaseiah napei Zephaniah de peda langkegai dau sambe RAMPAUBE dade Jeremiah da gwang, nah penui ranggai, <verse eid="JER 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2" />“Anui mding gade RAMPAUBE dade ma keteu lo, kedanemene Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar anui da hereu tei bam kedine. RAMPAUBE anui ziemne mimakecang batadung tei beuzie, gwang kedi le dung tei kegai nzwa eh, nah pecu peu anui dade tetdi lubui.”<verse eid="JER 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3" />Cine Jeremiah penui dage rang, “Ma aide nang Zedekiah dage rang beu maisia, <verse eid="JER 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4" />‘RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangzeu: Pielo, nnui Babylon gwangpei nah nnui tai ga kiriedung gwale de gwang nna kebam Chaldeanme de renia kebam nnui reunetdung kemtadung tei dizie nah Ih teu caili dai lai eh bam dida! Kedanemene Ih penuide aipau namdi sum gage hekwa gai zie. <verse eid="JER 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5" />Pecai Ih de aba hwa cuh pwa nnuide renia zie nah a ba kengkieng ge le, nah lunghop, lungka nah rata süt kecu gele. <verse eid="JER 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6" />Kedanemene Ih aipau namdi ga kelunghmedung de ketang zie, mina nah makaune dede. Penui mateei kehung gade tsai zie. <verse eid="JER 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne nduga—aipau de cai, Zedekiah Judah gwangpei, pe kilamedung, minadung, and caugame mateei de cai aipau namdi ga bang lu di bi, kingtie, nah herakum cai de, Ih ne penui pelane de Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ba gage kai beuzie, nah penui ngauraumedung ba gage kai beu zie, nah penuide teitset kera peei kelamedung ba gage kai beuzie. Pecai pa penuide kingtie mui le teitset dizie. Pa penuide nggia lak, bang beu lak, mede penui da ngaugia keulia lak.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:24">Luk. 21:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8" />Pecai nang minadung dage rang lialo, ‘RAMPAUBE aide rangzeu: Pielo, Ih nnuide kering lampui lambie gwanglu kera nah ketsai lampui lambie gwanglu kera peu gai lai bam. <verse eid="JER 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9" />Keheibede aipau namdi ga bam kecume kingtie, herakum, nah mateei gade tsai zie; dede keheibede tet pet delwe nnui de renia kera nna eh kebam Chaldeamedung dwa ga koktung mie kelume ring luzie. Pa au pe teilung de keli luzie. <verse eid="JER 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—Ih au aipau namdi de kengkap teu gwang gai kerane ncwa bam dida nah keyi ge de teu gwang beu lak. Cide au Babylon gwangpei ba gage peu dida nah pa ne cide ru dizie.’<verse eid="JER 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11" />Judah gwangpei leuhme ziemne, RAMPAUBE sam kingnei gai lo.<verse eid="JER 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12" />David leuhme, RAMPAUBE ranggai, ‘Tingcang dau ge kemzeube teu gwanglu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 21:12">Mige pe mabam süt teu di kecube de pecu tei keherei kecume ba gade keli beulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 21:12">iciu melie cai a lungka mi nzwa pet zie nah ru zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 21:12">nah migede cide tei mmüt kera bam lak, n kesia batadung leune ziemne.<verse eid="JER 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—pielo, nnui, Jerusalem kelunghmedung langkam nreu ga lungh kelamedung! Ih nnui langkam tsudung de renia la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 21:13">“Cau hung delwe anuide gwaketang zie no?” mede “Cau anui kidung ga lüt zie no?” de eh rang kelame de Ih renia zie.<verse eid="JER 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—nang tei keladung petsi peu Ih n da gwang eh ncu mmau kera teigai dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 21:14">nah Ih n hegwangki mi ntau gaizie, nah cika kebam leune de ru kap dizie.’”<verse eid="JER 21:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22" />
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpeidung ziemne sam kerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1" />Aide au RAMPAUBE ne rangzeu, “Judah gwangpei ki ga tet hung cu nah sam aide cikade ndugai. <verse eid="JER 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2" />Rang lo, ‘RAMPAUBE sam de kingneilu, nang David hegwangbam leu kelube Judah gwangpei, nang, nah nnui kang ga kedime, nah aipau hegwangki riekidung gade kegwang n minadung de peu kingnei lulo. <verse eid="JER 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla, “Kemzeube tei nah kesamsangbe tei lulo, nah mine pecu cwa kelame keheibe de mide cwa kelame ba gade kelilu lo. Nnui deu gade sangme keheibe de tei keherei so, mede nggiana mede hemipui de de. Zaisiet tah teiso mede heni aikade pe mau kegahme de teitset so. <verse eid="JER 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4" />Nnui ma aidungde samsang eh tei lucai, David hegwangbam ga kebam gwangpeidung aipau ki ga riekidung gade bagi ge teu delwe hekündung teulwe nlüt zie, pa, pekang kedime, nah pe minadung nlüt zie! <verse eid="JER 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—dede magade nang Ih rang ndu kegai aipau samdung de kingnei tadi cai, aipau hegwang ki de au kau eh kap dizie.”’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 23:38, Luk. 13:35</char></note><verse eid="JER 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hegwangki sam kerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE ne aide Judah gwangpei ki ziemne rangzeu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:6">‘Nang au Gilead deu nzwa, mede a ziemne au Lebanon lamlwatwang nzwa. Iciu de Ih ncu hetaideu ge nzwa tei dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:6">namdidung ga minadung lungh kemak nzwa.<verse eid="JER 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7" />Kedanemene nnuide ngkapdi kera minadung Ih langgai zie. Penui pelane penui reunetdung teugwang eh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:7">ngu cedar yitubedung de bi gidi zie nah cidungde mi gage kelien gai dizie. <verse eid="JER 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8" />Pecai mina heleuhdung kekiee ge aipau namdi de kah gwang zie. Hangge ge kecu peciabe de rang eh, “Dai ziemne RAMPAUBE aipau namdi kedi de dage aiciu tei di no?”<verse eid="JER 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9" />Ge kedame samli peu eh, “Kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang kesamkak de gidi nah keda rabedung dage keumie nah cidungde de reca kedine.”<verse eid="JER 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoahaz ziemne sam kerang</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10" />Judah ga minadung, hegwangpei Josiah ziemne hap so; petsit hei eh hap so, dede pe napei Joahaz ziemne hei eh hap sütlu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:10">kedanemene pa au madau gede cailigwang dai lak nah pecu mna kelu deu de madau de ngau dai lakta.’<verse eid="JER 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE Judah gwangpei Josiah napei Shallum ziemne aide rang, pe pei Josiah be mene pabe hegwang keteibe, ‘Pa au aipau bam gade tet dida nah gwang dai lak ta. <verse eid="JER 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12" />Pa au cika penui ne pecu langgi kedi deu gade tsai dizie, nah pa au madaude aipau deu de ngau dai lakta.’<verse eid="JER 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoiakim ziemne sam kerang</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13" />Ainie kesamsang kemak gade peki tei kelube<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jehoiakim</char></note>, nreule peki bungdung mzeu kemakpe le keteibe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:13">pe kidabe de peu pe ziemne mta makam keteibe, nah pa pecu ma ketei ziedung de ha la kemakbe;<verse eid="JER 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14" />pa rang eh, ‘Ih au akatei a ziemne nreule kibungdung heni bam süt kecu ki ge tei zie.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:14">Cine pa cide ziemne kebaki kedi ge dang mpetlu, nah pa cide cedar le pwa teilu, nah pa cide püt gie lu. <verse eid="JER 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15" />Aide de ne ncu hegwang yi kecu ge tei lu ni, nang cedar kwakdung lu neu kedi dene?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:15">N pei Josiah tyei nah sak meni, ciuliede kemzeube nah kesamsangbe tei meni? Ge pe ziemne ma petau tei eh gwangdi.<verse eid="JER 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—pa kegahme nah teumai kesiame tutiak mzui beula. Ge cide au yi. Ainzwa tei kecude pekie acu ci kecude de meni? <verse eid="JER 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17" />Dede nang au samsang kemak gie nkatei n ziemne peeila nah nang maukemakme de teitsetla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:17">n zai sia kecu nah mi kedamedung de tei keherei rünsangne.<verse eid="JER 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE aide Judah gwangpei, Josiah napei Jehoiakim ziemne ma aide rang:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:18">penui au pe ziemne hap lak, rang eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:18">‘Ainie, a sinabe pei!’ Mede ‘Ainie, a sinabe poi!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:18">Penui au pe ziemne hap lak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:18">‘Ainie, a mpaubo!’ Mede ‘Ainie, a hegwangpei!’<verse eid="JER 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19" />Pa tsai kedi dau pecu gadha nzwa kung dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:19">teu kerei tet zie nah Jerusalem kiriedung mzu pet kelien gai dizie.<verse eid="JER 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20" />Jerusalem ga minadung, Lebanon lamlwadung ga nghang cu nah sah lo. Bashan cuikui gade sah gailo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:20">Abarim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Moab lamlwatu</char></note> lamlwatudung gade sah gai lo, Kedanemene nzang medung pelane de tei ngkap dizie.<verse eid="JER 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21" />Nang kwak eh kebam dau Ih n dage marang gai, dede nang rang eh, ‘Ih kingnei lak.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:21">Aide au n hena ne gade tei kelabe da, kedanemene nang a kwa kingnei meda.<verse eid="JER 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22" />N meurün kekwamedung de<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">N meurün kekwadung de </char><char style="ft" closed="false">muiteume</char></note> tingkai ne guipung tet dizie, nah nzang medung de tuiteu tet dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:22">Pecai nang ngngam dizie nah n tahdung kesia pelane dene hengam tei dizie.<verse eid="JER 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23" />Nang ‘Lebanon’ ga kelunghbe, cedar le teikelu ki ga lungh kebambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:23">n da keteei gwang keludau ncu dai kenzwa gede ngaunggia zie no, mipui mna tedteei kecu nzwa!”<verse eid="JER 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoiachin ziemne sam kerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—Ih ring kebam nzwa, magade Judah gwangpei, Jehoiakim napei Jehoiachin, nang a ba zetle ga kaugiak ge liede, Ih ncu tei takcai dizie. <verse eid="JER 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25" />Kedanemene ncu teitset kera peei kelamedung ba gage Ih ncu kaibeu dida nah nang ndaa hing kelamedung ba gage, Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar nah Chaldeamedung ba gage de. <verse eid="JER 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26" />Ih ncu nah ncu mna kebeube pui de keda deu, ncu mna kemak deu ge gage kelien gai dizie, nah cikade nang tsai zie. <verse eid="JER 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27" />Penui cailigwang neu kebam aipau deu de, penui aika caili gwang dai lak.<verse eid="JER 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28" />Aipau de migede luu neu ta kedi nah pang kedi li ge di deni? Jehoiachin aipau peide migede de pe suiyi teilu ta kedi li ge di deni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:28">Dai ziemne penui pecu nah pe leuhmedung de kelien gidi bi, nah penuide penui ci kemak deu gage kai gai dibi?<verse eid="JER 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29" />Hangdeu, hangdeu, hangdeu! RAMPAUBE sam kingnei lulo!<verse eid="JER 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30" />RAMPAUBE aide rangzeu, ‘Jehoiachin aipau pei ha rau gailo: Pa au pe name lungh lak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:30">Pe teilung tingdau lungh yi gailak, nah pe leuhmedung gade migede lungh yi gailak</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:30">mede David hegwangbam ga bam dai gailak nah Judah reu hegwang tei dailak.’”<verse eid="JER 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23" />
  <para style="s">Kesamsang Tsingkiak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1" />“Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—A meurün haudung de tei ngkap nah teizang kela meurün kekwamedung de au suisiet.” <verse eid="JER 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, pe minadung de kwa kelame meurün kekwamedung ziemne aide rangzeu, “Nang a meurün hau de teizang dida nah penuide tei mpak dida. Nang penui ma pielu meda. Cine Ih nang kesia tei kegai dene ncu saja peu lai eh bam dida—aide RAMPAUBE ndu kegai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:8">Jhn. 10:8</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 10:12">12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 10:13">13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3" />Ih penuide teizang kegai bamdung gade Ih a meurün hau kebangbedung de hekwa luzie, nah Ih penuide taktyeibam gage ngngwa cailigwang dai gai beuzie, cika de penui tsi bui zie nah lungh nkiee luzie. <verse eid="JER 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4" />Pecai Ih penui mapie kera a meurün kekwamedung de teu cuhlu zie cinzwa eh penui hing si lak mede penuide tei zang si lak. Penui kette gah dilak—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="JER 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5" />Pielo, peting gwangla dida—aide au RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—cidau Ih David leuh makesangme de teu cuh beuzie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cidau Ih David leuh makesangme de teu cuh beuzie </char><char style="ft" closed="false">David leuh makesangme gede hegwangpei kedetlu</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:5">Pa au hegwang tei zie, pa au kemteu ta tei zie nah kemzeube nah kesamsangbe hangdeu cika de tei zie.<verse eid="JER 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6" />Pa hegwang tei kelu dau, Judah de keli luzie, nah Israel au kwak eh lungh zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:6">Pecai aipau zi de pecu qu zie: RAMPAUBE au anui kesamsangbe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jhn. 7:42, 1 Cor. 1:30</char></note><verse eid="JER 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7" />Ciziemne pielo, peting gwangla dida—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—penui rang si ta kedi dau, ‘RAMPAUBE ring kela nzwa, Israel minadung de Egypt deu gade teu mpet kebeube,’ <verse eid="JER 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8" />Cinzwa meliene penui rang zie, ‘RAMPAUBE ring kela nzwa, ngngwa cuh kebeube nah Israel leuhmedung de tingpeule deu nah penuide ngngwa tet kedi deu pelane deudung gade ngngwa cailigwang dai kebeube.’ Pecai penui au penuikatei penui deu ga lungh dizie.”<verse eid="JER 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenret Caihakecimedung</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9" />Kenret caihakecimedung ziemne a mlung pang dida, nah a radung pelane mbeu dida. Ih au sak kemieme nzwa dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:9">zau ne pereu ngking teu kedibe nzwa, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nah pe kemci samdung ziemne.<verse eid="JER 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10" />Kedanemene hangdeube au kemmhamedung le pui bam. Aide ziemne hangdeu be cangh bam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:10">Hetaideu ga tsehei deudung cangh di. Aipau caihakecimedung lampui au sia; penui kengking au petaube gage keu gai ma.<verse eid="JER 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11" />“Kedanemene caihakecimedung nah cingkumedung liede hera dida. Ih penui kesia de a ki gade ngaulu!—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—<verse eid="JER 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12" />ciziemne penui lampui au kemui ga kereneu bam ge nzwa zie. Penuide cwak ngkau dizie. Penui cika de kau zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:12">Kedanemene Ih penui dage saja kepeu bekum kengkap langgai zie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="JER 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13" />Kedanemene Samaria gade caihakecimedung daipai mau bi kecu tei kela Ih ngau da:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:13">Penui Baal zi gade caihasam rang nah a mina Israel de peu tet mau dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Samaria, Assyriame ne 722 B.C. dau teingkap kedi, cide cai Israel hegwangram tingpeule namdi </char></note><verse eid="JER 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14" />Jerusalem ga caihakecimedung kakga Ih ma kehing bedung ngau:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:14">Penui kemmha tah tei nah mide kecwa ga tetla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:14">Penui makesia keteimedung badung tei nking beu; mi gede pa makesia tei kela gade nreu gwang ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:14">A dade penui pelane au Sodom nzwa di nah cika kelunghmedung au Gomorrah nzwa di!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">RAMPAUBE ne Sodom penai Gomorrah namdidung de teingkapdi penui kemau tei kedine</char></note><verse eid="JER 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15" />Ciziemne reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide caihakecimedung ha rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:15">“Pielo, Ih penuide peu mabang kekaabe tyei zie nah heiring dui sak zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:15">kedanemene Jerusalem ga caihakecimedung dade kehera hangdeu leune ga la dida.”<verse eid="JER 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rang bam, “Aipau kenret caihakecimedung ne n dage caiha samdung kerang de kingnei so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:16">Penui ncu kenret keregui le tei pui beula! Penui au penuikatei penui kecetdung gade marengei ngau kecudung rang bam, RAMPAUBE mui gade ma.<verse eid="JER 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17" />Penui acu rüt kemakme dage mtak mene marang eh, ‘RAMPAUBE rang eh nnui da kezuyibe bam zie.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:17">Kedanemene keheibe de pe mlung ketak ga tet kelame rang zie, ‘Kengkap nnui da gwang lak.’<verse eid="JER 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18" />Dede cau RAMPAUBE gu baudi kempau ga sap no? Cau pesam ngau nah siu no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:18">Cau pesam de ga helung kai nah kingnei no?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:34">Rom. 11:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19" />Pielo, RAMPAUBE dade hera tingkai ge gwangla dida! Pe lungka au tet pet dida, nah tingkai kengking ge guihang la dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:19">Cide au kenlienme peudung ga gui nrui bam dida.<verse eid="JER 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20" />RAMPAUBE rata de pa teineu kela de teicangdi kemaktane cide mtak dilak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:20">Tingbazie kekam dau, nang cide ci luzie.<verse eid="JER 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21" />Ih aipau caihakecimedung de lang mpet gai ma. Penuikatei ngau petdi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:21">Ih penui dage magede rang ndu gai ma, dede penui caihasam rangdi.<verse eid="JER 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22" />Kedanemene magade pa a baudi kempau ga sap cai, penui peu a minadung de a sam siu lubui nage;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:22">penui ne peu penuide samdung kesia gade nah kesia tadung tei kela gade nreu luzie nage.<verse eid="JER 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—Ih kemna ga kela Tinggwang rünne ni nah kemdei ga kela Tinggwang be meni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:27">Bat. 17:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24" />Migede kengkim bam ge ga mbai lubui ni iciu eh Ih pecu ngau tadi kera?—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:24">nah Ih ne tinggimdung nah kideu de tei pui meni?—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="JER 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25" />Caihakecimedung ne rang kegai de Ih siu da, a zi gade kenret caihasam kerang medung. Penui ranggai, ‘Ih hemang ge mmi! Ih hemang ge mmi!’ <verse eid="JER 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26" />Daitiee ge aide tei zie reu no, penui kecet gade kenret caihasamdung kerang caihakecimedung, nah penui mlungdung gade kenret caihasam kerangmedung? <verse eid="JER 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27" />Penui hemangdung hang gege kecu pe kidacaina de paubeu eh peu a minadung de a zi nsung tadi kera riem bam, penui paumedung Baal zi ziemne a zi nsungta kedi nzwa.<verse eid="JER 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28" />Caihakecibe cau hemang ge mmi bi, peu pecu hemang pau lo. Dede Ih ne caude rang ndu lia gai bi, peu pecu a sam kesangbe gade ranglo. Reigau de mei tsiu ziemne dai teibeu lano?—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai— <verse eid="JER 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29" />A sam mi nzwa meni?—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—nah hegeuteisang gene tangtsu gede dap pop kegai nzwa meni? <verse eid="JER 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—cine pielo, Ih au caihakecimedung de renia la, keheibe de mi kedame dade samdung regalu nah rang eh cidung a dade gwang de eh rang kelamedung de. <verse eid="JER 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31" />Pielo, Ih caihakecimedung de renia la—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—penui mleudung teu caihasam rang kelamedung. <verse eid="JER 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32" />Pielo, Ih au caihakecimedung kenret hemang mmi kelamedung de renia la—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—pecai penui dage rang beu nah ainzwa eh kenret nah hegie eh a minadung puisau tei mau di. Ih au penuide renia la, kedanemene Ih ne penuide lang mpet ma mede penuide aja peu ma. Cine penui au aipaumedung de ngha lak zing da—aide au RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="JER 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—magade mina aidungde, mede caihakecime ge, mede cingkume ge n dade, ‘RAMPAUBE gu hepwet kerüt de daipai no?’ de keteu kecudau nang penui dage ranglia beuzie, ‘Hepwet kerüt de au nang da, nah Ih ncu keu gi dizie.’ <verse eid="JER 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34" />Caihakecimedung, cingkumedung, nah minadung rang eh, ‘Aide RAMPAUBE gu hepwet kerüt,’ de eh rang kebammedung de Ih ne pecu nah pe kilungme de saja peu zie. <verse eid="JER 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35" />Nang rang jüja eh, hangge ge pe zangme nah keda Israel zangme de keteu kerabe, ‘RAMPAUBE dai samli peu no?’ nah ‘RAMPAUBE dai rang no?’ <verse eid="JER 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36" />Dede nang au, ‘RAMPAUBE gu hepwet kerüt,’ de rangsi tadi maisia kedanemene hepwet kerüt de au hangge ge gu pekatei pe sam da, nah nang ring kela Tinggwang samdung de tei li dida, reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, anui Tinggwang. <verse eid="JER 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37" />Jeremiah, caihakecibe de keteulo, ‘RAMPAUBE ncu dai samli peu no?’ mede ‘RAMPAUBE dai rang no?’ <verse eid="JER 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38" />Dede magade nang rang eh, ‘RAMPAUBE gu hepwet kerüt,’ aide au RAMPAUBE ne rang bam:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:38">‘Kedanemene nang aipau samdung de rang kegai ne, ‘RAMPAUBE gu hepwet kerüt,’ Ih ncu lang gai eh rang kebeu, “RAMPAUBE pwet kerüt,” de eh nang rang lak.<verse eid="JER 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39" />Ciziemne, ainie, Ih ne ncu keu lu eh kelien gidi lai eh bam dida, Ih ne ncu pwa kepeu namdi de nah n paumedung de si eh.<verse eid="JER 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40" />Pecai Ih n reu gage kelungta hengam nah madaude nsung tadi kelak ncu rangmsia kecu n da teugwang beuzie.’”<verse eid="JER 23:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24" />
  <para style="s">Tangzüttsi keyi nah kesia dade keledeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1" />RAMPAUBE acu mage keulia gai. Ainie, tangzüttsidung marak kena ge RAMPAUBE kerecaki dwa gage kai pwabam. (Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ne Judah gwangpei Jehoiakim napei Jehoiachin, Judah ga kedimedung, peba ciem keyi teu mata keteimedung nah hegeu ta keteimedung de Jerusalem gade tuiteu tet kedi cai nah penuide Babylon ga ngngwa gwang kelu cai ne aipau marengei de ngau.) <verse eid="JER 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2" />Raptui ket ga tangzüttsidung kebamdung de au yisüt, tangzüttsidung meu raitubedung nzwa, dede keda raptui ga kebam tangzüttsidung au timdi eh cidung tyei dau gai kelak teidi. <verse eid="JER 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3" />RAMPAUBE acu keteu, “Nang dai pai ngau no, Jeremiah?” Ih keligai, “Tangzüttsidung. Tangzüttsidung yisüt cudung nah tangzüttsidung timdi eh tyei dau gai kelakdung.”<verse eid="JER 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4" />Ge RAMPAUBE sam ada gwang, rang eh, <verse eid="JER 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5" />“RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla: Ih Judah gade langgi kedimedung de penui ziuyi ziemne pie zie, aipau keyi tangzüttsidung nzwa, langgi kedimedung de Ih ne aipau bam gade Chaldea deu gage lang mpet kedimedung. <verse eid="JER 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6" />Peu yilu kera ziemne Ih penuide piebam zie nah penuide aipau deu gage kai dai beuzie. Ih penuide teu cuh beuzie, nah penuide tei ngkau dilak. Ih ne penuide linggai zie, nah penuide pai mpet dilak. <verse eid="JER 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7" />Pecai Ih ne penuide peu acu cilu kera mlung peu zie, kedanemene Ih au RAMPAUBE lu. Penui au a mina zie nah Ih au penui Tinggwang zie, cine penui penui mlung pekiene teu a da nreu gwang zie.<verse eid="JER 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8" />Dede tangzüttsidung timdi eh tyei dau lak kecudung nzwa, ma aide au RAMPAUBE ne rang bam, Ih aide siakte Judah gwangpei, Zedekiah dage, pe gu kedimedung dage, nah Jerusalemme aipau Judah deuceu ga kebamme mede Egypt deu ga bam di kera kedimedung da mie aide nzwa Ih tei gai zie. <verse eid="JER 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9" />Ih ne penuide ma kehing gage teu nreu gai zie, kengkap gage, kideu ga hegwangramdung pelane miakngau gade, tei hengam kecu ge nah mina penuide rangmsia zie, mina ne penuide kega zie, nah Ih ne penuide ngngwa kegwang leune ga penuide reset zie. <verse eid="JER 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10" />Ih ne kingtie, herakum, nah mateei penuide renia eh lang mpet gai zie, Ih ne penuide nah penui paumedung de kepeu deu gade penuide tei ngkapdi kemaktane.”<verse eid="JER 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25" />
  <para style="s">Mmi Riakhena Hebaang ketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1" />Aipau sam de Judah ga minadung pelane ziemne Jeremiah da gwang. Judah gwangpei, Josiah napei Jehoiakim hegwang tei kelu mmi pe mdai bekum dau gwang. Cide au Babylon gwangpei, Nebuchadnezzar hegwang tei kelu mmi raitu bekum. <verse eid="JER 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2" />Caihakecibe Jeremiah aide Judah ga minadung pelane dage nah Jerusalem ga kelungh leu dage ranglia beu. <verse eid="JER 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3" />Pa ranggai, “Mmi ngkaiehkecum ge, Judah gwangpei Amon napei Josiah hegwang tei kelu mmi kereiehkecum gade gwang cu kecang, RAMPAUBE samdung a da gwang bam nah Ih n dage rang lwe rangdai gai, dede nang kingnei ma. <verse eid="JER 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4" />RAMPAUBE pe kilamedung caihakecimedung pelane de n dage lang lwe lang daigai, dede nang kingnei ma mede kette n lung kai ma. <verse eid="JER 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5" />Aipau caihakecimedung ranggai, ‘Peu mige ge kecude pe kesia lampui gade nreu dilu nah pa tei keladung kesia gade nah ndaa tingdau RAMPAUBE ne nnui paumedung nah nnuide hangdeu pwa kepeu deu de ga lungh la lu kerane. <verse eid="JER 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6" />Cine keda rabedung dage tetgai eh cidungde reca diso mede cidungde dage keumie so, nah n bata de le pe rata tei so iciu eh pa ncu tei rezam di melu kerane.’ <verse eid="JER 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7" />Dede nang a kwa kingnei ma, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, iciu eh ncu tei rezam kera nang n ba le tei kelu mamiedung reca eh a rata teigai. <verse eid="JER 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8" />Cine Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide ranggai, ‘Kedanemene nang a samdung kingnei kemakne, <verse eid="JER 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9" />pielo, Ih ne peu tingtünle ga minadung pelane de gwang mbau kera aja ge lang mpet gai lai eh bam dida, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, Babylon gwangpei a kilabe Nebuchadnezzar dage, nah penuide ngngwa gwang aipau deu de nah cika kelunghmedung de renia zie, nah ncu twagwa kebam heleuhdung pelane de renia zie. Kedanemene tei ngkap kera ziemne Ih penuide nzi dizie. Ih penuide peu kehing ge tei dizie, mine rang kemsia ge tei zie, nah penli kegah kemta kemrwa ge tei dizie. <verse eid="JER 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10" />Ih suiyi kwa de nah misui keyi kwa de, nah hemeupei kwa nah hemeupui kwa de, keniaktsu kwa de nah mitaubung kebaa de tei mtak dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:22">Keu. 18:22</ref>,<ref loc="REV 18:23">23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11" />Pecai aipau deu pelane ngkap dizie nah kehing ge dizie, Jewmedung nah heleuh kedadung de mmi riakhena ge Babylon gwangpei gwa tei dizie.<verse eid="JER 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12" />Pecai tuiteu kedi mmi riakhena cang dide, Ih Babylon gwangpei nah cipau heleuh de, Chaldeamedung de penui mau ziemne saja peu zie, nah Ih Babylonme deudi de kelunghta kemta ge tei dizie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai, <verse eid="JER 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13" />Pecai Ih rang kegai samdung leune gade cipau deu de de mmau zie, nah Jeremiah heleuhdung leune dage mmau eh caihasam rang kebeu aipau laisiukwak ga rau teu kela leune tei gwang zie. <verse eid="JER 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14" />Heleuh kedadung nah hegwang kedidung Babylonme de pwa penui baang tei zie. Penui tei kegai ziemne nah penui batadung ziemne Ih penuide saja peu zie.’”<verse eid="JER 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang Lunghop Piak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, a dage aide ranggai, “Aipau lunghop zau piak de a ba gade keu dilu nah Ih heleuhdung n dage lang kegai leune de peu saklu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 14:10, 15:7, 16:19</char></note> <verse eid="JER 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16" />Penui sak lude nlia tiatia dizie, nah Ih penui kak gage kingtie lang kegai dwa gade penui ratasüt eh sah dizie.” <verse eid="JER 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17" />Cine Ih RAMPAUBE ba gade hepiak cide keulu delwe RAMPAUBE a dage lang kegai heleuh pelane de peu saklu: <verse eid="JER 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18" />Jerusalem nah Judah namdi pelane nah pe gwangdung nah muiteume de, penuide kengkap nah ngaukehing ge, nah mine ngau kerau nah reset ge teidi kerane, henai kecang ciciu kela nzwa. <verse eid="JER 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19" />Keda leuhdung liede cide sak maisia: Egypt gwangpei Pharaoh nah pe kilamedung, pe kangga kedimedung nah pe minadung pelane; <verse eid="JER 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20" />heleuh ketsamtsam pelane, nah Uz deu ga hegwangdung pelane; Philistia deu ga hegwangdung pelane, Ashkelon, Gaza, Ekron, nah Ashdod ga bangh kelume; <verse eid="JER 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21" />Edom nah Moab nah Ammonmedung. <verse eid="JER 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22" />Tyre nah Sidon gwangpeidung, jaadi keda lebie duikung deu pelane hegwangpeidung, <verse eid="JER 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23" />Dedan, Tema, nah Buz namdidung si eh penui peu pembie ga penui tam biet kedimedung pelane de cide sak maisia. <verse eid="JER 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24" />Arabia ga hegwangdung pelane nah heleuh ketsamtsam gwangdung pelane hetaideu ga kelunghmedung; <verse eid="JER 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25" />Zimri, nah Elam, nah Medes ga hegwangdung pelane; <verse eid="JER 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26" />Tingtünle gwangdung pelane, kennamedung nah kemdeimedung, keheibe de pe sinabe de si eh nah hangdeu reu pelane ga kebam kideu gwangramdung pelane RAMPAUBE ba gade hepiak cide sak maisia. Kamtube, Babylon gwangpei liede cipau piak de gade sak zie.<verse eid="JER 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27" />RAMPAUBE a da ranggai, “Cu nang penui dage rang maisia da, ‘Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, ainzwa rangbeu: Mie di kemaktane saklu, delwe nrui dilu, kau mie dilu, nah Ih nnui kakga lang kegai kingtie dwa gade cuhdai ta dilu.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:3">Keu. 18:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28" />Pecai magade penui n ba gade hepiak keu lwe sak mei dicai, nang penui dage rang zie, ‘Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangbeu: Nang cide sak bi maisia. <verse eid="JER 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29" />Kedanemene pielo, a zi gade qu kelu Jerusalem namdi de tei ngkapdi lai eh bam dida, nah nang ncu saja kepeu gade mpetlu zieni? Ncu lung mpet beulak, Kedanemene Ih hangdeu ga kelungh leune de renia kerane kingtie gede qu bam dida! aide Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:17">1 Pet. 4:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 25:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30" />Nang caihasam aidung pelane penuide renia eh rangbeu maisia, nah penui dage ranglo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:30">‘RAMPAUBE au kecehudung gade mrung gai zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:30">nah pa kemci bam gade sahbak gaizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:30">pa pe maame de renia mrung süt gaizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:30">nah pa kubetsidung niak kecumedung nzwa sah gaizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:30">kideu ga kelungh leune de renia cuh eh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 10:11">Keu. 10:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31" />Pe tutiak kwa kideu penli kecang siu dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:31">kedanemene RAMPAUBE heleuhdung de renia eh mmau kecune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:31">nah pa mileune reu gage tutiak teugwang kebamne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:31">nah pa kesiamedung de kingtie le teitset dizie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.’<verse eid="JER 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32" />Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rang bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:32">‘Pielo, heleuh ge cai heleuh ge ga kengkap petla dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:32">nah rahang kedi ge kideu mdeitube bamdung gade ndeu cuh dida.<verse eid="JER 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33" />Pecai cipaunai RAMPAUBE ne teitset kedimedung kideu penli ket gade keda le kecang zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:33">penui ziemne hap lak, hekwa lak, nah kung de dilak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:33">Penui au hangdeu ga heteu ge nzwa zie.<verse eid="JER 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34" />Haplo, meurün kekwamedung, nah kengha kie eh sah gailo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:34">Rebui ga nlaklu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:34">nnui meurün hau muiteumedung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:34">kedanemene nnuide gitset kera tingba gwang bam di delu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:34">nnui au li yisüt cuge nhai mie eh pang di kela nzwa nnuide teizang dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:5">Jas. 5:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35" />Meurün kekwamedung ziemne nsiu kera kette gah, meurün hau muiteumedung paklu kera kette bam lak.<verse eid="JER 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36" />Meurün kekwamedung nah meurün hau muiteumedung hap kebam kwadung kingnei gailo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:36">kedanemene RAMPAUBE penui taktyei bamdung teimsia bam di kecune.<verse eid="JER 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37" />RAMPAUBE pe ratasüt di kecu ziemne ziune kebam tsehei kendiak bamdung teimsia dizie.<verse eid="JER 25:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38" />Heri heret hingho ge nzwa, RAMPAUBE pe ki püt dida, kedanemene mide teikeherei kela be rata ziemne penui deu au kehing deu ge dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:38">pe rata lunghop de ziemne.’”<verse eid="JER 25:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26" />
  <para style="s">Jeremiah de Teitset kera Keheu kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1" />Josiah napei Jehoiakim hegwang tei kerai dau, RAMPAUBE sam pe da ainzwa rang gwang <verse eid="JER 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2" />“RAMPAUBE rangzeu: A ki kigu ga saplu delwe Judah namdi ga pelane caudung a kiga reca kera gwang bi penui dage rang ndu gailo. Ih ncu ranglo aja kai kebeu pelane rangbeu lulo. Sam kette dang mdui diso! <verse eid="JER 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3" />Cinzwa eh penui samlia de kingnei beu de cilak, ciulude penui kesia lampuidung gade nreu lu kerane, ciciu lucai penui kesia tadung ziemne Ih penui dage kekap teu gwang kera riem pwa kelade nreu daidi luzie. <verse eid="JER 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4" />Cine nang penuida rangbeu bi maisia: ‘RAMPAUBE aide rangzeu: magade nnui a kwa kingnei lu mecai nah Ih hezaidung nnui dwaga kai kebeu ga tetlu mecai, <verse eid="JER 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5" />magade a kilame caihakecime de Ih nnui dage langgai jüja kebamme de samdung kingnei lucai, dede nnui kingnei luma! <verse eid="JER 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6" />Nnui iciu la liecai Ih Shiloh nam teingkap kedi nzwa Ih Kerecaki aide teingkap dizie; Ih Jerusalem namdi aide kideu ga heleuhdung pelane miakngau gade peu reset ge tei dizie.’”<verse eid="JER 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7" />Cingkumedung, caihakecimedung, nah mina pelane, RAMPAUBE ki gade Jeremiah sam aide rang ndu kebam de siulu. <verse eid="JER 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8" />Ciu eh Jeremiah RAMPAUBE ne mina pelane dage rang beulo aja kai kebeu pelane ndu cang dige, cingkumedung, caihakecimedung, nah mina pelane pecu tui lwe sahbak gai, “Nang tsai bi zieda! <verse eid="JER 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9" />Nang daitei RAMPAUBE zi teu caihakeci sam rang no nah aipau ki de Shiloh nzwa dizie nah namdi aide ngkap dizie, migede aika lungh lak liede rang no?” Cine RAMPAUBE kiga mina pelane mbau lwe Jeremiah de mcau di.<verse eid="JER 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10" />Cipau cai Judah muiteumedung sam aidungde siulu eh penui hegwangpei ki gade RAMPAUBE kiga tet nghang. Penui RAMPAUBE Kerecaki Kirieki Keheci lie qu kela lampui ga ntumlu. <verse eid="JER 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11" />Cingkumedung nah caihakecimedung gwang muiteumedung nah mina pelane de ngngwa resiu. Penui ainzwa ranggai, “Aipau pei de au tsai kera petau lie, kedanemene pa cairasam rang eh aipau namdi de mmau kecune, nnui kwenle siu kelu nzwa!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:11-14">Bat. 6:11-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12" />Cine Jeremiah muiteumedung pelane nah mina pelane dade, nnui siu kelu samdung pelane “RAMPAUBE ne aipau ki de nah namdi de mmau kera cairasam rang beulo acu langgai lie. <verse eid="JER 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13" />Cine cu au, nnui zaidung nah nnui tei kebamdung de yi reureu maisia da nah nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang kwa kingneilu ciulude pa nnui dage kekapdung kai dizie lie kebam de mtak luzie. <verse eid="JER 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14" />Acu au pielo! Ih au nnui ba ga bamda. Nnui dwa gade dai teide yi zie bi nah petau zie bi a dage teigai lulo. <verse eid="JER 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15" />Dede nnui ci bi maisia, magade acu teitset dicai, nnuikatei nnui dage nah aipau namdi de ga nah mina lungh kebammedung dage kemau kegah jai ge teugwang lada, kedanemene RAMPAUBE ne kesang gade aipau samdung pelane nnui kwendung gage rang ndu gai kera acu nnui dage langgai.”<verse eid="JER 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16" />Pecai muiteumedung nah mina pelane cingkume nah caihakecime dade, “Aipau peide tsai kera petau ma, kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang zi gade anui dage ma aidungde ndu gai kecune.” <verse eid="JER 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17" />Pecai deudi hangkiamedung cuhlu nah mina ngkwa kebam pelane dade resiu. <verse eid="JER 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18" />Penui ainzwa ranggai, “Judah hegwangpei Hezekiah tingdau Morashetme pei Micah cairasam rang bamla. Pa Judahme pelane de ainzwa ranggai, ‘Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aizwa rangzeu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 26:18">Zion au luh pu kedi ge nzwa dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 26:18">Jerusalem kehera kebau kelu ge nzwa dizie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 26:18">nah kerecaki gu kideutu de hegung ge dizie.’ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Micah 3:12</char></note><verse eid="JER 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19" />“Aide rang kegaine Judah gwangpei Hezekiah nah minadung pecu teitset dini? Penui dage kengkap gwang kera ndu kegaide peu gwang cang di melu kerane Hezekiah, RAMPAUBE de rüt eh pe nggia kiegai meluini? Anui anui katei anui teilung gage kemau kedi aikenzwa ge teigai zie ni?”<verse eid="JER 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20" />Cipau tingdau RAMPAUBE zi gade mi kedage cairasam rang eh la, Shemaiah napei Uriah, Kiriath Jearim namdi gade, Jeremiah samdung pelane kesuisam eh pa aipau namdi nah aipau deu de ziemne cairasam rang. <verse eid="JER 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21" />Dede hegwangpei Jehoiakim nah pe reugwamedung pelane nah kedimedung pe sam siu luge, hegwangpei pecu teitsetdi kera tei, dede Uriah cide siulu nah ngngi di, cine pa pakdi nah Egypt ga tet gaidi. <verse eid="JER 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22" />Cipau cai hegwangpei Jehoiakim Uriah de tui kera, Akbor napei Elnathan nah mi kedadung de Egypt gage langgai. <verse eid="JER 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23" />Penui Egypt gade Uriah de ngngwa mpetlu nah pecu hegwangpei Jehoiakim da ngngwa gwanglu. Ciu eh Jehoiakim kingtie le pecu teitsetdi nah pe paau mi kenlangme kemakme heraukie gage lang mpet gaidi. <verse eid="JER 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24" />Dede Shaphan napei Ahikam be au Jeremiah da la, cine pecu au teitsetdi kera mina dage peu dima.<verse eid="JER 26:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27" />
  <para style="s">Judah Nebuchadnezzar Gwateikera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1" />Judah gwangpei Josiah napei Zedekiah hegwang tei kerai dau, sam aide RAMPAUBE dade Jeremiah da gwang. <verse eid="JER 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2" />RAMPAUBE acu ainzwa rangbeu lie, “Nang heria teilu delwe ngwanggai ge n ziemne tei lulo. Cidung n ngwang gage kailu. <verse eid="JER 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3" />Pecai Edom hegwangpei, Moab hegwangpei, Ammonme hegwangpei, Tyre hegwangpei, nah Sidon hegwangpei, Jerusalem ga Judah hegwangpei Zedekiah de redau kera kegwang hegwangpei samgwamedung ba gage aipau sam de langgai beulo. <verse eid="JER 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4" />Cipau samgwamedung dage penui kedime ziemne aja kaibeu eh ranglo, ‘Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, ainzwa rangbeu: nang n kedime de ainzwa rangbeu bi maisia, <verse eid="JER 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5" />“Ih akatei a kengkieng kedi le nah a ba hwa kecu gade kideu teilu. Ih kideu ga minadung nah makaunedung de tei gai, nah keheibe de a miak dwa gade petau kecume de cide pwa peu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kideu ga kedi tei kerame Ih kedetlu</char></note> <verse eid="JER 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6" />Cine cu, Ih akatei aipau deudung pelane Babylon hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar a kilabe ba gage ha beu dida. Nah Ih luhdung ga kering kaunedung pecu habeu dida pe gwa tei kerane. <verse eid="JER 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7" />Kedanemene heleuh pelane pe gwa tei zie, pe napei, nah pe capei pe leuhbe kaudi kera ting gwangcang kemaktane. Pecai pa heleuhdung kekiee ge nah hegwang kedidung gwa tei dizie. <verse eid="JER 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8" />Cine heleuh nah hegwangram, Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar gwa tei kemakme, nah penui Babylon gwangpei kangga nlütlu kemakme, Ih cipau heleuhbe de kingtie, herakum, nah mateei le saja peu zie, aide RAMPAUBE ndukegai, Ih cidungde de pe ba le ngkapdi kemaktane. <verse eid="JER 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9" />Cine nnui gu caihakecimedung, mangnei kecumedung, gwang kera teilung ha kerangmedung, reka eh gwang kera teilung ha kerangmedung nah kerekame de kingnei so, nnuide kempau kebamme nah, ‘Babylon hegwangpei gwa tei so,’ de eh kerangme de. <verse eid="JER 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10" />Kedanemene penui cairasam rang eh nnuide cwa eh nnui deudung gade kemdei le ge nnuide langgi di kerane, kedanemene Ih nnuide gwagi dizie, nah nnui tsai zie. <verse eid="JER 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11" />Dede heleuh ge Babylon gwangpei kangga nlütlu nah pegwa tei lucai, Ih penuide peu cipau deu ga mtak luzie, aide RAMPAUBE ndukegai, nah penui cika tatyei nah penui ki tei luzie.”’”<verse eid="JER 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12" />Cine Ih Judah hegwangpei Zedekiah de resiu nah pecu samlia aide pau gaibeu, “Nnui Babylon hegwangpei kangga nlütlu nah pecu nah pe mina gwa teilu, iciulude nang ring luzie. <verse eid="JER 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13" />Nang nah n minadung, kingtie, herakum nah mateei le, daitei tsai lai, Babylon gwangpei gwa tei laklie kecu heleuh de ha Ih rang ndukegai de nzwa eh? <verse eid="JER 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14" />Caihakecime samdung kingnei so, cau nnuide ainzwa rangbeu bi, ‘Babylon gwangpei gwa tei so,’ kedanemene penui nnui dage kenret cairasam rangbeu bam. <verse eid="JER 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15" />‘Kedanemene Ih penuide lang mpet ma, aide RAMPAUBE ndukegai, kedanemene penui a zi gade cairasam rang eh cwa la ciulude Ih ncu gwa mpet dizie nah nang kap gah dizie, nang nah caihakecime n dage cairasam rang kebammedung.’”<verse eid="JER 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16" />Ih aide cingkumedung nah mina pelane dage rang ndu gaila, “RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangzeu: Nnui gu caihakecimedung ainzwa rang eh cairasam kerangme samdung kingnei so, ‘Pielo! RAMPAUBE ki niadung Babylon gade cu au keu cailigwang dai bam dida!’ Penui nnui dage kenret cairasam rang liabam. <verse eid="JER 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17" />Penui kwa kingnei so. Nnui Babylon gwangpei gwa tei eh lunghlu maisia. Daitei peu Jerusalem namdi aide kekap ge teidi laino? <verse eid="JER 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18" />Magade penui caihakecime lie cai, nah RAMPAUBE sam penui da gwang kesang lie cai, peu penuide Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE dade maniadung pe ki ga, Judah gwangpei kiga nah Jerusalem ga kebamdung de Babylon gage langgai dilak kerane nggia kie lulo. <verse eid="JER 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 27:19" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE hetsiadung, “Jaaidi” lie qu kela duibung kedide nah pe pakdung, nah namdi ga kebam kedaniadung ha ainzwa ranggai, <verse eid="JER 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 27:20" />Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar Judah gwangpei Jehoiakim napei Jehoiachin de tui keludau Judah nah Jerusalem ga kedime pelane de ngngwa lwe Jerusalem gade Babylon gage tet kegaidau aipau niadung de keu ma. <verse eid="JER 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 27:21" />Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, ainzwa rangbeu maniadung RAMPAUBE ki ga kai nzeu kebamdung, Judah hegwangpei ki de, nah Jerusalem ziemne ainzwa ranggai, <verse eid="JER 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 27:22" />‘Kerecaki mabamdung de Babylon ga keugwang luzie, nah penuide keugwang dai kera tingba riet beu kemakta cika ge kai nzeu zie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndukegai, pecai Ih penuide teu cuh luzie nah aipau bam ga teu cailigwang dai luzie.’”<verse eid="JER 27:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28" />
  <para style="s">Kenret Caihakecibe Hananiah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1" />Cipau kum, Judah gwangpei Zedekiah hegwang tei kerai dau, mmi mdai bekum nah kei mengei bekei, Azzur caihakecibe napei Hananiah, Gibeon nam gade kegwangbe, RAMPAUBE ki gade cingkumedung nah minadung pelane dwa gade pa a dage ainzwa rang, <verse eid="JER 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2" />“Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangzeu: Babylon gwangpei ngwanggai kai kegai de Ih tei pang dida. <verse eid="JER 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3" />Mmi kena kakgage Ih RAMPAUBE ki niadung aipau gage keu cailigwang dai luzie, Babylon hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ne Jerusalem gade keu pwa Babylon ga punggwang kedidung de. <verse eid="JER 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4" />Pecai Ih Judah hegwangpei Jehoiakim napei Jehoiachin nah Judah gade tui kelu Babylon ga langgai kedi hebaangmedung de aika ge ngngwa gwang dai luzie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndukegai, kedanemene Ih Babylon gwangpei ngwanggai de tei pang dizie lu.”<verse eid="JER 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5" />Cine caihakecibe Jeremiah, Hananiah caihakecibe de cingkumedung nah mina pelane RAMPAUBE ki ga sap kebamdung dwa gade resiu. <verse eid="JER 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6" />Caihakecibe Jeremiah ainzwa rang, “Peu RAMPAUBE de aide tei kelube teilu! Nang caihakecisam rang kegaidung peu RAMPAUBE de petau delie lulo nah heni aide gage RAMPAUBE ki gu maniadung nah tuiteu kedime pelane de Babylon gade keu gwang dai kelube teilo. <verse eid="JER 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7" />Dede Ih nnui dage nah mina pelane dage ndukegai sam de kingnei lulo. <verse eid="JER 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8" />Ndaa caihakecimedung n dwa ga nah a dwa ga kegwangmedung liede heleuhdung kekiee ge gu nah hegwangram kedidung, hereu, herakum nah mateeidung gu cairasam ranggwang da. <verse eid="JER 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9" />Cine caihakecibe kezuyi bam zie lie cairasam rang kegaide, magade pe sam gwang kesang lucai, ciucai pa caihakecibe RAMPAUBE ne langgai lie kecu ci luzie.” <verse eid="JER 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10" />Dede caihakecibe Hananiah ne caihakecibe Jeremiah ngwang gade ngwanggai de keulwe tei pangdi. <verse eid="JER 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11" />Pecai Hananiah mina pelane dwa gade, “RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangzeu: Aide siakte, mmi kena kakgage Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ne ngwanggai kai kegai de Ih heleuh ngwangdung gade teipang dizie.” Pecai caihakecibe Jeremiah pe lampui ga tet gwangdi.<verse eid="JER 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12" />Caihakecibe Hananiah ne, Jeremiah caihakecibe ngwang gade ngwanggai de teipang kedicai, RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah da ainzwa rang gwang, <verse eid="JER 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13" />“Hananiah de mie resiu eh rangbeu, ‘RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangzeu: Nang tsing gu ngwanggai teipang dida, dede Ih hegeu ngwanggai tei beuzie.’ <verse eid="JER 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14" />Kedanemene Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangzeu: Ih hegeu ngwanggai heleuhdung pelane ngwang gage kai beu dida, Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar gwa tei kerane, nah penui pe gwa tei zie. Ih pecu luhdung ga renaam kaunedung reu teu kera tei beu dida.” <verse eid="JER 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15" />Pecai caihakecibe Jeremiah ne, Hananiah caihakecibe dage rang, “Hananiah kingneilu! RAMPAUBE ncu langgai ma, dede nang nkatei mina aidungde de kenret nlum kera tei dida. <verse eid="JER 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16" />Cine RAMPAUBE ainzwa rang: Pielo, Ih ncu kideu gade lang mpetdi zieda. Nang hekum tsai zie, kedanemene nang RAMPAUBE de renia kera ndukegai ne.” <verse eid="JER 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17" />Cipau kum kei hena bekei, caihakecibe Hananiah tsaidi.<verse eid="JER 28:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29" />
  <para style="s">Langgi kedime dage Laisiu ge Kekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1" />Sam aidungde kehezui laisiu ga kebam, caihakecibe Jeremiah ne Jerusalem gade lang mpet bangh kebam hecingmedung nah cingkumedung, caihakecimedung nah Nebuchadnezzar ne Jerusalem gade Babylon gage tuigai kedi mina pelane dage. <verse eid="JER 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2" />Aide hegwangpei Jehoiachin, hegwangpui pui, nah kedimedung, Judah nah Jerusalem gu muiteumedung, nah heciemta keteimedung de Jerusalem gade lang gidi caine. <verse eid="JER 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3" />Pa kehezui laisiu de Judah gwangpei Zedekiah ne Shapan napei Elasah nah Hilkiah napei Gemariah ba gage Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar dage langgai. <verse eid="JER 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4" />Kehezui laisiu ga ainzwa rang, “Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, Ih Jerusalem gade Babylon gage gwa gai kedi hebaang tuiteu kela pelane dage ainzwa rang, <verse eid="JER 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5" />‘Kidung teilu delwe cika lunghlu. Hegurie teilu nah cipau tsi de tyeilu. <verse eid="JER 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6" />Henau teilu delwe nnui mipeinadung nah mipuinadung de mnalu. Pecai nnui napeidung nau tei beulu, nah nnui napuidung de pe nahpeidung de ha beulu. Peu penuide mipeinadung nah mipuinadung mnalu nah nnui luilung kieelu ciu eh Babylonia ga nnui cam zu di kelakne. <verse eid="JER 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7" />Ih nnuide gwa mie gai kedi namdidung ziemne kezuyi peeilu, nah penui keleu gade a dade kielu kedanemene penui da kezuyi bam cai nnui dade kezuyi bam zielu.’ <verse eid="JER 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8" />Kedanemene Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, ainzwa rangzeu, ‘Peu nnui kakga kebam nnui gu caihakecimedung mede caiha rang lubui lie kelame de peu nnuide cwadi helo, mede nang nkatei n mangdung mmi kebam de de kingnei so. <verse eid="JER 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9" />Kedanemene penui a zi gade nnui dage cairasam kenret rang bam. Ih penuide langgai ma, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndukegai.’<verse eid="JER 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE ainzwa rang, ‘Babylon ne nnuide mmi riakhena nnui reu teu kegwang dau, Ih nnuide ngha beuzie nah nnuide aipau heni ga nzang gwang dai beu zielie kecu a sam keyi de teicang beuzie. <verse eid="JER 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndukegai, kedanemene Ih rünne nnui ziemne riem pwa kela de ci, mariem cide kezuyi ziemne nah kengkap ziemne ma, nnuide gwang kera teilung nah keregui peu kerane. <verse eid="JER 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12" />Pecai nnui acu qu gai zie nah gwang a dade kekie tei zie, nah Ih nnuide kingnei luzie. <verse eid="JER 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13" />Kedanemene nnui acu peei zie nah acu ngau luzie, kedanemene nnui nnui nlung pelane le acu peei zielu. <verse eid="JER 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14" />Pecai nang ne acu ngau luzie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, nah Ih nnui mabamdung de pung cailigwang dai beuzie; Ih nnuide heleuhdung nah henidung pelane tei zang gai kedi gade hekwa dai luzie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, Ih nnuide gwagi kegaidung gade ngngwa gwang dai luzie.’<verse eid="JER 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE ne nnui ziemne Babylon ga caihakecime de teu cuh beu lie nnui rang, <verse eid="JER 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16" />David hegwangbam ga kebam hegwangpei de nah namdi ga kebam mina pelane dage RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangzeu, nnui sinabepeidung ncu ngngwa hebaang tuiteu kela ga tet kemakme, <verse eid="JER 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17" />Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ainzwa rang, ‘Pielo, Ih kingtie, herakum nah mateei penui dage langgai lauda. Kedanemene Ih mzai kemakme de tangzüttsidung tim eh tyei gai kelakbe nzwa tei dizie. <verse eid="JER 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18" />Pecai Ih penuide kingtie, herakum nah rapiadung le gwazui zie nah kideu ga hegwangramdung pelane miak ngau gade ngauhing cang siak kecu ge tei dizie. Kekeheu ge, reset kedi nah luu ta kedi kwa nah hengam ge dizie Ih penuide teizang kegai heleuhdung pelane ga. <verse eid="JER 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19" />Ainzwa teigai kecu au a kila caihakecimedung dade penui dage Ih sam lang kegaide penui kingnei ta kedine, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai. Ih penuide lang lwe lang daigai dede penui kingnei raudi, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.’ <verse eid="JER 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20" />Cine nnui nnuikatei RAMPAUBE sam kingneilu, pane Jerusalem gade gwa mpet Babylon gage kai kedime pelane.<verse eid="JER 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21" />‘Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, Kolaiah napei Ahab nah Maaseiah napei Zedekiah, a zi gade cairasam kenret rang kebambe ha ainzwa rangzeu: Pielo, Ih penuide Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ba gage kai di lauda. Pa nnui miak dwa gade penuide teitset dizie. <verse eid="JER 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22" />Pecai Babylon ga Judahme de tuiteu kelame mina aidung ha rang eh reset zie. Reset eh ainzwa rang zie: Peu RAMPAUBE de ncu Zedekiah nah Ahab nzwa tei dilu, Babylon gwangpei ne penaide mi gage nring ru kedi nzwa. <verse eid="JER 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23" />Aide teicang luzie kedanemene penui Israel ga hengam ta tei eh penui kidame nau de ngngwa kemmha ta tei nah Ih penuide madaude aja peugai kemak samdung teu a zi gade kenret sam rang kegaine. Kedanemene Ih penui daipai tei zie bi cibam; Ih zierang ketei be, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.’”<verse eid="JER 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24" />“Nehelam namceu gade kegwangbe Shemaiah ha ainzwa rang: <verse eid="JER 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25" />‘Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, ainzwa rangzeu: Nang Jerusalem ga mina pelane dage, Maaseiah cingkube napei Zephaniah de nah cingkumedung pelane de nkatei n zi gade laisiudung lang mpet eh ainzwa rang, <verse eid="JER 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26" />“RAMPAUBE ncu Jehoiada cingkube nding gade peu cingkupei tei luda, peu RAMPAUBE ki pie rengei kerane. Nang mina pelane caudungge penui katei penuide caihakecime tei pwabam bi cipaume reu pie kera n ta da. Nang penuide penui ngwang gage hegeukang nah hegeuria le kang dilu. <verse eid="JER 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27" />Cine cu, nang daitei Anathoth namceu gade kegwangbe Jeremiah de kesiu meno, pekatei pecu caihakecibe tei lu n lam sap kemakbe de? <verse eid="JER 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28" />Kedanemene pa anuide Babylon ga langgai nah ainzwa rang, ‘Cide peting ketie ge zie. Ki tei lwe cika lungh lu, nah hegurie tei lu nah pe tsidung de tyeilu.”’” <verse eid="JER 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29" />Cingkube Zephaniah cipau laisiu de pei gai, Caihakecibe Jeremiah kingneilu kebui gade. <verse eid="JER 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30" />Pecai RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah da sam ainzwa rang gwang, <verse eid="JER 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31" />“Langgi kedimedung pelane dage sam ainzwa langgai beulo, ‘RAMPAUBE Nehelamme pei Shemaiah ha ainzwa ranggai: Ih pecu langgai ma dede Shemaiah nnui dage cairasam rang, nah pa nnuide kenret samdung nlum kera puisau tei gaibeu, <verse eid="JER 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32" />ciziemne RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai: Pielo, Ih Nehelamme Shemaiah de nah pe leuhmedung de saja peu zie da. Mina aidung kak gade migede pelam sap ta dizie. Ih a minadung ziemne ma keyi tei kegai de pa ngau lak, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE de mlai kedine.’”<verse eid="JER 29:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30" />
  <para style="s">Israel de Teucuhkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1" />RAMPAUBE dade Jeremiah da sam ainzwa rang gwang, <verse eid="JER 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2" />“RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang ainzwa rang, ‘Ih n dage rang kegai sam leune laisiudum gage raulu. <verse eid="JER 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3" />Iciu eh pielu, pe tingbadung gwang la da, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, Ih a mina, Israel nah Judah medung teilung tei heci dai beuzie. Ih, RAMPAUBE, ranggai dida. Iciu eh Ih penui paumedung de hangdeu ha kebeu de ga penuide ngngwa cailigwang dai beuzie, nah penui gu teilu zie.’”<verse eid="JER 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4" />RAMPAUBE Israel nah Judah ziemne sam aidungde ranggai, <verse eid="JER 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5" />“Kedanemene RAMPAUBE ainzwa rang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:5">‘Anui mbeu kebam kengngi kwa ge siu da nah lungciep kwa ma.<verse eid="JER 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6" />Mipei ngiena mna lubui mi keteu pielo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:6">Daitei Ih rehangme leune mipui hena mna kecu nzwa pe za keba pwabam eh ngau no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:6">Daitei penui zudung hamhui dino?<verse eid="JER 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7" />Co! Cipau tingba de au kedi ge zie, kedadung nzwa lak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:7">Jacob ziemne lungrei tingge zie, dede cika de pecu keli luzie.<verse eid="JER 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8" />Kedanemene cipau tingba benai Ih nnui ngwang gade ngwanggai de teipang dizie, nah nnui geuriadung teitüt dizie, iciu eh nnui sangme baang teisi ta dizie, aide Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="JER 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9" />Dede penui RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang de reca zie nah Ih peu penui reu hegwang tei kegaibe penui gu hegwangpei David gwa tei zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 1:69, Bat. 2:30</char></note><verse eid="JER 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10" />Cine nang, a kilabe Jacob, ngngi so, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, nah n swa gah diso, Israel.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:10">Kedanemene pielu, Ih nnuide kemdei ga nah nnui leuhmedung hebaang tei kela deu gade ngnggwa gwang dai beu zie da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:10">Jacob cailigwang dai luzie nah kezuyi eh bam luzie; pecu gum luzie nah kehing de bam si lakta.<verse eid="JER 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11" />Kedanemene Ih n da lazie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, ncu kelilu kera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:11">Pecai Ih ne nnuide heleuhdung gage teizang kegaidung de de ngkap zingde dizie. Dede Ih ncu ngkap dilak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:11">Ih ncu kesangbe gade samzai peu tei bam liede ncu saja peu mene ta dilak.’<verse eid="JER 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangzeu, ‘Nnui rezamdung au tei mmi gai lakta; nnui gu rezam zamdung au siasüt dida.<verse eid="JER 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13" />Migede nnui mapie kera gah da; nnui gu rezam de tei mmi kera magede gah da.<verse eid="JER 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14" />Nnuide ku kebam pelane nnuide nsungta dida. Penui nnuide pie lakta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:14">kedanemene Ih nnuide ngauraume rezam le tei rezam dida nah kedibe pezai kesia de nzwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:14">n kesia kekiee ge nah n mau pei kap gai kelakdung ziemne.<verse eid="JER 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15" />Nnui daitei nnui gu rezamdung ziemne kengha kie bam no? Nnui teei kebam de au tei mmi gailak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:15">Nnui kesiadung kieesüt kecune nah nnui maudung pei kap gai kelakdung ziemne, Ih nnui da ma aidungde teigai.<verse eid="JER 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16" />Cine nnuide tuityei kelame de tuityei luzie, nah nnui ngauraume pelane de tuiteu tet dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:16">Kedanemene nnuide tei keherei kelame keherei dizie nah nnuide tei msia kelame pelane de tei msia dizie.<verse eid="JER 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17" />Kedanemene Ih nnuide teimmi dai beuzie; Ih nnui rezamdung teingkei beuzie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:17">Ih aide tei beuzie kedanemene penui nnuide: Gwa kedime de eh qu kecune. Migede Zion aide de peei meda.’”<verse eid="JER 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18" />RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangzeu, “Pielo, Ih Jacob ramzeuki maheidung teu gwang dai beu zieda nah pe kilungme dage ngaugia peu zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:18">Pecai kau eh ngkap kedi Jerusalem namdi tei dai luzie nah kengkiengbam ndaa kebam de ga bam dai dizie.<verse eid="JER 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19" />Pecai cika lungh kelame ketwa lei nah suiyi kwa penui dade ngau dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:19">kedanemene Ih penuide tei ngkiee beuzie nah penuide tei ncam dilak; Ih penuide herüt peu zie iciu eh penuide tei henah dilak.<verse eid="JER 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20" />Pecai penui gu minadung de ndaa nzwa dai luzie, nah penui hemaa de a dwa ga teu ncuh luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:20">Ih penuide tei keherei kela leune de saja peu kedi cai.<verse eid="JER 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21" />Penui muiteu penui kakgade gwang zie. Pa penui kakgade pet zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:21">Ih pecu qu kegai dau nah pa a da kegwang dau.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:21">Ih magade aide tei gai mecai, cau ge a taiga gwang nna beu lai?, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="JER 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22" />Pecai nnui a mina dizie nah Ih nnui Tinggwang dizie.<verse eid="JER 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23" />RAMPAUBE tingkai keci de pielo, pe rata au mpet dida. Tingkai keci cide au gwang daidai zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:23">Cide mina kesiame peudung ga nrui bam zie.<verse eid="JER 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24" />RAMPAUBE rata cide teicang di kemaktane cailigwang dailak nah pe lungning teicanglu kemakta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:24">Peting kekam le daune, pe minadung aide ci luzie.”<verse eid="JER 30:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1" />“Cipau tingdau—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—Ih Israel leuhme Tinggwang zie, nah penui a minadung zie.” <verse eid="JER 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2" />RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangzeu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:2">“Kingtie gade ring kelumedung hetaideu ga ziuyi ngau luda; Ih tetpet eh Israel de kemtak peuzie.”<verse eid="JER 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3" />RAMPAUBE ndaa a da gwang eh ainzwa ranggai, “Israel, Ih ncu penli kegah keku teu hunglie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:3">Cine Ih ncu kesamsang samkak teu eh ataiga ngngwa gwanglu.<verse eid="JER 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4" />Ih ncu teucuh daibeu zie cinzwa eh nang ngkieng luzie, kemci Israel.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:4">Nang tambourindung pwa dai luzie nah suiyi limdung lim dizie.<verse eid="JER 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5" />Nnui Samaria lamlwatudung gage kubebangdung ling daizie; hetaketamedung ling zie nah petsi de keu heta keyige tei luzie.<verse eid="JER 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6" />Kedanemene tingbazie ge gwang zie Ephraim lamlwatudung kekwamedung sah kera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:6">‘Cuhlu, anui Zion ga hang cugo RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang da.’<verse eid="JER 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE aide rangla, “Nnui suiyi eh Jacob reu gage sah gailu! Heleuhdung kakde ditube ziemne suiyi sah gailu! Peu ketwa de siugai. Ranglu, ‘RAMPAUBE pe minadung de kelibeu da, bangh kebam Israelme de.’<verse eid="JER 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8" />Pielo, Ih a minadung de tingtünle deudung gade ngngwa gwang zie. Ih penuide kideu deitu ga dungde hekwa luzie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:8">Miakcitme na pisiame penui kakga la zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:8">tetlak puidung nah mna lai eh kebam puidung penui da lazie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:8">Hemaa kedi ge aika cailigwang zie.<verse eid="JER 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9" />Penui hap eh gwang zie; Ih penui puisau tei zie penui kie kecu dau. Ih penuide</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:9">reuceunadung taiga lampui kemzui ga peu tet zie. Cika penui kau dilak, kedanemene Ih Israel pei tei zielu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:9">nah Ephraim a neraibe zie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Cor. 6:18</char></note><verse eid="JER 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10" />“RAMPAUBE sam kingneilu, heleuhdung. Duididung kemdei ga paulia lo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:10">Nnui heleuhdung ainzwa ranglo, ‘Israel de teizangra kedibe pecu teu hekwa nah kwabam, meurün kekwame ge pe meurün de kwa kela nzwa.’<verse eid="JER 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE Jacob de lung mpet beu dida nah pe ziemne ngkieng zu kecu ba gade pecu keli luda.<verse eid="JER 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12" />Pecai penui suiyi eh Zion deutudung ga gwang zie. Penui zudung RAMPAUBE keyi dene baa luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:12">mei nah zau keheci reuga, maca nah meurünnadung nah hekaunedung reuga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:12">Kedanemene penui teilung au hegurie dui hetau kelubedung nzwa zie, nah penui madauge de penui suisia dailak.<verse eid="JER 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13" />Pecai relei kemcime penui suiyi eh helimlim zie, nah hecing hena ngngwa ket tei zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:13">Kedanemene Ih penui kehap de tei kedi pwa suiyi tei beuzie. Ih penuide ngaunggia zie nah peu penui suiyi luzie penui sui sia di mene.<verse eid="JER 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14" />Pecai Ih taktyei yitube pwa cingkume teilung kepui tei beuzie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:14">A minadung a keyi le penuide teipui luzie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.”<verse eid="JER 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15" />RAMPAUBE aide ranggai, “Ramah gade makwa ge siu, helung sia nah hapsüt kecu kwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:15">Cide Rachel pe name ziemne hap bam. Pa penui ziemne pelung relui tadi, kedanemene penui lunghbam me de kecu ziemne.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:18">Mat. 2:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16" />RAMPAUBE aide ranggai, “Nang kehap gade n kwa nah n miak gade miakduidung kezeulu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:16">n ta ziemne ziehi ge bam—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—n name ngauraume deu gade cailigwang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 21:4, Hos. 1:11</char></note><verse eid="JER 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17" />N caiha ziemne keregui bam—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—n leuhmedung penui herai lung le cailigwang luzie.”<verse eid="JER 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18" />“Ephraim ainzwa eh pe suisiet rang kebam Ih siu da, ‘Nang acu saja peu, nah hetumna cenlu kemakbe de nzwa acu saja peu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:18">Acu ngngwa cailigwang beulo nah acu ngngwa cailigwang luzie, kedanemene nang RAMPAUBE a Tinggwang lu.<verse eid="JER 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19" />Kedanemene Ih n da nreu gwang dai kelu cai, Ih a sui sia di; acu cen kelu cai, Ih a mnie hepeu gai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:19">Ih ngngam nah hengam teidi, kedanemene Ih henadau mau pung kebam de ziemne.’<verse eid="JER 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20" />Ephraim pemi kehung a na meni? Ih hung kela, a suiyi napei meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:20">Kedanemene Ih pedage a rata sam rang kegai dau liede, Ih pecu qu eh nsung bamla. Ainzwa eh a nlung pecu regui la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:20">Ih pecu ngaunggia beu zie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.”<verse eid="JER 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21" />Nkatei nziemne lampuiki rehi teilwe kailu. Nkatei nziemne puisau tsingdung sum gailu. Lampui kenzuibe cetlu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:21">nang tet kera lampui de, Cailigwanglu, Israelme! N namdidung ga cailigwang dailu.<verse eid="JER 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22" />Daitie ge nang suisa laino, kenlum kegah napoi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:22">Kedanemene RAMPAUBE kideu ga makeheci ge teigai da—mipui gene mipei kengkieng gede gum kebam.<verse eid="JER 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23" />Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla, “Ih minadung de penui deu ga ngngwa cailigwang kecudau, Judah deu gade nah pe namdidung gade penui ainzwa rang zie, ‘RAMPAUBE de peu ncu samlam beu, pa lungh kebam nang kemzui ni , nang kemci lamlwa.’ <verse eid="JER 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24" />Kedanemene Judah nah pe namdidung peciakne cika lungh ncüt zie, hetaketamedung nah makaune hau de ngngwa kepetmedung de si eh. <verse eid="JER 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25" />Kedanemene Ih leu kelame de peu sak zie, nah mnei kelame de teipui beuzie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 11:28, Luk. 6:21</char></note> <verse eid="JER 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26" />Pecai Ih mrak di, nah Ih zip kegai ziemne acu teimcang kebeu Ih cilu.<verse eid="JER 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27" />“Pielo, tingbaziedung gwang lada—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—Ih Israel nah Judah kidung ga mina nah makaune namedung le tei pui luzie. <verse eid="JER 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28" />Gwang kedi lebie, Ih penuide ncet eh bam penuide pai mpet nah teukau, kelien gi, ngkapdi nah tei rezam di kerane. Dede gwang dai kela tingbaziedung ga, Ih penui ma pie luzie, penuide teucuh beu nah lingbeu kerane—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai. <verse eid="JER 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29" />Cipau tingdau migede ainzwa rangsi lak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:29">‘Mipeidung kubetsi kehiadung tyeilu, dede hename gei rehimdi.’ <verse eid="JER 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30" />Kedanemene mikeheibede pekatei pemau ziemne tsai zie; nah mina keheibede kubetsi kehia ketyeime, pe gei rehim zie.<verse eid="JER 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31" />Pielo, tingbaziedung gwang lada—</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:31">Ih Israelme nah Judahme de ngngwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">samkak keheci ge tei kera.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 26:28, Luk. 22:20, 1 Cor. 11:25, 2 Cor. 3:6, Heb. 8:8-9</char></note><verse eid="JER 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32" />Cide Ih penui paumedung</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">ba teu lu eh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">Egyptme deu gade ngngwa mpet kecu samkak de nzwa lak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:32">kedanemene penui a samkak de teipang dida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">Ih penui dade mi nahpei ge nzwa liede—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:32">aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="JER 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33" />Tingbazie aidungde cai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">samkak aide</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:33">Ih Israelme de ngngwa tei luzie—</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:33">Ih agu hezai aide penui lung gage kaibeu zie nah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">penui nlung gage raugai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:33">kedanemene Ih penui Tinggwang zie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">nah penui a minadung zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Cor. 3:3, Heb. 8:10-11, Rom. 11:26-27</char></note><verse eid="JER 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34" />Iciu eh mi keheibede pe kidabe de ledeu si lakta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">mede mige pe sinabe de ainzwa eh rang lakta, ‘RAMPAUBE de cilu!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:34">Kedanemene penui pelane acu ci luzie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">penui kakgade ceutu gade gwang ditu kecang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:34">kedanemene Ih penui mau gibeu zie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">nah penui maudung nsung si lakta.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 The. 4:9, Bat. 10:43, Heb. 10:17</char></note><verse eid="JER 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">pane tingna tingnaimiak de peu baa kera teigai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">nah hekei nah hegidung de tingmui baa kera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:35">Pa duicuidung de peu nra kerane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">jaaidi tei nswak gaila—</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:35">Pezi au tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE.<verse eid="JER 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, “Magade kelungta bammui kela ma aidungde a dwa gade gah dicai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:36">Israel namedung a dwa gade heleuh ge teikela de kelungta mtak di zieni.”<verse eid="JER 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla, “Magade tinggim cehutu de mdet lu liecai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:37">nah magade hangdeu bangdwadung peilu di liecai, penui tei kegaidung pelane ziemne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:37">Ih Israel namedung de mlaidi zieni—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.”<verse eid="JER 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, “Pielo, tingbaziedung gwang lada, Hananel reketbam lütle de Kimiak Rieki kecang ga, Jerusalem namdi de a ziemne retak dai luzie. <verse eid="JER 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39" />Iciu eh kemdet ria de kemdei ga miecang dai zie, Gareb deutu nah Goah twagwa pung kebam ga. <verse eid="JER 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40" />Hangdeu langkam pelane ketsai paaudung nah mimangbüt kebam, nah luhdung pelane Kidron deu ga pet eh tingnaimiak kepetle Hekwen Kirie kecang ga, RAMPAUBE ziemne keu ntsam luzie. Namdi de madaude tei msia nah ngkap dai dilak.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 22:20, 1 Cor. 11:25, 2 Cor. 3:6, Heb. 13:20</char></note><verse eid="JER 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32" />
  <para style="s">Jeremiah Luh ge Luikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1" />Judah gwangpei Zedekiah hegwang tei kelu mmi kerei bekum RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah da gwang, Nebuchadnezzar hegwang tei kelu mmi kereieheset bekum de. <verse eid="JER 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2" />Cipau tingdau, Babylon hegwangpei reugwamedung Jerusalem twagwalu, nah caihakecibe Jeremiah de Judah hegwangpei kiga kekwame kigu gage baangdi. <verse eid="JER 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3" />Judah hegwangpei Zedekiah pecu baangdi nah ranggai, “Nang daitei caihasam rang eh aide rang lano, ‘RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Pielo, Ih namdi be aide Babylon hegwangpei ba gage kaibeu zieda, nah pane aide gum luzie. <verse eid="JER 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4" />Judah hegwangpei Zedekiah Chaldeanme ba gade pak gailak, kedanemene pecu Babylon hegwangpei ba gage tuigai beu bi dizie kecune. Pe mui le hegwangpei de resiu zie, nah pe miak le hegwangpei miak ngau zie. <verse eid="JER 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5" />Pa Zedekiah de Babylon ga ngngwa mie dizie, nah Ih pecu ngngwa bata teidi kemaktane pa cika bam zie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai. Nang Chaldeanme de regi bam liede, nnui yi gailak.’”<verse eid="JER 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6" />Jeremiah ranggai, “RAMPAUBE sam a da ainzwa rang gwang, <verse eid="JER 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7" />‘Pielo, Shallum napei Hanamel n pau n taiga gwang zie nah rang zie, “Anathoth ga kebam a deu de nang lui lulo, kedanemene luilu kebui qwa n da kebamne.”’” <verse eid="JER 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8" />Pecai, RAMPAUBE ndu kegai nzwa, Hanamel, a pau napei, a taiga kekwame kigu ga gwang, nah pa a dage ranggai, “Benjamin deu ga Anathoth ga kebam a deu de lui lulo, kedanemene mapwame qwa de ngu delu, nah luilu kebui qwa n da kebamne. Nkatei n ziemne cide luilu.” Iciu eh Ih aide RAMPAUBE sam lie kecu cilu. <verse eid="JER 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9" />Cine Ih Anathoth ga hangdeu de a pau napei Hanamel dade luilu, nah Ih pecu rangkanggeu perüt mdet beudi, perüt shekel kereiehena.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:9">Mat. 27:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:10">10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10" />Pecai Ih kehezui laisiukwak gage rau gailu nah cide kaudap kaidi, nah peu mide zierang teidi. Pecai Ih rangkanggeu de mdet beudi. <verse eid="JER 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11" />Pecai Ih lui kelu licak laisiu de keulu, aja de nah hezaidung kebam de, ngkui kemak laisiu de de si eh. <verse eid="JER 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12" />Ngkui kedi laisiu de Ih Neriah napei Baruch, Mahseiah capei Hanamel, a pau napei dwa gade peudi, nah ngkui pwa kebam laisiu ga zierangme, nah Jewme pelane kekwame kigu ga ntum bam kecume dwa gade peudi. <verse eid="JER 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 32:13" />Cine Ih Baruch de penui dwa gade aja kaigai. Ih ranggai, <verse eid="JER 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 32:14" />“Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, ainzwa rangzeu: Licak laisiu aidungde keulu, ngkui pwa kebam nah ngkui mene kebamdung, nah cide lidei bung gage kailu iciude peting ketie ge bamlu kerane. <verse eid="JER 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15" />Kedanemene tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangzeu: Kidung, luhdung, nah kubetsi luhdung de hangdeu aide gade lui daizie.”<verse eid="JER 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16" />Lui kelu laisiu de Ih Neriah napei Baruch de peu kedi cai, Ih RAMPAUBE da kekie tei eh ranggai, <verse eid="JER 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17" />“Oh, RAMPAUBO! Pielo! Nang nkatei n kengkieng nah n ba hwa gai eh tinggimdung nah kideu teilu. Nang kerang leune magede nang tei kepa gah. <verse eid="JER 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18" />Mina pecang pecang de de nang n samkak kelu samsang de lia la nah mina maudung ruipwa penui cai penui namedung dage rui gaila. Nang kedi nah kengking Tinggwang be da; n zi au tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE. <verse eid="JER 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19" />Nang au n maci hu nah n batadung au ngkieng, kedanemene nang au mina ketei leune piebam la, penui teilung lungh kegai ria gade nah penui tei kegai ria gade penui ziehi teibeu kerane. <verse eid="JER 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20" />Egypt deu ga nang marengeidung nah miswakegah batadung teigai. Henai tingba kecang de nang Israel aika nah heleuh leune kakga, nang peu n zi de ndu bam dida. <verse eid="JER 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21" />Kedanemene nang n Israel minadung de Egypt gade marengei nah miswakegah batadung tei kegai gade ngngwa mpet beu, kengkieng ba de le, hwa pwa kebam ba de le, nah ngaukehing kedi de le. <verse eid="JER 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22" />Pecai nang penuide kideu aide peudi—penui paumedung de nang pwapeu zielie sampet kebeu de—tungdui nah heliadui lwa kebam deu de. <verse eid="JER 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23" />Cine penui nlüt eh cide gumlu. Dede penui n sam mzai ma mede n hezaidung de mzui luma. Nang tei lulo kebeu leune penui magede teima, cine nang penui reu gage kekap aidungde keugwanggai. <verse eid="JER 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24" />Pielo! Namdi be ngamlu kerane kekwaki namdi ga kui cang luda. Kingtie, herakum, nah mateei ziemne namdi de pecu renia kela Babylonme ba gage kai dida. Tei gwang zie lie de nang rang kegaidung de teibam dida, nah pielo, nang ngaubam dida. <verse eid="JER 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25" />Pecai nang nkatei a dage ranggai, “Rangkanggeu de le nang nkatei nziemne luh ge luilu nah peu mina de zierang tei beulu, Babylonme de namdi aide peu lai eh bam liede.”<verse eid="JER 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26" />RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah da ainzwa rang gwang, <verse eid="JER 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27" />“Pielo! Ih RAMPAUBE da, heleuh leune Tinggwang. Magede a ziemne teipa kecu bam ni? <verse eid="JER 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28" />Cine RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘Pielo, Ih namdi aide Babylonme nah Babylon hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ba gage peudi lauda. Pa cide tui luzie. <verse eid="JER 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29" />Namdi de regi kebam Babylonme gwang eh namdi aide mi twa gai zie nah ru dizie, mina ki reuga kidung ga Baal de reca nah hera kedadung de zau ratak ruigai beu eh a rata teibam kedidung de si zie. <verse eid="JER 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30" />Israelme nah Judahme penui heri heret tingdau a miakngau gade makesia tei kegwangme. Israelme penui bata gade a rata tei dida—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai. <verse eid="JER 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31" />Namdi aide tei kelu benai gade a rata nah a lungka tei la dida de eh RAMPAUBE ndu gai. Cide henai kecang de cinzwa bam. Cine Ih cide a dwa gade keugi dizie <verse eid="JER 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32" />Israelme nah Judahme kesiadung de ziemne, a rata ketei batadung de ziemne—penui, penui hegwangmedung, hegwang napeimedung, cingkumedung, caihakecimedung, nah Judah ga kebam leune nah Jerusalem kelunghme leune. <verse eid="JER 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33" />Acu ncwa mene nreu tetdi, Ih penuide helung kai eh ledeu gai beu liede. Ih penuide ledeu kera tei iciu eh petau lie kegaide luulu kerane, dede migede kingnei ma. <verse eid="JER 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34" />Penui penui kemneu mamiedung a zi le qu kela be ki gage kailu, cide tei hera di kerane. <verse eid="JER 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35" />Molech ziemne mi gage pe napeimedung nah pe napuimedung de kai kerane penui Ben Hinnom Langkam ga Baal ziemne heni kecehudung teigai. Ih penuide aja peu ma. Penui kemneu ta aide tei eh Judah de peu kemau teidi kera madau gede Ih cetgai ma.’<verse eid="JER 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36" />Cine cu au, Ih, RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, namdi be aide ziemne ranggai, nang rang kebam namdi be de, ‘Babylon hegwangpei ba gage cide kingtie, herakum, nah rapia le peu dida.’ <verse eid="JER 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37" />Pielo, Ih a lunghop, rata nah a deiga le penuide gwa gi kedi nam leune gade penuide ngngwa hekwa dai di zieda. Ih penuide peu kwak eh lunghlu kerane heni aide gage ngngwa gwang dai beu lauda. <verse eid="JER 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38" />Iciulude penui a mina dizie, nah Ih penui Tinggwang dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Cor. 6:16</char></note> <verse eid="JER 32:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39" />Ih penuide lung ge nah lampui ge tingnai ramsangne acu rüt kerane peu zie iciu eh cide penui ziemne nah penui cai penui leuhme ziemne de yilu kerane. <verse eid="JER 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40" />Pecai Ih madauge de penui da makeyi tei kera gade nreu tet di kelak ne Ih penui dage kelungta samkak ge tei zie. Ih penui mlung ga peu acu rüt kera teigai zie, iciu eh penui a dade madauge de nreu tetti kelakne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 22:20, 1 Cor. 11:25, 2 Cor. 3:6, Heb. 13:20</char></note> <verse eid="JER 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41" />Pecai Ih penui dage makeyi tei kegaine a sui yizie. Ih a mlung pelane nah a teilung pelane teu eh penuide hangdeu aide ga samsang eh linggai zie.<verse eid="JER 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘Mina aidungde dage kengkap kehung aide teugwang kegai nzwa, iciu eh penui dage Ih makeyidung teibeu zie lie rang kegaidung de Ih penui reuga teugwang beu zie. <verse eid="JER 32:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43" />Pecai hangdeu aide ga luhdung de lui luzie, nang pe ha rang kebam de, “Hangdeu aide kesia deu ge, mina nah makaune ge de kegah deu ge. Babylonme ba gage cide peu dida.” <verse eid="JER 32:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, Penui rangkanggeu le luhdung lui zie nah ngkui pwa kebam laisiu gage rau zie. Penui zierangmedung de Benjamin deu gage hekwalu zie, Jerusalem twagwa kebam ga nah Judah namdidung ga, kideutu deudi namdidung nah kehena deudung ga, nah Negev namdidung ga. Kedanemene Ih penui mabamdung keugwang dai beu zielu.’”<verse eid="JER 32:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33" />
  <para style="s">Teucuhlu kera Sampetkebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1" />Pecai Jeremiah da pia kenabe RAMPAUBE sam gwang, pa kekwame kigu ga bam reu kecudau, aiciu rang eh, <verse eid="JER 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2" />“RAMPAUBE, dam kegaibe ainzwa rang lie— RAMPAUBE,kideu tei lwe pebam ga kai kelube—Pezi au RAMPAUBE, <verse eid="JER 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3" />‘Acu qu gailu, iciulude Ih nnui sam kelibeu zie. Ih nnui dage ma kedi nah nnui cikemak miswakegah teilia gaizie.’ <verse eid="JER 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang ainzwa rang au, namdi aide ga kebam kidung, Judah gwangpei kidung nah lampuidung kingtie le gwa lüt kecudau teimsia kedidung ziemne ranggai, <verse eid="JER 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5" />‘Babylonme regi kera gwang lada nah Ih a lunghop nah a rata le teitset kedi mina ketsaipaau dele ki puidi kerane, Ih a zu namdi aide dade penui kesia ziemne hebai dida. <verse eid="JER 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6" />Dede pielo, Ih teikemmi nah tei hemi lu kela keugwang beu lauda, kedanemene Ih penuide tei ngkei beuzie nah penuide kepui kenlim, lungciep, nah kesamsang teugwang beuzie. <verse eid="JER 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7" />Kedanemene Judah nah Israel gu mabamdung keugwang dai beuzie; Ih penuide kerai dau tei kegai nzwa teigai dai beuzie. <verse eid="JER 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8" />Pecai penui a dage makesia tei kegaidung nah acu renia kecudung gade penuide teimci beuzie. A dage makesia tei kegaidung de, nah acu renia gwang kecu leune gade Ih penui mau gibeu zie. <verse eid="JER 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9" />Kedanemene Jerusalem namdi aide a sui keyi ge dizie lu, ketwa lei ge nah Ih makeyi teibeu kera leune siu keludau kideu heleuh leunedung ziemne herüt ge zie. Pecai penui ngngi nah mbeu dizie Ih penuide makeyidung nah lungciep peu lai eh kebam de ziemne.’<verse eid="JER 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 33:10" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘Nang cu rang kebam heni aide ga, “Aide au mrwa dida, mina nah makaune bam kemak heni ge,” Judah namdidung ga, nah Jerusalem puididung au mina nah makaune bam mene mrwa kebamdung ga, cika siu dai luzie, <verse eid="JER 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 33:11" />misui yisüt kecu kwa nah suiyi kwa, hemeupei kwa nah hemeupui kwa, RAMPAUBE ki gage ketwa recadung teu kegwangdau rang kegai kwadung, “Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE de hetwa peulo, kedanemene RAMPAUBE au yi kecune nah nlidi la kemak pe keku bam muila!” Ih kideube mahei de ndaa kebam nzwa tei dai beuzie,’ RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai.<verse eid="JER 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12" />Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide ranggai: ‘Mrwa kebam heni aide ga, cu au aika mina nah makaune gah—pe namdi leune ga meurün kekwame pe kaune de peu mtak nah tyei kerane tsehei bam dai luzie. <verse eid="JER 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13" />Deudi hangdeutu ga kebam namdidung, hedeu kehenadung, nah Negev ga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tingpile hangdeuketsai lebie</char></note>, Benjamin deu ga nah Jerusalem ga twagwa kebam, nah Judah namdidung ga, hekaunedung penuide pei kebambe ba kangga tet dai zie,’ RAMPAUBE ainzwa eh ranggai.<verse eid="JER 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14" />‘Pielo! Tingbaziedung gwang lada—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—Ih Israel leuhme nah Judah leuhme dage a sam pet kegaide teicang beu kerade. <verse eid="JER 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15" />Cipau tingbaziedung nah cipau tingdau Ih kesamsang leuhme ge David ziemne lungpet beu kera teibeu zie, nah pa kemzuibe nah kesamsang penui deu ga teugwang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 11:1-5, Jhn. 7:42</char></note> <verse eid="JER 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16" />Cipau tingdau Judah de kelibeu zie, nah Jerusalem kwak eh lunghbam luzie, kedanemene pecu ainzwa eh qu zie, “RAMPAUBE au anui gu kesamsang be.”’ <verse eid="JER 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE aide rangla: ‘David leuhme gade Israelme hegwangbam ga bam kera madauge de gah dilak, <verse eid="JER 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18" />mede Levi leuhme gade cingkume a dwaga keru ratak teigai kera gah dilak, taktyei recadung ru kera, nah mei recadung teibeu mui kera.’”<verse eid="JER 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19" />RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah da ainzwa rang gwang, <verse eid="JER 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20" />“RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangzeu: ‘Magade nang a samkak de tingmui tingba de le teipang di lubui cai, iciu eh petingsiak dau tingmui tingba tei ta dicai, <verse eid="JER 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21" />iciucai nang a kilabe David da a samkak kelude teipang di lubui, iciu eh pe hegwangbam ga bam kera pe na bam ta dizie, nah a kilamedung, Levi leuhme gade cingkume da a samkak kelude. <verse eid="JER 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22" />Tingkam ga hegi peicang gai kelak nzwa, nah hereukung ga heciang mdet gai kelak nzwa, cinzwa Ih a kilabe David leuhme de tei ngkiee beuzie nah a gwa tei kela Levime de.’”<verse eid="JER 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23" />RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah da gwang eh ranggai, <verse eid="JER 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24" />“Penui rang ndu lia kegaide nang cet mning pie gai meni penui aide rang ndu kegaidau, ‘RAMPAUBE ne kedet kelu kelak kena Israel penai Judah, cu au pa ci kena de mlai dide meni’? Penui miakdwa gade au penui au heleuhme ge medelie de ainzwa eh penui a mina de ngkaudi. <verse eid="JER 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25" />Ih, RAMPAUBE, aide rangla, ‘Tingmui tingba gu samkak de Ih teilu mecai, nah magade Ih tinggim nah kideu gu hezai teibeu lu mereu cai, <verse eid="JER 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26" />iciucai Ih Jacob leuhme nah David a kilabe de gidi zie, nah Abraham, Isaac, nah Jacob leuhme reu hegwang teigwang kera penui leuhme gade peu pet tadi zie. Kedanemene Ih peu penuide lungyi dai luzie nah penuide ngaunggia beu zie.’”<verse eid="JER 33:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34" />
  <para style="s">Zedekiah de Mrairang kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 34:1" />Babylon hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar nah pe reugwame pelane, kideu gu hegwangram leune de si eh, pe kengkieng kangga henidung, nah pe minadung leune Jerusalem nah pe namdidung de renia eh hereu tei kecudau Jeremiah da RAMPAUBE sam gwang eh ranggai, <verse eid="JER 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 34:2" />“RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide ranggai: Miecu nah Judah hegwangpei Zedekiah de resiu eh pecu rang beulu, ‘RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Pielo, Ih namdi aide Babylon hegwangpei de peu di lauda. Pa cide ru dizie. <verse eid="JER 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3" />Nang pe ba gade pak gailak, kedanemene ncu tuilwe pe ba gage kai dizie. N miak le Babylon hegwangpei miak de pie zie; nang Babylon ga mie kecudau ncu pa resiu zie.’ <verse eid="JER 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4" />RAMPAUBE sam kingneilo, Judah hegwangpei Zedekiah! RAMPAUBE n ziemne aide rangla, ‘Nang kingtie gade tsai lak. <verse eid="JER 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5" />Nang n lung nciep eh tsai zie. Tsaibai ta ketei dau n paume de keru nzwa, n dwa hegwang tei kegwangmedung, penui n paau ru zie. Penui rang zie, “Anui mpaubo!” Penui n ziemne hei eh hap zie. Ih cu ranggai dida—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.’”<verse eid="JER 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6" />Cine caihakecibe Jeremiah, Judah hegwangpei Zedekiah dage sam aidungde Jerusalem gade rang ndulia gai. <verse eid="JER 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7" />Babylon hegwangpei gu reugwame Jerusalem nah Judah ga bangh kebam namdidung de ngngwa hereu tei: Lachish nah Azekah. Judahme namdi aidungde rie kelube namdi tei bamdi.<verse eid="JER 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hebaangme ziemne Suirang ketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8" />Hegwangpei Zedekiah Jerusalem ga kebam minadung dage peu penuide hebaang tei lak delie de eh samkak tei kelu cai RAMPAUBE dade Jeremiah da sam gwang, <verse eid="JER 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9" />peu mige ge kecu pe kilabaang tei kebam Hebrewme de lungmpet di kera, mipei de nah mipui de, cine migede Judahme de pe kilabaang tei lak, pe sinabe de. <verse eid="JER 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10" />Cine muiteume leune nah minadung gwang eh mige ge kecu pe kila mipei nah mipui de de lungmpet eh peu penuide kilabaang tei si dai di melu kerane samkak teilu. Penui cide mneilu nah penuide lung mpetti. <verse eid="JER 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11" />Dede aide cai cipau kedimedung nah minadung penui lung mreu di. Penui lungmpet kedi kiladung de ngngwa gwang dailu. Penui penui kemei tei eh peu kilabaang tei daidi.<verse eid="JER 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12" />Cine RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah da ainzwa rang gwang, <verse eid="JER 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13" />“RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, ainzwa ranggai, ‘Ih ne n paume de Egyptme deu, kilabaang ki gade ngngwa mpet kebeu dau Ih ne n paume dage samkak ge teilu. Cidau Ih aide ranggai, <verse eid="JER 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14" />‘Mmi hena ge cang kedicai, mige ge kecu pe sinabe de langgi dizie, Hebrewme ge pekatei pecu n dage zwa gai kebeube de nah mmi herok ge n kila tei kebambe. Pecu lungmpet beu dilu.’ Dede n paume a sam kingnei ma mede a dage penui lung kai ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 15:1,12</char></note> <verse eid="JER 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15" />Cu au nnui nnui mau pet luda nah a miakngau gade petaube tei bam dida. Nnui lungmpet beu kera de ndu gai, mige ge kecu pe kidacaina dage, nah nnui a dage a zi gade qu kela ki de gade samkaklu. <verse eid="JER 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16" />Dede nnui nreu tetdi nah a zi tei heradi; nnui minadung de pe kilapei nah pe kilapui de de ngngwa gwang dai kera kecung gai, penui sui ra ga mie kera langmpet kedime de. Nnui penui kemei tei eh kilabaang tei dailu.’<verse eid="JER 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17" />Cine RAMPAUBE aide ranggai, ‘Nnui a sam kingnei luma. Nnui lungmpet beu kera de ndulia gai kerabe ge, nnui pelane, nnui sinamedung dage nah Israelmedung dage. Cine pielo! Ih nnuide lungmpet beu kera ndu lia gai zie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—nnuide kingtie, rapia, nah herakum da lungmpet beuzie, kedanemene Ih nnuide kideu ga hegwangram leune dwa gade ngau kehing ge tei gaizie. <verse eid="JER 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 34:18" />Pecai a samkak de gileu kedime da Ih heta tei zie, penui a dwa gade hetumseu gede dim zina tei kelu kakga tet kecudau samkak tei kelu de mzai luma, <verse eid="JER 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 34:19" />nah Judah nah Jerusalem muiteume, eunuchme nah cingkume, nah cipau deu ga mina pelane hetumseu dim zina tei pwa kebam kakga tet. <verse eid="JER 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20" />Ih penuide penui ngauraume ba gage kai dizie nah penuide teitset zie lie peei kelame ba gage. Penui paaudung au tingkam nruinedung nah kideu ga makaunedung ziemne taktyei dizie. <verse eid="JER 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21" />Cine Ih Judah hegwangpei Zedekiah nah pe muiteumedung de penui ngauraume ba gage nah penuide teitset zie lie peei kelame ba gage kai dizie, nah ncu renia zie lie eh cuh kelu Babylon hegwangpei gu reugwame ba gage kai dizie. <verse eid="JER 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22" />Pielo, Ih nnuide aja ge peu zie—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—nah penuide Jerusalem namdi aide ga ngngwa gwang dailu eh peu cide de hereu tei eh gwaketang zie nah tui luzie, nah peu ru dizie. Kedanemene Ih Judah namdidung de de teimsia pwa peu migede lungh ta kedi heni ge tei dizie.’”<verse eid="JER 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35" />
  <para style="s">Rekab leuhme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1" />Josiah napei Jehoiakim Judah gwangpei hegwang tei kebam dau RAMPAUBE dade Jeremiah da sam ainzwa rang gwang, <verse eid="JER 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2" />“Rekabme kibaume da miecu nah penuide resiulo. Pecai penuide a kiga ngngwa gwanglu, cika kibung ge kebam gage, nah penuide sak kera zau peulo.” <verse eid="JER 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3" />Cine Ih Habazziniah capei Jeremiah napei Jaazaniah nah pe sinamedung, nah pe napeidung, nah Rekab kibaume pelane de ngngwalu. <verse eid="JER 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4" />Ih penuide RAMPAUBE ki gage, Igdaliah napei Hanan, pa Tinggwang minabe, pe napeime kibung gage ngngwa gwanglu. Kibung aidungde muiteume kibung taiga bam, cidungde Shallum napei Maaseiah kirie kekwabe kibung peureu ga bam. <verse eid="JER 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5" />Pecai Ih Rekabme dwa gage hekwakdung nah hepiakdung zau le kai puilu eh kaibeu nah penui dade, “Zau sak gai lulo,” debeu <verse eid="JER 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6" />Dede penui ranggai, “Anui au zau sak lak, kedanemene anui paume, Rekab napei Jonadab, anui dage aja kaibeu, ‘Nnui mede nnui leuhme kelungta zau sak so. <verse eid="JER 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7" />Delwe, ki gede tei so, maleuh ge de ling so, mede kubetsibang gede ling so; aide nnui ziemne ma. Kedanemene nnui paiki ga nnui teilung lungh kerabe, iciu eh nnui sangme ge tei eh lung kebam hangdeu ga tingbazie kekiee ge lunghlu kerane.’ <verse eid="JER 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8" />Anui Rekab napei Jonadab sam mzai luda, anui pau, anuide pa aja peu kebeu leune, anui, anui naudung, anui napeimedung, nah anui napuimedung, anui tingdau zau sak kelak de. <verse eid="JER 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9" />Anui madaude lungh kera ki tei lak, nah kubeluh gede, mede heleuhtsi gede anui da bamlak. <verse eid="JER 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10" />Anui paikidung ga lungh da nah anui pau Jonadab anui dage aja kai kebeu leune anui tei mzai nah tei gaida. <verse eid="JER 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11" />Dede Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar penui deu gwaketang kecudau, anui hangge ge dade, ‘Gwanglu, anui Babylonme nah Syriame reugwame dade paklu kerane Jerusalem ga miedi go.’ Cine anui Jerusalem ga lungh bamdi.”<verse eid="JER 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 35:12" />Pecai RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah dage rang gwang, <verse eid="JER 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 35:13" />“Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangzeu, ‘Miecu nah Judahme de nah Jerusalem ga lungh kebamme dage rangbeulu, “Ledeu kebeude nnui luu lakni mede a samdung mzai lakni?—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai. <verse eid="JER 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14" />Rekab napei Jonadab pe aja pe namedung de peu kebeu, zau saklak kecu, henai kecangde aide tei mzaibam. Penui penui paume ajadung mzailu. Dede Ih au nnui dage rang eh gwang, dede nnui au a sam mzai ma. <verse eid="JER 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15" />Ih nnui dage a kilamedung, caihakecimedung de langgai. Ih penuide aide peu rang bi beu kerane langgai, ‘Hangge gede peu penui kesia lampui pütdi lu nah makeyi tadung teilu; peu migede de hera kedadung cai sui so nah penuide reca so. Meliene, Ih nnuide nah nnui paume de peu kecu deu ga cailigwang lu.’ Dede nnui a kwa kingneilu ma nah a dage nnui lung kai luma. <verse eid="JER 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16" />Rekab napei Jonadab leuhme penui paume ajadung pane peu kebeudung de mzailu, dede mina aidungde a kwa kingnei raudi.”’ <verse eid="JER 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17" />Cine RAMPAUBE, tinggim reugwame reu Tinggwang nah Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla, ‘Pielo, Ih Judah reuga nah Jerusalem ga lungh kebamme reu ga, Ih rang kebeu kekap pelane teugwanggai zieda, kedanemene Ih penuide ranggai da, dede penui kingnei ma; Ih penuide qugai, dede penui keli ma.’”<verse eid="JER 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18" />Jeremiah Rekabme pautsa dage ranggai, “Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide ranggai: Nnui nnui pau Jonadab ajadung kingneilu nah ci pelane tei mzai luda—pa nnuide aja kai kebeu pelane nnui tei mzai luda— <verse eid="JER 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19" />cine tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide ranggai, ‘Rekab napei Jonadab leuhme mipeina ge a gwatei kerane mige lamui zie.’”<verse eid="JER 35:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36" />
  <para style="s">Jehoiakim Jeremiah Laisiu Rukedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1" />Judah hegwangpei Josiah napei Jehoiakim Judah ga hegwang tei kelu mmi mdai bekum RAMPAUBE sam aide Jeremiah da gwang, nah pa ranggai <verse eid="JER 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2" />“Kehezui laisiu ge pwalu nah cika Ih Israel nah Judah, nah heleuh leune ha n dage ranglia kegaidung de raulu. Josiah hegwang tei kelu gade cu kecang Ih nnui dage marang lia kegaidung leune ziemne aide teilu. <verse eid="JER 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3" />Judah ga minadung Ih penui dage kekap teugwanggai lai eh mning kebam leune de siulu zie ha. Mileune penui kemau lampui gade nreu luzie ha, iciu eh Ih penui kenliendung nah kemaudung gibeu lubui lu.”<verse eid="JER 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4" />Pecai Jeremiah Neriah napei Baruch de qugai, nah Baruch kehezui laisiu ge gage raulu, Jeremiah ne pei lia kegai gade, RAMPAUBE pe dage rang kegai samdung leune. <verse eid="JER 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5" />Pecai Jeremiah Baruch dage aja ge peu. Pa ranggai, “Ih hebaangki ga bam nah Ih RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga mie gailak. <verse eid="JER 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6" />Cine nang mie lü Ih ne pei gai eh nang kehezui laisiu gage rau kelude pei lu. Mmwang kecu benai, RAMPAUBE sam de kerecaki gade minadung dage pei lia gailu, nah Judahme penui namdidung gade kegwangme dage de peilia gailu. Samdung aide penui dage ndulia gailu. <verse eid="JER 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7" />Penui ngaugia kekie de RAMPAUBE da gwanglu de cilaklu. Migege kecu pe kemau lampui gade nreulu de cilaklu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE lunghop nah rata mina aidungde gade lia kegaide au hingsüt kecune.” <verse eid="JER 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8" />Cine Neriah napei Baruch caihakecibe Jeremiah ne pecu teilo kebeudung de teiciaklu. Pa RAMPAUBE kerecaki gade RAMPAUBE samdung de pei sahbak gai.<verse eid="JER 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9" />Judah gwangpei Josiah napei Jehoiakim hegwang tei kelu mmi mengei bekum de kei hekui bekei, Jerusalem ga mina leune nah Judah namdidung gade kegwangme leune RAMPAUBE dwade mmwang kera ndugai. <verse eid="JER 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10" />Baruch Jeremiah samdung RAMPAUBE kerecaki gade pei sahbak gai, makeraube Shaphan napei Gemariah kibung gade, kigu nreu be set gade, RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga kenlüt herie tai gade. Mina leune kingnei kebam gade pa aide teigai.<verse eid="JER 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11" />Shaphan capei nah Gemariah napei Micaiah kehezui laisiu ga kebam RAMPAUBE samdung de siulu. <verse eid="JER 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12" />Pa hegwangpei kiga mie nghung, keraube kibung ga. Pielo, kedime leune cika ntum bam: Elishama makeraube, Shemaiah napei Delaiah, Akbor napei Elnathan, Shaphan napei Gemariah, nah Hananiah napei Zedekiah, nah kedime leune. <verse eid="JER 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13" />Pecai Baruch mina kingnei kebam gade pei sahbak kegai samdung de Micaiah penui dage paulia gai. <verse eid="JER 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14" />Cine kedimedung Cushi tsaswapei, Shelemiah capei, Nethaniah napei Jehudi de Baruch gage langgai. Jehudi Baruch dage ranggai, “Nang kehezui laisiu gade pei eh mina kingnei kebam de n ba gage pwalu, nah gwanglu.” Cine Neriah napei Baruch kehezui laisiu de pe ba gage pwalu nah kedime da mie. <verse eid="JER 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15" />Pecai kedimedung Baruch dage ranggai, “Bamlu nah peu anuide siu kerane pei gai.” Cine Baruch laisiu de pei gai. <verse eid="JER 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16" />Penui sam aidungde kingnei kelucai, hangge ge kecu hingsüt di eh penui taiga kebam hangge ge dage nreu piegai eh Baruch dage rangdi, “Anui sam aidungde hegwangpei dage pau beu bi maisia.” <verse eid="JER 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17" />Pecai penui Baruch dage keteugai, “Anui dage ranglia gailo, Jeremiah pei kegai gade sam aidungde nang dai nzwa rau lu dibi?” <verse eid="JER 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18" />Baruch penui dage ranggai, “Pane sam aidungde a dage pei liagai, nah Ih kehezui laisiu aide ga kerau dui le raugai.” <verse eid="JER 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19" />Pecai kedime Baruch dage ranggai, “Miecu, nkatei ncu hebai dilu, nah Jeremiah debai. Peu migede nnai daiga labi ciso.”<verse eid="JER 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20" />Cine kedime makeraube Elishama kibung gage kehezui laisiu kaigai di, nah hegwangpei bung ga mie nah hegwangpei de mapelane pau beudi. <verse eid="JER 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21" />Pecai hegwangpei Jehudi de kehezui laisiu pwa gwang kera langgai. Jehudi mie kehezui laisiu makeraube Elishama kibung gade pwalu. Pecai pa hegwanpei nah pe taiga sap kebam kedime de pei lia gai. <verse eid="JER 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22" />Kei hekui bekei hegwangpei tingka kiga bam, nah mibung ge mi tei lu eh pe dwaga bam. <verse eid="JER 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23" />Jehudi riacum mede mdai ge peigai herizi, hegwangpei cide kieceuna ge le rai hakdi nah kehezui laisiu ru nggah cangdi kemakta cide mibung gage kelien gaidi. <verse eid="JER 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24" />Dede hegwangpei nah pe kilamedung sam aidungde siu kelume migede ngngi ma, mede penui penui paiheni tei hak ma. <verse eid="JER 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25" />Elnathan, Delaiah, nah Gemariah hegwangpei de kehezui laisiu ru helo de eh penui nggia kie, dede pa penui sam kingnei ma. <verse eid="JER 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26" />Pecai hegwangpei Jerahmeel dage aja kai gai, pe kibaume, Azriel napei Seraiah, nah Abdeel napei Shelemiah de makeraube Baruch nah caihakecibe Jeremiah de tuidi kera, dede RAMPAUBE penai de hebai di.<verse eid="JER 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27" />Pecai Jeremiah ne peigai eh Baruch rau kelu sam de nah kehezui laisiu de hegwangpei pwa ru kedi cai RAMPAUBE Jeremiah dage ranggai, <verse eid="JER 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28" />“Caili miecu, kehezui laisiu kedage pwalu, nah kehezui laisiu keraibe Judah hegwangpei Jehoiakim ne ru kedi dega raupwa kebam samdung pelane cikage rau gailu. <verse eid="JER 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29" />Pecai nang aide Judah hegwangpei Jehoiakim dage rangbeu maisia: ‘Nang kehezui laisiu de ru eh ranggai, “Nang daitei eh cika aide raugai no, ‘Babylon hegwangpei gwang eh hangdeu aide teimsia bi dizie, pa cika kebam mina nah makaune de ngkap dizie kecune’?”’” <verse eid="JER 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30" />Cine n ziemne aide ranggai, Judah hegwangpei Jehoiakim: “N leuhme migede David hegwangbam ga bam lak. Ncu au, n paau tingcie le pu nah tingmui hezin keilwa kecu gage kelien mpet dizie. <verse eid="JER 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31" />Cine Ih ncu saja peu zie, n leuhme de, nah n kilamedung de nnui kemau tei kegai de ziemne. Ih n dage, Jerusalem ga lungh kebamme dage, nah Judah ga mina leune dage Ih kekapdung de le teu keheu kegaidung teugwang zie, nnui nnui lung kai kemakdung de.” <verse eid="JER 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32" />Cine Jeremiah kehezui laisiu kedage pwalu nah Neriah napei makeraube Baruch de peu. Judah hegwangpei Jehoiakim ne ru kedi kehezui laisiu ga kebam samdung leune Jeremiah ne peigai eh Baruch cikage raulu. Cipaureu gage, kehezui laisiu aide ga sam kenzwabedung de raugai silu.<verse eid="JER 36:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37" />
  <para style="s">Jeremiah Hebaangki ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1" />Cu Jehoiakim napei Jehoiachin keleu gade Josiah napei Zedekiah ne hegwang teilu. Babylon hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar Judah deu reuga Zedekiah de hegwang teibeu. <verse eid="JER 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2" />Dede Zedekiah, pekang kedime, nah minadung Jeremiah dade RAMPAUBE samdung rang kegaidung de mzai luma.<verse eid="JER 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3" />Cine hegwangpei Zedekiah, Shelemiah napei Jehukal, nah cingkube Maaseiah napei Zephaniah caihakecibe Jeremiah dage sam ge langgai. Penui ranggai, “Anui mding tei delwe RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang dage kekie teilo.” <verse eid="JER 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4" />Jeremiah mina kakga kekam gah eh nlüt mpet bam, kedanemene pecu hebaang gage kaidi mereu kecune. <verse eid="JER 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5" />Pharaoh reugwame Egypt gade mpet, nah Babylonia reugwame Jerusalem de gwaketang kebam dau penui ha siulu ge penui Jerusalem gade tetdi.<verse eid="JER 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6" />Pecai RAMPAUBE sam caihakecibe Jeremiah dage gwang eh ranggai, <verse eid="JER 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7" />“RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla: Aide nang Judah hegwangpei dage ranggai beulu, kedanemene pa ncu a dade ma keteu kerane langgai delu, ‘Pielo, Pharaoh reugwame, ncu ngha kera kegwangme, Egypt ga caili mie daidi lau da, pekatei pe deu ga. <verse eid="JER 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8" />Babylonme cailigwang zie. Penui namdi aide de renia zie, aide de tuilu zie, nah ru dizie.’ <verse eid="JER 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Aide rang eh nnuikatei nnuide cwa so, ‘Babylonme anuide gidi eh tetdi lauda,’ kedanemene penui au tet laklu. <verse eid="JER 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10" />Nnuide renia kela Babylonme pelane de nnui ngam lu eh penui paikidung ga rezam teu kelame katei di liede, penui cuh zie nah namdi aide de ru dizie.”<verse eid="JER 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11" />Cine Pharaoh reugwame gwang kelane Chaldeame reugwame tetdi kecu dau, <verse eid="JER 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12" />Benjamin deu ga mie kerane Jeremiah Jerusalem gade mpetdi. Pa pe minadung kakga hangdeu ge gumlu neu eh la. <verse eid="JER 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13" />Pa Benjamin Rieki ga kebam dau, kekwame kedibe cika bam. Pe zi Irijah, Shelemiah napei Hananiah capei. Pa caihakecibe Jeremiah de tuilu eh ranggai, “Nang au Chaldeame da pakgai la dida.” <verse eid="JER 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14" />Dede Jeremiah ranggai, “Cide au kesang ma. Ih Chaldeame dage pakgai ma.” Dede Irijah pe sam kingnei ma. Pa Jeremiah de ngngwa lu nah kedime dage ngngwa gwang. <verse eid="JER 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15" />Kedime Jeremiah de penui rata di. Penui pecu dap nah hebaangki gage kaidi, cide makeraube Jonathan ki, kedanemene penui cide hebaangki ge tei kedine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:36">Heb. 11:36</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16" />Cine Jeremiah de hangdeukang hebaangki gage baang di, cika pa ketie ge bam di. <verse eid="JER 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17" />Pecai Hegwangpei Zedekiah migede langpwa pecu hegwangki gage ngngwa gwanglu. Pe hegwangki gade, hegwangpei ngkim eh keteu, “RAMPAUBE dade sam ge de lami?” Jeremiah keligai, “Sam ge la: Babylon hegwangpei ba gage ncu kai dizie.” <verse eid="JER 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18" />Pecai Jeremiah Hegwangpei Zedekiah dage ranggai, “Acu pwa hebaangki gage kai kedi Ih n dage, n kedime dage, mede mina aidungde dage daipai kemau Ih teipwa bamno? <verse eid="JER 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19" />Ngu caihakecimedung daiga bamno, ncu caiha ranglia kecume nah Babylon hegwangpei ncu mede hangdeu aide de renia cuh lak lie de eh rang kecume? <verse eid="JER 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20" />Dede cu kingneilo, hegwangpei a mpaubo! A nggia kie kegaide peu ndwa de luulu lo. Acu makeraube Jonathan ki gage ngngwa caili gai helo, meliecai Ih cika de tsai dizie.” <verse eid="JER 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21" />Cine Hegwangpei Zedekiah aja ge kaigai. Pe kilame Jeremiah de tuipwa kekwamebung gage tuigai di. Tingnai ramsangne tangku ru kecume ki gade tangku ge pecu peu mui, namdi be ga tangku cang di kemaktane. Cine Jeremiah kekwame bung ga bamdi.<verse eid="JER 37:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38" />
  <para style="s">Jeremiah de Hekwaki gage Kelien gaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1" />Tingnai ge, Mattan napei Shephatiah, Pashhur napei Gedaliah, Shelemiah napei Jehukal, nah Malkijah napei Pashhur penui Jeremiah minadung dage rang kegai samdung de siulu. Pa ainzwa eh rangbam, <verse eid="JER 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2" />“RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Keheibe de Jerusalem namdi aide ga lungh kebamme kingtie, herakum, nah mateei gade tsai zie. Dede caugamme Babylonme da mpet bi cidungde ringlu zie. Pa tsai di kera gade pak luzie, nah ringlu zie. <verse eid="JER 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Namdi aide Babylon gwangpei reugwamedung ba gage kai dizie, nah pane cide tui luzie.” <verse eid="JER 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4" />Cine kedimedung hegwangpei Zedekiah dage ranggai, “Peu aipau pei de de tsai dilu, kedanemene ainzwa eh pa namdi aika kebam hereu keteime badung tei mnei bam kecune, nah mina leune ba. Pa sam aidungde rangbam, kedanemene mipei aide mina aidungde de peu kwaklu kerane heta tei ma, dede kekap.” <verse eid="JER 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5" />Cine hegwangpei Zedekiah ranggai, “Pielo, pa au n kengking kangga bam kedanemene hegwang keda migede ncu renia kera gah kecune.” <verse eid="JER 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6" />Pecai penui Jeremiah de tuilu nah pecu Malkijah gu tekwa gage heling gaidi, hegwangpei napei. Duibung cide kekwabe kigu ga bam. Jeremiah de heria gade peu nghung. Tekwa cide ga dui gah, dede cide niaksai ge, nah pa tangdei kangga nlwetdi.<verse eid="JER 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7" />Ebed-Melek Cushiteme ge hegwangpei ki ga eunuchme ge. Penui Jeremiah de tekwa gage kai kedi pa siulu. Hegwangpei Benjamin Kirie ga ntumbam. <verse eid="JER 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8" />Cine Ebed-Melek hegwangpei ki gade tetpet nah hegwangpei de resiu. Pa ranggai, <verse eid="JER 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9" />“A mpaubo hegwangpei, Jeremiah caihakecibe dage penui tei kegai gade penui kemau tei dida. Penui pecu tekwa gage heling gai di peu pecu mzeu eh tsai di kerane, kedanemene namdi be ga taktyeipok gah kedine.” <verse eid="JER 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10" />Pecai hegwangpei Cushiteme Ebed-Melek de aja ge peu. Pa ranggai, “Aikade mipei hang camrei ge reu aja teulu nah Jeremiah tsaidi kemakne pecu duibung gade keu mpetdi lu.” <verse eid="JER 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11" />Cine Ebed-Melek cipaume reu kengking teulu nah hegwangpei ki ga mie di, heki kangga paiheni ziemne kibung ge ga. Cikade pa rosopaidung nah paiheni sia kedibedung keulu nah cidungde heria ge le tekwa lungga Jeremiah dage kaigai beu. <verse eid="JER 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12" />Cushiteme pei Ebed-Melek Jeremiah dage ranggai, “Rosopaidung nah sia kedi paihenidung de n hejak kangga kaigai lu nah heria reu gage kailu.” Cine Jeremiah cinzwa lu. <verse eid="JER 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13" />Pecai penui Jeremiah de heria le teu ncuh. Aiciu eh penui pecu tekwa gade teu nghanglu. Cine Jeremiah kekwabe kigu ga bam di.<verse eid="JER 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zedekiah Jeremiah de Keteu Daikecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14" />Pecai Hegwangpei Zedekiah sam langgai nah caihakecibe Jeremiah de pe da ngngwa gwang, RAMPAUBE kerecaki kimui pekecumbe ga. Hegwangpei, Jeremiah dage ranggai, “Ih n dage mage keteu gai neu lei. A sam keli tadi helo.” <verse eid="JER 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15" />Jeremiah Zedekiah dage ranggai, “Magade Ih n sam keligai cai, nang acu teitset bi di lakni? Dede magade Ih ncu maranglia cai, nang a sam kingnei lak.” <verse eid="JER 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16" />Dede hegwangpei Zedekiah, Jeremiah dage ngkim eh pe sam petgai nah ranggai, “RAMPAUBE lungh kebamtane, anuide teigai kebeube, Ih ncu teitset dilak mede ncu teitset dizie lie eh peei kelame ba gage kai dilak.”<verse eid="JER 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17" />Cine Jeremiah Zedekiah dage ranggai, “RAMPAUBE, tinggim reugwame reu Tinggwang, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla: Magade nang Babylon gwangpei gu kedime da mie cai iciu cai nang ringlu zie, nah namdi aide de ru dilak. Nang nah n kelak ringlu zie. <verse eid="JER 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18" />Dede magade nang Babylon gwangpei kedime da mie mecai, namdi aide Babylonme ba gage kai dizie. Penui cide ru dizie, nah nang penui ba gade pak gailak.” <verse eid="JER 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19" />Hegwangpei Zedekiah Jeremiah dage ranggai, “Dede Ih Judahme Chaldeame da pakgai kedime de hing lie, kedanemene acu penui ba gage kaidi lubui lu, penuide peu acu teikeherei süt kerane.” <verse eid="JER 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20" />Jeremiah ranggai, “Penui ncu penui ba gage kai dilak. Ih ncu RAMPAUBE sam rang kebeu de mzailu, iciu eh mapelane de n ziemne yilu kerane, nah iciu eh nang ringlu kerane. <verse eid="JER 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21" />Dede magade nang mpet kera mlai dicai, aide RAMPAUBE acu keulia gaida. <verse eid="JER 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22" />Pielo! Mipui pelane Judah gwangpei, n kiga püt kedi, Babylon gwangpei kangga kedime da ngngwa mpetdi zie. Aipau puidung de n dage rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 38:22">‘N zangmedung ne ncu cwa dida; penui ncu tei ngkap dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 38:22">N pi nyiasai ga sum pwa dida, nah n zangmedung pak dizie.’<verse eid="JER 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23" />N naudung de nah henamedung de Babylonme ba gage kaibeu dizie, nah nang penui ba gade pak gailak dizie. Babylon gwangpei ne ncu tui luzie, nah namdi aide ru dizie.”<verse eid="JER 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24" />Pecai Zedekiah Jeremiah dage ranggai, “Sam aidungde mi dage ranglia so, nang tsai melu kerane. <verse eid="JER 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25" />Magade kedimedung Ih ncu resiu delie kecu siu lucai, nah magade penui gwang eh n dage, ‘Hegwangpei dage nang daipai rang no nah anui dage cide hebai so, mecai anui ncu teitsetti zie,’ de eh keteu cai, <verse eid="JER 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26" />nang penui dage ainzwa ranglu, ‘Acu peu tsaidi kera Jonathan leuhme dage kaidi helo de eh Ih hegwangpei dage a nggia kie gai.’” <verse eid="JER 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27" />Pecai kedimedung Jeremiah da gwang nah pecu keteu gai, cine hegwangpei pe dage ranglia kegai de nzwa eh penui sam keligai. Cine penui pecu resiu tadi, kedanemene penui Jeremiah nah hegwangpei kempau kecude siu kemakne. <verse eid="JER 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28" />Cine Jerusalem de tui di kemaktane Jeremiah kekwabe kigu ga bamdi.<verse eid="JER 38:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Kaukedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1" />Zedekiah Judah ga hegwang tei kelu mmi hekui bekum nah kei kerei bekei, Nebuchadnezzar Babylon gwangpei pe reugwame pelane de ngngwa gwang eh Jerusalem de renia nah tuilu. <verse eid="JER 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2" />Zedekiah hegwang tei kelu mmi kereiehket bekum kei mdai bekei lang hekuine benai, namdi be teipang pop nlüt. <verse eid="JER 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3" />Pecai Babylon gwangpei kedimedung gwang nah rieki sum be ga bamlu: Nebo-Sarsekim, Samgar Nebo, nah Sarsechim, kedi kenlangme. Nebo-Sarsekim be kedime reu kedibe nah kedadung becai Babylon gwangpei kangga kedime.<verse eid="JER 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4" />Zedekiah, Judah gwangpei, nah hereu tei kebam pe minadung penuide ngau luge, penui pakti. Penui hegwangpei hegurie lampui gade ting kemuine ge namdi be gade tetdi, tangdeu kena kakga kirie be gade. Hegwangpei Arabah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Arabah: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jordan Langkam</char></note> liebe ge tetgai di. <verse eid="JER 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5" />Dede Babylon reugwame penuide zui mie nah Zedekiah de Jericho tai Jordan reuki langkam gade tuilu. Pecai penui pecu tuilu nah Nebuchadnezzar da ngngwa nghang, Babylon gwangpei, Hamath deu Riblah nam ga, cikade Nebuchadnezzar pe tu tiakgai. <verse eid="JER 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6" />Babylon gwangpei Zedekiah napeimedung de Riblah gade pe miak dwa gade teitsetdi. Pa Judah kedimedung pelane de teitsetdi. <verse eid="JER 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7" />Pecai pa Zedekiah miak let mpetdi nah pecu Babylon ga ngngwa mie kerane hetageu riadung le kangdi. <verse eid="JER 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8" />Pecai Chaldeame, hegwangpei ki nah mina kidung rudi. Penui Jerusalem kirie de de teu kaudi. <verse eid="JER 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9" />Nebuzaradan, hegwangpei de kekwame reu kedibe, namdi be ga bangh kenzeumedung de hebaang teilu. Chaldeanme dage pakgai kedime de si eh nah namdi be ga bangh kenzeu pelane. <verse eid="JER 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10" />Dede Nebuzaradan hegwangpei de kekwame reu kedibe magahtume, penui da magede gah eh kebamme de peu Judah deu ga bamdi. Cipau benai gage pa penuide kubeluhdung nah luhdung peu di.<verse eid="JER 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11" />Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar Nebuzaradan hegwangpei kekwame reu muibe dage Jeremiah ziemne aja ge peu. Pa aide rangbeu, <verse eid="JER 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12" />“Pecu ngngwa lu nah pe ma pielu. Pecu teikeherei so. Pa ncu rangkebeu mapelane teibeu lu.” <verse eid="JER 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 39:13" />Cine Nebuzaradan hegwangpei de kekwame reu kedibe, Nebushazban kedibe, Nergal-Sharezer kedime reu kedibe, nah Babylon gwangpei gu kenlang kedimedung mina de langmpet. <verse eid="JER 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 39:14" />Penui minadung Jeremiah de kekwabe kigu gade ngngwa lu eh Ahikam napei nah Shaphan capei Gedaliah dage kaibeu di, pecu kilung ga ngngwa gwang kerane, cine Jeremiah minadung kakga bam di.<verse eid="JER 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15" />Cu Jeremiah kekwabe kigu ga hebaang tei eh kebamdau peda RAMPAUBE sam gwang eh ranggai, <verse eid="JER 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16" />“Ethiopiame pei Ebed-Melek dage ranglu, ‘Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla: Pielo, Ih rang kegai a sam de namdi be aide dage tei zie delei, keyi be mene kengkap teugwang zie. Cipau benai n dwa gade ma ai pelane tei zie. <verse eid="JER 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17" />Dede cipau benai Ih ncu kelibeu zie,— aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—nah nang hing kela Judahme kedime ba gage ncu kaibeu dilak. <verse eid="JER 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18" />Kedanemene Ih ncu kelibeu bi zie kecune. Kingtie gade nang kau dilak. Nang ring eh pak luzie, kedanemene nang acu nlum kecune—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.’”<verse eid="JER 39:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40" />
  <para style="s">Jeremiah de Lungmpetkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1" />Nebuzaradan hegwangpei de kekwame reu kedibe Jeremiah de Ramah nam gage lungmpet gai kedi cai Jeremiah da RAMPAUBE sam gwang. Pa Jeremiah de hegeuria le kang pwabam eh ngaulu, Jerusalem nah Judah gade Babylon ga hebaang tui teu mie kedime pelane de si eh. <verse eid="JER 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2" />Kekwabe kedibe Jeremiah de ngngwa lu eh pe da ranggai, “RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang Jerusalem nah Judah aide ga kengkap teugwang kera sampet gai dida. <verse eid="JER 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3" />Cine RAMPAUBE teugwang gai da. Pa pe sampet de gapte eh teigai da, kedanemene nnui pe dage kemau teigai nah pe sam mzai kemakne. Iciu kecu ziemne ma aidungde nnui dage teigai dida. <verse eid="JER 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4" />Dede cu pielo! N ba ga kangpwa kebam hegeuria gade Ih ncu henai lungmpet dida. Magade n dwa gade acu ngngwa Babylon ga gwang kecu petau liecai, gwanglu, nah Ih n mapie beuzie. Dede magade n dwa gade acu ngngwa Babylon ga gwang kecu petau mecai, iciucai cinzwa teiso. N dwaga kebam hangdeu leune pie gailo. N miakngau gade yi nah petau lie kecu ga miecu.” <verse eid="JER 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5" />Jeremiah sam keli ta kedidau, Nebuzaradan rang si gai, “Ahikam napei nah Shaphan capei Gedaliah da miecu, Babylon gwangpei ne Judah namdidung reu peu kedibe tei kegai beda. Pecu ngngwa eh mina kakga bamlu mede n miakngau gade yi kecu kehei ga mielu.” Hegwangpei de kekwame reu aja keteu be pecu taktyeipok nah mapeu ge peugai, nah pecai pecu peu tetdi. <verse eid="JER 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6" />Cine Jeremiah Ahikam napei Gedaliah da mie, Mizpah ga. Pa pecu ngngwa eh mina bangh kenzeume kakga bamdi.<verse eid="JER 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gedaliah de Teitsetkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7" />Cidau Judahme kedime nah reugwamedung ge mikang nlüt kemakme, Babylon gwangpei Ahikam napei Gedaliah de deuceudibe hangdeu reuga teilu kecu penui siulu. Cika mipeidung, mipuidung, nah henamedung hangdeu cika ma gahtumedung, Babylon ga ngngwa tui teugwang di kemakme leune reu peu kedibe teilu kecu de siu. <verse eid="JER 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8" />Cine penui Mizpah ga Gedaliah da miedi. Mina aidungde au Nethaniah napei Ishmael; Johanan nah Jonathan, Kareah napeidung; Tanhumeth napei Seraiah; Netophathitme pei Ephai napeimedung; nah Maakathme napei Jaazaniah, penui nah penui minadung <verse eid="JER 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9" />Ahikam napei nah Shaphan capei Gedaliah penui nah penui minadung dage sampet eh cu, “Babylonme kedime kangga ma tei kera ngngi di helo. Hangdeu cika lunghlu nah Babylon gwangpei gwa teilu, nah mapelane nnui ziemne petau lubui. <verse eid="JER 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10" />Pielo, Ih Mizpah ga lungh bam, Babylonme anuide redau kerane kegwang dau. Cine zau, hepwak tsi, nah maca hekwalu nah nnui gu mabungdung gage kailu. Nnui gwang eh gum kelu namdidung ga lunghlu.” <verse eid="JER 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11" />Pecai Moab ga Jewme pelane, Ammon minadung kakga, nah Edom ga, nah hangdeu pelane ga Babylon gwangpei Judah ga bangh kenzeume de peu bam kelu tei kebeu, nah Ahikam napei nah Shaphan capei Gedaliah de peu kedibe tei kelu ha de siulu. <verse eid="JER 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12" />Cine Jewme leune penui zangra kela heni leune gade cailigwang dailu. Penui Judah deu ga cailigwang dailu, Mizpah ga Gedaliah da. Penui zau nah hepwak tsi kekieege pwa hekwalu.<verse eid="JER 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13" />Kareah napei Johanan nah renam ga reugwame muibe pelane Mizpah ga Gedaliah da gwanglu. <verse eid="JER 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14" />Penui pe dage ranggai, “Ammon gwangpei Baalis, Nethaniah napei Ishmael de ncu teitset kerane langgai kecu nang ci meni?” Dede Ahikim napei Gedaliah penuide nlum luma. <verse eid="JER 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15" />Cine Kareah napei Johanan Mizpah gade Gedaliah da ngkim resiu eh ranggai, “Acu Nethaniah napei Ishmael de peu teitset lo. Migede acu mning msia lak. Pa ncu dai ziemne teitset lai? Daitei peu Judahme n dage gwang hekwa kelume nah Judah gu bangh kenzeume de ngkapti lai?” <verse eid="JER 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16" />Dede Ahikam napei Gedaliah ne Kareah napei Johanan dage ranggai, “Aide tei so, kedanemene nang Ishmael ha kenret rangbam lu.”<verse eid="JER 40:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 41:1" />Cipau kei hena bekei Nethaniah napei, Elishama capei Ishmael, Judah hegwangme kelak gade, nah hegwangpei Zedekiah kedime kangge, pecu mipei hangkerei ngngwa la, Ahikam napei Gedaliah da gwang, Mizpah ga. Penui Mizpah ga ngngwa matyei ncüt. <verse eid="JER 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 41:2" />Dede Nethaniah napei Ishmael, nah pecu ngngwa kela mina hang kerei baude cuhlu nah Ahikam napei nah Shaphan capei Gedaliah de gwaketang, kingtie le. Ishmael Gedaliah de teitsetdi, Babylon gwangpei hangdeu reu kedibe tei kebeu be de. <verse eid="JER 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3" />Pecai Ishmael Judeame, Mizpah ga Gedaliah de ngngwa kelame leune de nah cika Babylonia reugwame de teitsetdi.<verse eid="JER 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 41:4" />Pecai Gedaliah de teitset kedi tingba pekenabe petdi, dede migede ci luma. <verse eid="JER 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 41:5" />Mipei kangge Shechem, Shiloh, nah Samaria namdung gade gwang, mipei riakheset ge penui tangkeimai tai kedime, penui paiheni tei hakti, nah penuikatei penuide tei rezam di, penui RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga mie kerane penui ba gage taktyei reca nah perim kehengui keubam. <verse eid="JER 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6" />Cine Nethaniah napei Ishmael penuide redau kerane Mizpah gade tet mpet, tet jüja nah hap jüja eh. Pa penuide redau luge, pa penui dage ranggai, “Ahikam napei Gedaliah da gwanglu!” <verse eid="JER 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7" />Penui namdi be ga gwang keludau, Nethaniah napei Ishmael penuide teitsetdi nah penuide makoiki gage kelien gai di, pecu nah pecu ngngwa kelamedung de. <verse eid="JER 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8" />Dede penui kakga mina hang kerei ge ring kebamme Ishmael dage, “Anuide teitset so, kedanemene luh ge ga anui gunia kebamdung de ncu peuzie: Wheat nah barley, maca nah heliadui.” Cine pa penuide nah penuide nzang kelame de teitsetdi ma. <verse eid="JER 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9" />Ishmael pa teitset kedime paaudung pelane Gedaliah de si eh tekwa gage kelien kegaide, Hegwangpei Asa pa Israel gwangpei Baasha dade kwak bamlu kerane kui kelu tekwa kedi ge. Nethaniah napei Ishmael cide ketsai paaudung le teipui di. <verse eid="JER 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10" />Pecai Ishmael Mizpah ga kebam mina kedadung leune de tuilu, hegwangpei napuidung nah Nebuzaradan kekwame reu kedibe Ahikam napei Gedaliah dage pwa peu kedi Mizpah ga bangh kenzeumedung leune de. Cine Nethaniah napei Ishmael penuide tuilu nah keda Jordan Reuki, Ammon deu lebie tetgai di.<verse eid="JER 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11" />Dede Kareah napei Johanan nah pecu nzang kela reugwame muibe leune Nethaniah napei Ishmael tei kedi kemau ha de siulu. <verse eid="JER 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12" />Cine penui penui mina leune de ngngwa lu nah Nethaniah napei Ishmael de gwaketang kera mie. Penui pecu rejaai kedi Gibeon gade ngaulu. <verse eid="JER 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 41:13" />Pecai Ishmael de nzang kelame leune, Kareah napei Johanan de nah pecu nzang kela reugwame muibe leune de ngaulu ge, penui sui yisütdi. <verse eid="JER 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 41:14" />Cine Mizpah gade Ishmael ne tui kelume nreu gwang eh Kareah napei Johanan da miedi.<verse eid="JER 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15" />Dede Nethaniah napei Ishmael mi hang heset de ngngwa lu eh Johanan dade pak tetti. Pa Ammon deudi ga miedi.<verse eid="JER 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Egypt ga Pakmiekedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16" />Kareah napei Johanan nah pecu nzang kela reugwame muibe leune Mizpah gade Nethaniah napei Ishmael dade kelilu kecume de ngngwa teu di. Aide Ahikam napei Gedaliah de Ishmael ne teitset kedicai. Johanan nah pe kangngwame mipei kengkiengme, reugwamedung, mipuidung nah henamedung, nah Gibeon gade ngngwa mpet kelu eunuchmedung de ngngwalu. <verse eid="JER 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 41:17" />Pecai penui Bethlehem taiga Geruth Kimham ga mie nah tingkak nage ziemne cika bamdi. Penui Egypt ga mie lai eh bam <verse eid="JER 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 41:18" />Babylonme ziemne. Penui Babylonme de hing bam kedanemene Ahikam napei Gedaliah de Nethaniah napei Ishmael ne teitset kedine, Babylon gwangpei, hangdeu reu kedibe tei kebeube de.<verse eid="JER 41:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 42:1" />Pecai reugwame muibe leune nah Kareah napei Johanan, Hoshaiah napei Jezaniah, nah mina keceu gade kedime leune caihakecibe Jeremiah da gwang. <verse eid="JER 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 42:2" />Penui pe dage ranggai, “Anui kekie peu n da gwanglo. RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang dade anui bangh kenzeume ziemne kielo kedanemene anui au mina kecamnage lu, nang ngau kebam nzwa. <verse eid="JER 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3" />RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang dage anui tet kera lampui nah anui daitei ziebi lia kerane keteu gai beulo.” <verse eid="JER 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4" />Cine caihakecibe Jeremiah penui dage ranggai, “Ih nnui kwa siulu da. Pielo, nnui kie kegai nzwa Ih RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dage kie zie. RAMPAUBE sam keli kegaibe, Ih nnuide ranglia zie. Ih nnui dade magede hebai dilak.” <verse eid="JER 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5" />Penui Jeremiah dage ranggai, “RAMPAUBE de peu anui dage zierang kesangbe nah kesamsangbe lulo, magade anui RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang anuide teilo kebeube leune tei meliecai. <verse eid="JER 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6" />Cide yi liede mede sia liede, anui RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang sam mzai zie, anui ncu langgai kebeube de, iciu eh anui RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang sam mzai keludau anui ziemne yilu kerane.”<verse eid="JER 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7" />Pecai ziangrei cai, RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah da gwang. <verse eid="JER 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8" />Cine Jeremiah, Kareah napei Johanan nah pecu nzang kela reugwame muibe leune nah mina keceu gade kedime leune de qugai. <verse eid="JER 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9" />Pecai pa penui dage ranggai, “Aide RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, nnui kie eh pe dage acu lang kegaibe, rangla, <verse eid="JER 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10" />‘Magade nnui cailidi nah Judah deudi aide ga lungh cai, iciu lucai Ih nnuide teucuh beuzie nah ngkap dilak; Ih nnuide linggai zie nah nnuide teu mpetdi lak, kedanemene Ih nnui reu gage kengkap kai kegaide teu caili dizie. <verse eid="JER 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11" />Babylon gwangpei de hingso, nang hing kebam be de. Pecu hingso—aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai—kedanemene Ih ncu ngngwa la ncu gum beu kerane nah ncu pe ba gade kelibeu kerane. <verse eid="JER 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12" />Ih nnuide nggia beuzie. Ih nnuide ngaunggia zie, nah Ih nnuide nnui deu ga ngngwa cailigwang beuzie. <verse eid="JER 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13" />Dede magade nnui, “Anui hangdeu aika lungh lak” de eh rang dicai—magade nang a sam kingnei mecai, RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang sam. <verse eid="JER 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14" />Magade nnui, “Lak! Anui Egypt deu ga mie zie, hereu gede ngau kelak deu ga, telui kwa siu kelak ga, nah anui taktyei ziemne mzeu dai di kelak ga. Anui cika lungh zie,” de eh rang cai. <verse eid="JER 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15" />RAMPAUBE sam kingneilu, bangh kenzeu Judahme. Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla, ‘Magade nnui Egypt ga mie kesang zie liecai, cika mie eh lungh kerane, <verse eid="JER 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16" />iciucai nnui hing kela kingtie de nnuide Egypt deu gade gwakah luzie. Nnui hing kela herakum de nnuide Egypt ga zui mie zie, nah cikade nnui tsai dizie. <verse eid="JER 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17" />Cine Egypt ga lungh kera mie kecume leune kingtie, herakum, mede mateei gade tsai zie. Penui migede ringlu lak, Ih penui dage kengkap teugwang kegai gade migede pakti gailak.<verse eid="JER 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18" />Kedanemene tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla: Jerusalem ga lungh kebamme dage a rata nah lunghop rui kegai nzwa, ci kesiakke nnui Egypt deu ga miecai nnui reuga a lunghop ruigai zie. Nnuide reset kegai ge nah nnui ngau kehing ge dizie, nnui reset samdung pung kecume ge dizie, nah ngau kemneeu ge dizie, nah nnui heni aide ngau si dailak.’” <verse eid="JER 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19" />Pecai Jeremiah rang sigai, “RAMPAUBE nnui ziemne ranggai da—bangh kenzeu Judahme. Egypt ga mie so! Nnuide aide Ih rang kegai nnui ci ncigi bam. <verse eid="JER 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20" />Kedanemene nnui nnui katei de cwa msiasüt dida, nnui acu RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang da langgai eh aide ranglo kegai dau, ‘Anui ziemne RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang dade kielo. RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang rang kebeu leune, anui dage ranglo, nah anui cide tei zie.’ <verse eid="JER 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21" />Kedanemene Ih henai nnuide ranglia gai dida, dede nnui RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang kwa kingnei ma mede pa a dage nnui ziemne langgai kegai magede mzai ma. <verse eid="JER 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22" />Cine cu, nnui mie lungh keneu cipau Egyptme deu gade kingtie, herakum, nah mateei gade tsai kera ci ncigi lu.”<verse eid="JER 42:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1" />RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang Jeremiah de minadung leune dage samdung ranglia lo kebeu de pa ranglia cangdi. <verse eid="JER 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2" />Hoshaiah napei Azariah, Kareah napei Johanan, nah mina ngang kelame leune Jeremiah dage ranggai, “Nang au kenret rang bam. RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang peu ncu, ‘Egypt deu ga lungh kera mieso,’ de eh rang kerane langgai ma. <verse eid="JER 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3" />Kedanemene Neriah napei Baruch de peu anuide Babylonme ba gage kaidi kerane n lung tei gaibam, ncu peu anuide teitset di kerane nah anuide Babylon gage hebaang teidi kerane.” <verse eid="JER 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4" />Cine Kareah napei Johanan, reugwame reu kedime leune, nah mina leune Judah deu ga lungh kera RAMPAUBE kwa mlai di. <verse eid="JER 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5" />Kareah napei Johanan nah reugwame reu muibe leune heleuh leunedung ga zangra la eh Judah deu ga lungh kera caili kegwang bangh kenzeu Judahme de ngngwa tetdi. <verse eid="JER 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6" />Penui mipeidung nah mipuidung, henamedung nah hegwangpei napuidung, nah Nebuzaradan, hegwangpei de kekwame reu muibe Ahikam napei Gedaliah nah Shaphan capei de peu penui ma pie kebam leune de ngngwa tetdi. Penui caihakecibe Jeremiah nah Neriah napei Baruch de de ngngwa tetti. <verse eid="JER 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7" />Penui Egypt deu ga mie, Tahpanhes namdi ga, kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE kwa kingnei kemakne.<verse eid="JER 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8" />Cine Tahpanhes gade RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah dage gwang eh ranggai, <verse eid="JER 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9" />“Tangtsu kedibedung n ba gage keulu, nah, Judahme kengau gade, Tahpanhes ga Pharaoh ki kenlüt lampuiki gage hebai dilu.” <verse eid="JER 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10" />Pecai Judahme dage ranglu, “Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla, ‘Pielo, Ih Babylon gwangpei a kilabe Nebuchadnezzar de ngngwa gwang kera samgwame langgai zie da. Jeremiah, nang ne kung kegai tangtsu reu gage Ih pe hegwangbam dung luzie. Nebuchadnezzar pe hegwang paiki cipau reu gage liem luzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 13:10</char></note> <verse eid="JER 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11" />Kedanemene pa Egypt deu de gwang eh gwaketang zie. Keheibe de peu tsai zie lie kelame de ketsai peu zie. Keheibe de peu hebaang tei zie lie kelame de peu habaang tei dizie. Keheibe de kingtie peu zie lie kelame de kingtie peu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:10">Keu. 13:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12" />Pecai Ih Egyptme rabedung dage penui kerecaki gage mi twagai zie. Nebuchadnezzar penuide ru dizie mede tui luzie. Meurün kekwabe pe painidung gade helai tei nci kela nzwa pa Egypt deu tei nci dizie. Pa cipau heni gade ngking eh mpet zie. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa nah keheci laisiu kesa ga </char><char style="fqa">Ih mi twagai zie </char> de mene, <char style="fqa">pa mi twagai zie </char> de eh peila. </note> <verse eid="JER 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13" />Pa Egypt deu ga Heliopolis ga kebam tangtsu tsusumdung teipangpop dizie. Pa Egyptme rabedung kerecakidung ru dizie.’”<verse eid="JER 43:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44" />
  <para style="s">Mamie Kereca ziemne Kengkap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1" />Egypt deu ga lungh kebam Judeame, Migdol, Tahpanhes, Memphis, nah deudi tingbang lebie Egypt Nreule lungh kebamme ziemne Jeremiah da sam gwang: <verse eid="JER 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2" />“Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, ainzwa ranggai, ‘Ih Jerusalem ga nah Judah namdidung ga kengkap teugwang kegai nnui ngauda. Pielo, penui au ngkap dida. Cika lungh kera migede gah. <verse eid="JER 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3" />Kedanemene penui hera kedadung dage keru ratak tei beu eh kemau tadung tei eh a rata tei kegaine. Hera aidungde penui katei penui, mede nnui, mede nnui paume liede cikemak rabedung.’ <verse eid="JER 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4" />Cine Ih mtakdi mene a kilame caihakecimedung de penui dage langgai. Ih penuide aide rang kerane langgai, ‘Ih ngkau kela kesia tah aidungde teisi talo.’ <verse eid="JER 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5" />Dede a minadung kingnei ma. Penui a sam kingnei ma nah hera kedadung dage perim kehengui ru kecu kemau tah gade nreu dima. <verse eid="JER 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6" />Cine a lunghop nah a rata Judah namdidung nah Jerusalem puidikidung reu gage ruigai nah mi ru gai. Cine penui mta mrwa nah kengkap dida, cu tingga kebam nzwa.’ <verse eid="JER 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7" />Cine cu RAMPAUBE, tinggim reugwame reu Tinggwang nah Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla, ‘Nnui katei nnui dage daitei kemau kedi teigai bamno? Judahme kakgade daitei nnui katei nnuide teu ntsam di zeuno, mipeidung nah mipuidung, hename nah ngienadung? Nnui dade bangh kenzeu migede bamlak. <verse eid="JER 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8" />Nnui bata kemaudung de le nnui a rata teidi, Egypt deu ga hera kedadung dage perim kehengui ru kegai gade, nnui lungh kera mie kecu deu gade. Nnuide ngkapdi kerane nnui cika mie, iciu eh nnui reset ge teidi kerane nah kideu ga heleuhdung kakga hengam teidi kerane. <verse eid="JER 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9" />Nnui nnui paume nah Judah gwangpeidung nah penui naudung kemau ketei de nsungta di deni? Nnui nnuikatei nah nnui naudung Judah deu ga nah Jerusalem puidikidung ga kemau ketei de nsungta di deni? <verse eid="JER 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10" />Cu kecangde, penui hena luma. Ih penui dage nah penui paume dage kai kebeu a zaidung de herüt peu ma, nah penui cide ga tet ma.’<verse eid="JER 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11" />Cine tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla, ‘Pielo, Ih nnuida kengkap teugwanggai zie da nah Judahme pelane de ngkap dizie. <verse eid="JER 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12" />Kedanemene Judah ga bangh kenzeume Egypt ga mie lungh zielie tetpet kedime de Ih keuteu dizie. Ih aide peu penui pelane de Egypt deu gade ngkap di kerane teigai zie. Penui kingtie nah herakum gade kau dizie. Keceu gade kedime pelane kingtie nah herakum gade ngkap dizie. Penui tsai dizie nah penuide teu sampet zie, reset gai zie, hengam tei zie, nah ngau kehing ge tei dizie. <verse eid="JER 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13" />Kedanemene Ih Jerusalem de kingtie, herakum, nah mateei le saja peu kecu nzwa Egypt ga lungh kebamme de de cikesiak ge saja peu zie, <verse eid="JER 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14" />cine Egypt ga lungh kera mie kedi Judah ga mina bangh kenzeume migede pak gailak, mede ringlu lak mede Judah deu ga cailigwang gailak, penui cailigwang eh lungh keneu deu ga; nah cikade pak kelume rünne gwale penui migede cailigwang gailak.’”<verse eid="JER 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15" />Pecai Judeame leune penui naudung hera kedadung de perim kehengui rugai kecu ci kecume, nah mipuidung hemaa maadi ga kebamme, nah mina pelane ngkangle nah nreule Egypt ga lungh kebamme leune, Jeremiah sam keligai. <verse eid="JER 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16" />Penui ranggai, “RAMPAUBE zi gade nang anui dage sam rang kegaide, anui n sam kingnei lak. <verse eid="JER 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17" />Kedanemene anui rang kegaidung de anui tei bi zielu, tinggim gwangpui dage perim kehengui ru gai zie nah zau reca ruigai zie, anui, anui paume, anui hegwangmedung, nah anui muiteumedung Judah namdidung nah Jerusalem puidikidung gade tei kegaide. Iciu lucai anui taktyei kekiee ge ngau luzie nah lunghyi luzie, kengkap gede dau di mezing eh. <verse eid="JER 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18" />Anui aidungde tei ta kedidau, tinggim gwangpui dage perim kehengui ratak teigai mtakdi ge nah zau reca rui gai beu ta kedidau, anui pelane ma gah eh keherei di nah kingtie nah herakum gade tsaidi.” <verse eid="JER 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19" />Mipui be ranggai, “Anui tinggim gwangpui dage perim kehengui ru gaibeu kebamdau nah zau reca rui gaibeu kebamdau, anui ma aidungde tei kebam anui nahpeime sui lungning gade meni, pe mie ziemne tangkudung keteide nah zau reca pe dage rui kegaide?”<verse eid="JER 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20" />Pecai Jeremiah mina pelane dage ranggai, mipeidung de nah mipuidung de, nah pe sam keli kegai pelane dage, pa ranggai, <verse eid="JER 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21" />“Nnui Judah namdidung ga nah Jerusalem puidikidung ga perim kehengui ru kegaide RAMPAUBE nsung bam meni, nnui nah nnui paume, nnui hegwangmedung nah nnui muiteumedung, nah cika lungh kebammedung? Kedanemene RAMPAUBE aide nsung lala; aide pelung ga bam. <verse eid="JER 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22" />Pecai pa cidungde lialu tadi, nnui kemau tahdung ziemne, nnui kemneeu tahdung tei kedi de ziemne. Pecai nnui deu gi kedi deu ge di, ngau kehing ge, nah reset ge cine cu kecangde cika migede lungh ma. <verse eid="JER 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23" />Kedanemene nnui perim kehengui ru kegai ziemne nah RAMPAUBE dage kemau tei kegai ziemne, nah pe sam, pe hezai, pe ajadung, mede pe samkak kelu hezaidung de mzailu kemak ziemne, kengkap aide henai nnuida gwang dida.”<verse eid="JER 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24" />Pecai Jeremiah mina leune nah mipui leune dage ranggai, “RAMPAUBE sam kingneilu, Egypt deu ga kebam Judahme leune. <verse eid="JER 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25" />Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide rangla, ‘Nnui nah nnui naudung nnui muidung le rang dida nah nnui ba le nnui rang kegaidung de tei dida, “Anui tinggim gwangpui de reca kera anui sampetdung de teigai bizie, pe dage zau reca ruigai beu kera.” Cu nnui sampetdung de teigai cu; cidungde teigai cu.’ <verse eid="JER 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26" />Ciziemne, RAMPAUBE sam siulu, Egypt deu ga lungh kebam Judahme leune, ‘Pielo, Ih a kedi zi gade sampet gaila, de eh RAMPAUBE ranggai. Egypt deu leune ga Judahme keheibe mui gade peu a zi qu si lakta, nnui cu, “RAMPAUBE lungh kebamtane,” de eh rang kecume. <verse eid="JER 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27" />Pielo, Ih penuide peu ngkapti kerane gwale yilu kerane pie bam ma. Egypt deu ga Judahme leune de kingtie nah herakum le ngkap ciakdi kemaktane ngkap zie. <verse eid="JER 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28" />Pecai Egypt deu gade kingtie gade tsailu kemakne Judah deu ga cailigwang zie, penui mina kecamnage. Cine Judah ga mina bangh kenzeume Egypt deu ga lungh kera mie kecume cau be sam sapbam bi kecu ci luzie, agu mi penui gu bi. <verse eid="JER 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29" />Aide nnui ziemne marengei ge zie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, Ih heni aide gade nnuide renia kecude, iciu eh a samdung nnui da kengkap teugwang beu bi kerade nnui cilu kerane.’ <verse eid="JER 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘Pielo, Ih Egypt gwangpei Pharaoh Hophra de pe ngauraume nah pecu teitset dizie lie eh peei kelame ba gage kai dizie da. Aide Ih Judah gwangpei Zedekiah de Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar, pe ngauraube pecu teitset dizie lie peei kelabe ba gage kai kedi de nzwa zie.’”<verse eid="JER 44:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45" />
  <para style="s">Baruch dage Sam ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1" />Caihakecibe Jeremiah ne Neriah napei Baruch dage sam aide ranggai. Aide Jeremiah ne rau lu lo Baruch dage ranggai eh kehezui laisiu gage pa rau kelu tei lu, aide Judah gwangpei Josiah napei Jehoiakim hegwang tei kelu mmi mdai bekum, nah pa ranggai, <verse eid="JER 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2" />“RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide Baruch n dage rangzeu: <verse eid="JER 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3" />Nang rangla, ‘Ainie Ih keherei dida, kedanemene RAMPAUBE Ih keherei kebam gage kaisi kegaine. A reidung ziemne Ih mra eh mnei dida; Ih kemtak gede ngau luma.’ <verse eid="JER 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4" />Nang pe dage ainzwa rang beulu maisia: ‘RAMPAUBE aide rangzeu: pielo, Ih dai teigai bi, cu Ih teimsia zeuda, Ih ling kegai de, Ih cu paidi zeu da, Ih aide kideu pelane ga teigai zie. <verse eid="JER 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5" />Dede nang nkatei nziemne ma kedi ngaulu kebui nzwa cetla ni? Cide regui eh cetla so. Kedanemene pielo, kekap mina pelane da gwangla di delu, RAMPAUBE aide ndugai, dede Ih ncu n keringria kelibeu zie n ziehi nzwa nang keheiga mie liede.’”<verse eid="JER 45:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46" />
  <para style="s">Egypt ha Sam ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1" />RAMPAUBE sam aide caihakecibe Jeremiah da heleuhdung ziemne gwang. <verse eid="JER 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2" />Egyptme ziemne: “Aide Egypt gwangpei, Euphrate Reuki taiga Carchemish namdi ga kebam, Pharaoh Necho reugwame ha. Reugwame aidungde de Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ne ngam kelume, Josiah napei Jehoiakim Judah ga hegwang tei kelu mmi mdai bekum:<verse eid="JER 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3" />Egypt reugwa kedimedung sahgai: Hegeudung keceu nah kedi be keu mteilu, nah hereu regi kera tetpet gailu.<verse eid="JER 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4" />Hekwendung net telei lu; hekwen reu ga bamlu nah nnui peurwadung kailu eh sapbia lu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:4">hengei muidung kereei lu nah nnui reunet kailu.<verse eid="JER 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5" />Ih aikade daipai ngau zeu no? Penui kengngi le pui eh pak tet dida, kedanemene penui reugwame de ngam kedine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:5">Penui de kelilu kera ziemne pakla dida, nah penui caili nreu pie meda. Kengngi le pelane twagwa pui bam kedi, RAMPAUBE aide ndugai,<verse eid="JER 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6" />Paksüt lade pak swa gailak, nah reugwamedung mbai gailak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:6">Tingtünle de penui pi nsui nah Euphrate Reuki kungga nlui mie.<verse eid="JER 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7" />Nile nzwa hu kecu aide cau no, pe reuki dui nswak nzwa kebam de?<verse eid="JER 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8" />Egypt Nile nzwa eh hucuh, kereuki duidung nswak kebam nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:8">Egypt rang eh, ‘Ih cuh zie nah Ih kideube de gum luzie. Ih namdidung nah cika kelunghme de ngkap dizie.<verse eid="JER 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9" />Hekwendung hangcu. Nnui hekwen bagidung, nnui rata lu. Peu reugwamedung de tetpet gai cu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:9">Cush nah Put, hegeu pung kecime, nah Ludim ga mina lakpi pwa kecimedung.’<verse eid="JER 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10" />Cipaunai Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang hekum kepeei benai zie, nah pa pekatei pe ngauraume de hekum peei zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:10">Kingtie le ngkap gwang zie nah mnung luzie. Penui jai tei pui kelu cide sak zie. Kedanemene Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:10">dage kideu tingtünle Euphrate reuki taiga de ratak ge teigai zielu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:22">Luk. 21:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11" />Relei kemci Egypt napoe, Gilead ga hang cu delwe cikade reheu keulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:11">Nnui kai kebam reheu pelane kemta ge dida. Nnuide teingkei kera kette gahda.<verse eid="JER 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12" />Heleuhdung nnui ngngam ha siulu da. Kideube nnui kehap kwane pui dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:12">kedanemene reugwame hangge ne hangge pi mrapgai delwe penai hangna ngngwa kaudi.”<verse eid="JER 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13" />Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar Egypt deu gwaketang kera kegwang dau, Rampaube sam aide caihakecibe Jeremiah dage ranggai:<verse eid="JER 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14" />“Egypt gage sahgai beulu, nah Migdol, Memphis, nah Tahpanhes namdi gage sah ndu gai beulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:14">‘Nnui bam keulu nah nnuikatei nnuide mteilu, kedanemene nnui tai twagwa kebamdung de kingtie le ngkapdi zielu.’<verse eid="JER 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15" />Daitei nnui kengkieng reugwamedung hangdeu ga nkumpung bam dino? Penui cuhsap gailak ta, kedanemene Ih, Rampaube, penuide hangdeu gage cwakgaidi delu.<verse eid="JER 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16" />Pa reugwame kekiee gede peu kaudi. Reugwame hangge reu hangge ge kau mie. Penui hangge ge dage ranggai, ‘Cuhlu. Kilung ga gwang cu go.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:16">Anui ramme, anui paupai ram ga cailigwang cu go. Anuide dap ngkau kebam kingtie aide dade pak lugo.’<verse eid="JER 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17" />Penui cikade sah ndugai, “Egypt gwangpei Pharaoh au pekwa kekiee gwale sima, pa peu ziuyide mzia tet dida!”<verse eid="JER 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18" />Hegwangpei, pe zi Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rang ndu gai, Ih ring kebamtane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:18">mikangge Tabor deutu nah jaaidi taiga Carmel deutu nzwa gwang zie.<verse eid="JER 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19" />Nnuikatei nnui niadung langgi kedime tei kera mtei lulo, nnui Egypt ga lungh kebammedung.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:19">Kedanemene Memphis kemta ge dizie, cide ngkap kedi ge dizie nah cika migede lunghta dizie.<verse eid="JER 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20" />Egypt au hezuyisüt kecu ketumna ge, dede nkeu kela kauge tingtünle de gwangla dida. Cide au gwangla dida.<verse eid="JER 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21" />Liikelu reugwamedung penui kakga ketumseu pelui keyibedung nzwa bam, dede penui liede nreutet dizie, nah paktet dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:21">Penui sap ngkwa gailak, kedanemene kengkap tingba penuide mcau eh gwangla dida, penuide saja peu kera tingge.<verse eid="JER 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22" />Egypt henei ge nzwa pekwa kwa eh bwa tet dida, kedanemene penui ngauraume penuide mcau kera gwaketang la kedine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:22">Tsingbang kebime nzwa ngauraume mreu pwalwe penui lam tet gwangla dida.<verse eid="JER 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23" />Aide RAMPAUBE ndu kegai, hegungdung bi ngkau dizie, gungpang sütbam liede.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:23">Kedanemene ngauraume peikap gai kelak tangriemdung swade kiee zielu.<verse eid="JER 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24" />Egypt napuime de tei hengam dizie. Penuide tingtünle kebam minadung ba gage peu dizie.”<verse eid="JER 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25" />Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, rangzeu, “Pielo, Ih Thebes ga kebam Amon, Pharaoh, Egypt nah penui rabedung de penui gwangpeime Pharaoh, nah penuide nlum kecumedung de saja peu lauda. <verse eid="JER 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26" />Ih penuide, penuide teitset neu eh peei kelame, nah Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar nah pe kilamedung ba gage peu dizie. Ainzwa kelu caine Egypt ga ndaa nzwa mina lungh dai zie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 46:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27" />Dede nang, a kilabe Jacob, ngngi diso. Israel, nnui suisia di helo, kedanemene pielo, Ih nnuide kemdei gade nah n leuhme hebaang tei kela deu gade ngngwa gwang daibeu lau delu. Pecai Jacob cailigwang luzie, kezuyi ngau luzie, nah kwak luzie, nah pecu migede keheu kera bam lak. <verse eid="JER 46:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28" />Nang, a kilabe Jacob, ngngi diso, aide Rampaube ndugai, kedanemene Ih ncu ngngwa lalu, cine Ih nnui de daipau heleuhdung gage teizangra gaibi cidungde de ngkap cangsiak dizie . Dede Ih nnuide ngkap cangsiak dilak. Dede Ih nnuide kesangbe gade ledeu beuzie nah saja peu mene talak.”<verse eid="JER 46:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47" />
  <para style="s">Philistia Ha Sam ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1" />RAMPAUBE sam aide caihakecibe Jeremiah da gwang Philistinme ziemne. Egypt gwangpei Gaza nam gwaketang kecu dwa sam aide peda gwang.<verse eid="JER 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2" />“RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangzeu: Pielo, tingtünle bie duidung sung cuh zeuda. Cidungde hereuki duidi nzwa lwa hung zie!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:2">Cide hangdeu be nah pereu ga kebam maleune gumpwa dizie, pe namdidung nah cika kelungh minadung de! Cine mileune kengha kie eh sah dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:2">nah kideu ga kelunghme pelane hap dizie.<verse eid="JER 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3" />Philistinme hekwendung nginglwak kwa ciisüt eh siu kegai dau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:3">hekwen bagi nah peta kwa siu kegai dau</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:3">mipeidung penui name de ngha lak, penuikatei penui kemnei ziemne.<verse eid="JER 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4" />Philistinme pelane de ngkapdi kera tingba cide gwangla dida, Tyre nah Sidon namdidung gade</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:4">penuide ngha neu kebammedung de kaam dizie. Kedanemene RAMPAUBE au Philistinme de ngkapdi zeu delu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:4">duigwadeu Caphtor deu ga bangh kebamme de. <verse eid="JER 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5" />Gaza reuga kwakliak kecu gwang zie. Ashkelon namdi, penui kideu langkam gage minadung de gi kedime de peu zing de dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:5">Daitiee ge nnuikatei nnuide teikeherei eh hap zie no?<verse eid="JER 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6" />Co, RAMPAUBE kingtie! Nang zing dedi kemak daitiee ge zie reu no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:6">N kingtie cum ga cailigwang dilu! Mtaklu nah zing de dilu.<verse eid="JER 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7" />Dainzwa RAMPAUBE aja kai kebeu dau cide mtaklu lai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:7">pa Ashkelon nah jaaidi kung deudung ga kelunghme de gwaketang lo eh aja kaibeu dau?”<verse eid="JER 47:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48" />
  <para style="s">Moab Ha Sam ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1" />Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide Moab deudi dage ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:1">“Lungrei Nebo nam da gwang bam dida, kedanemene penuide ngkapdi delu. Kiriathaim nam de hengam tei dida nah tui luda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:1">Pe kengkieng reketbam de tei ngkau nah hengam tei dida.<verse eid="JER 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2" />Moab da herüt kepeu gah da. Penui ngauraume ne Heshbon namdi gade penuide tei ngkap gai kera heciem riem.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:2">Penui rang eh, ‘Gwanglu nah anui Moab leuh de ngkap digo. Kemieme de de ngkap dizie, nnuide kingtie ge ne gwasui zie.’<verse eid="JER 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3" />Kingnei lo! Ngkapsüt kedi Horonaim namdi gade sah kecu kwa ge siu gwang.<verse eid="JER 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4" />Moab de ngkap dida. Pename kehap kwa siu bam dida.<verse eid="JER 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5" />Penui hap eh Luhith deutu ga nghang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:5">Horonaim ga kehung dau de kengkap ziemne penui kehap kwa siu bam dida.<verse eid="JER 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6" />Paklu! Nnui teilung kelilu nah hetaideu ga tsaila kemak tsingbang nadung nzwa lu.<verse eid="JER 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7" />Kedanemene nang ntadung nah n mahei de nlum kebam ziemne, ncu de tuilu zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:7">Pecai Chemosh de tuiteu mie baang dizie, pe cingkume nah muiteumedung de de si eh.<verse eid="JER 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8" />Kedanemene kengkapbe namdi leune ga gwang zie; namdi gede cide mbai gailak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:8">Cine langkam gah dizie nah langkiedung kau dizie, RAMPAUBE rang kegai nzwa.<verse eid="JER 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9" />Moab de limkera hesiudung peulo, kedanemene pa lim tetbi maisia lu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:9">Pe namdidung kemrwa deu ge dizie, cika migede lungh kera bamlak.<verse eid="JER 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10" />Keheibe de RAMPAUBE tagwa tei kenghetme de peu reset punglu! Keheibe de pe kingtie hejai bi lwa gai mene keu caili kedime de peu reset punglu.<verse eid="JER 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11" />Moab pe henane gade cu kecang kwak eh lungh bam. Pa au pe zau</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:11">madaude hela ge gade keda ge gage liagai kemakbe nzwa bam. Pa madaude hebaang ketei ga mie mereu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:11">Cine pa ndaa lui de nzwa sak yi bam reu; pe rim keyide de nli dima.<verse eid="JER 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12" />Cine pielo, tingbaziedung gwangla dida, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai, Ih pe dage pe zaula rui mpet kerame langgai zie nah cidungde ne pe ladung rui mta dizie nah tei pang kecai dizie.<verse eid="JER 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13" />Iciu eh Moabme penui rabe Chemosh ziemne hengam tei dizie Israelme Bethel de nlum kelane hengam tei kedi nzwa, penui nlum kela rabe de.<verse eid="JER 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14" />Dainzwa nnui, ‘Anui au reugwame, ngkiengsüt kecu reugwame, de eh rang lu lai’?<verse eid="JER 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15" />Moab nah pe namdidung de gwaketang eh ngkap dizie. Kedanemene pe rehang yitumedung dapketset ni ga mie kedine. Aide hegwangpei ndugai! Pezi au Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE.<verse eid="JER 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16" />Moab keherei kera matie mene gwang lau da; mzet süt eh kekap gwangla dida.<verse eid="JER 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17" />Moab twagwa eh lungh kebam leune, heei eh haplu; pe kendu de cikela leune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:17">aide sahlu; ‘Ainie, kengkieng tsingtie, herüt kepeu geutie, pang dida.<verse eid="JER 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18" />Dibon namdi ga kelunghmedung, nnuide herüt kepeu bam gade nghunglu nah hangdeu kecangh reu ga ntumlu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:18">Kedanemene Moab de ngkapdi lai eh kebambe de nnuide gwaketang bamdi delu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:18">penui ne nnui kebam kengkieng kuda de ngkap dizie.<verse eid="JER 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19" />Lampui kiga sap eh kwalu, nnui Aroer nam ga kelunghmedung.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:19">Pak tet kelame dade, ‘Daipai tei dino? de eh keteulu.<verse eid="JER 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20" />Moab pangpop kedi ziemne hengam tei dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:20">Mra eh haplu; kengha ziemne sah lu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:20">Arnon reuki taiga minadung dage rang beulu Moab de ngkapdi delie kecu.<verse eid="JER 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21" />Cu hangdeutu deudi ga saja gwang bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:21">Holon, Jahzah, nah Mephaath,<verse eid="JER 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22" />Dibon, Nebo, nah Beth Diblathaim,<verse eid="JER 48:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23" />Kiriathaim, Beth Gamul, nah Beth Meon,<verse eid="JER 48:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24" />Kerioth nah Bozrah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:24">nah Moab deu ga namdidung pelane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:24">kemdei nah kemna namdidung pelane da.<verse eid="JER 48:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25" />Moab kii dang dida; nah peba cum dida, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26" />Pecu peu sakmie lu, kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE de ngangsüt eh renialu. Peu Moab de pane mruikegai ga küt bamdi, nah peu minuineu ge tei bam dilu. <verse eid="JER 48:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27" />Moab, Israel n ziemne henui ge di meni? Pecu keregame kakgade peeilu dini, iciu eh nang pe dage pe ha kerangtane n peu hengak kecu.<verse eid="JER 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28" />Moab ga kelunghmedung, namdidung gi dilu nah hetialwa ga lungh dilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:28">Tangtsu koiki muidung gage tamhau peciep teu kela nzwa la dilo.<verse eid="JER 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29" />Anui Moabme ngangkela ha siu da, pe zai kesia de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:29">pe helia, pe zai kedi nah pecu mning kemdi de. <verse eid="JER 48:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30" />Aide RAMPAUBE ndugai, Ih pa ngang kela samdung cibam, cide pe tateidung nzwa magede ma.<verse eid="JER 48:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31" />Cine Ih Moabme ziemne heei eh hap zie, nah Moabme pelane ziemne Ih lungrei kwa ge sah gai zie nah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:31">Ih Kir Hareseth namdi ga minadung ziemne heei eh hap zie.<verse eid="JER 48:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32" />Sibmah namdi ga kubebangdung! Ih nnui ziemne Jazer dage hap kegai swade hap kiee zie. N kiakdung himpet Mcai Jaaidi kahpet kemdei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:32">Jazer namdi kecang miecang. Ma tei kengkapmedung hepwak tingdau nnui gu buibeu kela tsidung nah nnui zaudung ngkap dida.<verse eid="JER 48:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33" />Cine suiyi nah keramciem de Moabme deu gade nah matsibangdung gade keugi dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:33">Ih penui zauniakbam gade peu zaulwa si lakta. Penui suiyi kwa sah eh tet lakta. Sah kegai kwa keheibe de suiyi kwa lakta.<verse eid="JER 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34" />Heshbon gade kemdei Elealeh kecang sah kegai, penui kwa Jahaz nam gade siudi, Zoar nam gade Horonaim, nah Eglath Shelishiyah kecang, kedanemene Nimrim reuki de cangh kedine. <verse eid="JER 48:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35" />Moab ga keheibe de nlumkemakme recabam gage ratak tei kegaibe nah pe rabe dage perim kehengui teu reca tei kegaibe de Ih ngkap dizie, Aide RAMPAUBE ndugai. <verse eid="JER 48:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36" />Cine terwaine nzwa a mlung au Moab ga minadung ziemne hap bam dida. A mlung au terwaine nzwa Kir Hareseth ga minadung ziemne hap bam dida. Penui mahei hekwa keludung gah dida. <verse eid="JER 48:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37" />Kedanemene peutam pelane tai kwak dida nah tangkeimai pelane tai dida. Penui pelane ba ga hezamdung la dida, nah pelane penui kia gage roso pai kanglwe la dida. <verse eid="JER 48:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38" />Moab ga kinim pelane ga nah puidikidung kehei gade kehap rünne dida. Kedanemene Ih Moab de migede luu neu ta kedi tangdei lidung tei pang kedi nzwa ngkap kedine, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 48:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39" />Moab de teipang msiasüt dida! Penui lungrei kwa sah eh hap dida! Moab de tei hengam dida! Cine Moab au pecu twagwapung kebam leuhdung dade penui nuineu nah kengngi ge dizie.” <verse eid="JER 48:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE aide ranggai, “Pielo, ngauraume helie nzwa Moab reuga pe hesiu nzang gailwe lim gwang zie.<verse eid="JER 48:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41" />Kerioth namdi tui luda, nah pe kengkiengbam de tuilu da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:41">Kedanemene cipau nai Moab reugwamedung mlung mipui mna tet teei nzwa dizie.<verse eid="JER 48:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42" />Cine Moab de ngkap dizie nah pe leuh bam sita dizie, kedanemene pa pekatei pecu tei mdi eh RAMPAUBE de mcau kedine.<verse eid="JER 48:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43" />Kehing nah hekwaki, nah hebaidung nnuida gwangla dida, Moab ga kelunghmedung, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 48:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44" />Keheibede kehing de pak mbai kecume hekwaki ga caklüt dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:44">nah keheibede hekwaki gade mra mpet kelume de hebai gage dap dizie, kedanemene Ih RAMPAUBE aide penui reu gage teugwang gai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:44">penuide mcau eh Ih hekum kepeei bekum, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 48:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45" />Pak kelume Heshbon sung ga sap zie penui kengkieng gah zing eh, kedanemene Heshbon gade mi ru mpet zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:45">Sihon sum gade mi heu cuh zie. Cide ne Moabme sipie nah hegie kelame peulim ru dizie.<verse eid="JER 48:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46" />Lungrei Moab da gwang zie! Chemosh de reca kelame de ngkap dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:46">Kedanemene nnui napeime de tuiteu tet dida nah nnui napuime de hebaang tei dida.<verse eid="JER 48:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47" />Dede pecai Ih Moab de peu lungh yi dai luzie, aide RAMPAUBE ndu kegai.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:47">Moab de tutiak kepeu aikade penli da.<verse eid="JER 48:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49" />
  <para style="s">Ammon ha Sam Ge</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1" />Ammonme ziemne, RAMPAUBE aide ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:1">“Israel name gah deni? Israel deu gum kera migede gah deni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:1">Daitei peu Molech de reca kelame de Gad gum teu dino, nah peu pe minadung de pe namdidung ga lungh dino?<verse eid="JER 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2" />Cine pielo, tingbaziedung gwangla dida, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai, Ih Ammonme kakga, Rabbah namdi de hereu tei kera kwa sahgai kecudau</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:2">cide pütkedi namdi ge tei dizie, nah penui namdung ru dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:2">Iciulude Israel pe dade pe deu luu teu kedime dade ngau dai luzie,” de eh RAMPAUBE ranggai.<verse eid="JER 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3" />Heei eh haplu, Heshbon, kedanemene Ai ngkap dizie delu! Sah mra gailo, Rabbah mipuidung! Rosopai bahlu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:3">Haplu nah pak rwalu, kedanemene Molech de</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:3">penui cingkume nah muiteumedung de si eh tuiteu tetdi lau delu.<verse eid="JER 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4" />Ammon ga minadung, daitei nnui deu langkamdung ziemne hegie lano; kenlum kegah napuimedung, nnui deu langkamdung malung yisüt kecu ziemne ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:4">Nnui nnui maheidung de nlum kelame rang eh cu, ‘Cauge anuide gwangketang lulai?’<verse eid="JER 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5" />Pielo, Ih nnui reu gage kehing ge teugwang beu lau da, aide Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndugai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:5">kehing aide nnuide twagwapung kebam leune dade gwang zie. Nnui hangge ge kecu pakzang dizie cide dwa gade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:5">Pak zang kelame de teu hekwalu kera migede bamlak.<verse eid="JER 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6" />Dede aipaude cai Ammonmedung de peu lunghyi dailu zie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.”<verse eid="JER 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7" />Edom ha, Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide ranggai, “Teman ga migede lungcet keyime de peei gai lak deni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:7">Macilu kelamedung dade keyibe ranglia kera migede gahdi deni? Penui maci de masanglu tadi deni?<verse eid="JER 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8" />Paklu! Nreu caililu! Hangdeu koiki ga bamlu, Dedan ga kelunghmedung.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:8">Kedanemene Ih Esau de saja kepeu kengkap de Ih keu gwangla di delu.<verse eid="JER 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9" />Kubetsi keraime n da gwang cai, penui keceu nage rai bangh beu zie ha?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:9">Keregame tingmui gwang cai, penui luu keneube rünne gwale rega teu dilak ha?<verse eid="JER 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10" />Dede Ih Esau de peu paaula dida. Ih pe mbai bamdung ragi dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:10">Cine pa mbai gailakta. Pe name, pe caihereiswacing medung, nah pe kidamedung de ngkap dida, nah pa bam meda.<verse eid="JER 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11" />Nnui gu nggianadung de püt diakgai beulu. Ih penui mapie beuzie, nah nnui gu hemipuidung acu ngngei eh lungh lubui.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:5">1 Tim. 5:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE aide ranggai, “Pielo, saja piak sakbui kemakme saja piak cide sak bi maisia. Nnui saja ngau mene tet lubui lie cet lani? Ma, nnui sak bi mene talak. <verse eid="JER 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13" />Kedanemene Ih a sampet dida, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai, Bozrah namdi de mi ngau kehing, ngaugia kegah, ngkap kedi, nah reset deu ge tei dizie. Namdidung pelane kelungta ngkap kedi tei dizie.<verse eid="JER 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14" />Ih RAMPAUBE dade samdung ge siu gwang, nah samgwame gede heleuhdung dage langgai dide lie eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:14">‘Gwang ngkwalu nah penuide gwaketang cu. Hereu tei kerane mtei lulo rangbeu’.<verse eid="JER 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15" />“Kedanemene pielu, Ih nnuide kedame leuhme swade teiceu dida, migede nnuide rüt lak.<verse eid="JER 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16" />Nnuide mikedame hingla lie eh, nnui ngang kela dene nnui de cwa dida, tsura tialwa ga lungh kelamedung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:16">nnui kideutu kehudung gum kelumedung iciu eh cikage helie nzwa nnui ciep tei hulu eh lungh la liede.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:16">Ih nnuide cikade teu nghung dizie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17" />Edom kehing nam ge tei dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:17">Pe kengkapdung ngau kegai dau tetkah kegwang leune mbeu nah keheu dizie.<verse eid="JER 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18" />Sodom penai Gomorrah nah pe namdadung de ngkap kedi nzwa,” RAMPAUBE rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:18">“Migede cika lungh lak; mina migede cika bam lak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 19:24-25</char></note><verse eid="JER 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19" />Pielo, pa hang zie hingho ge Jordan hegung gade tsehei kendiak deudung ga pak kempet nzwa eh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:19">Kedanemene Ih mzetsüt eh Edom de cikade peu pak dizie, nah Ih kedetkelu kangge, de peu tsen rengei kera kai dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:19">Kedanemene cau Ih nzwa no, nah caune acu gwang lo eh qu lulai? Meurün kekwame cauge acu renia lulai?”<verse eid="JER 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20" />Cine RAMPAUBE Edom de mmau kera riem keludung de kingnei lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:20">riem kelu cidungde pa Teman namdi ga kelunghme dage tei gai kera mning kebam de.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:20">Penuide teukerei gibi dizie, kauruine ceutubedung kecang de si eh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:20">Penui gu heidiak deudung de luugai kelak deudung ge tei dizie.<verse eid="JER 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21" />Edom kaumie kecu kwa dene kideu mlai dizie. Keherei kwa mra kegai de Kegie Jaaidi gade siudi.<verse eid="JER 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22" />Pielo, mi kangge helie ge pe hesiu kimlwe lim kemie nzwa Bozrah de gwaketang zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:22">Cipau nai Edom reugwamedung mlung mipuige hena mna tet teei nzwa dizie.<verse eid="JER 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23" />Damascusme ziemne liecai: “Hamath nah Arpad namdidung ngngam dizie, kedanemene penui kengkap gwang kela ha siu kelune.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:23">Penui lung keherei bam dida! Jaaidi nzwa kenwakswak eh sünne eh bamlu meda.<verse eid="JER 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24" />Damascusme mnei eh pak kera nreutet dida; kehing,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:24">suisiet nah keteei lepui, mipui kemna dau teei kela nzwa eh.<verse eid="JER 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25" />Dainzwa a sui kela namdi de, Ih a suiyi eh twa bam kela namdi de püt zing dedi meno?<verse eid="JER 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26" />Cine penui rehangmedung penui namdi sum gage kauzeu gai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:26">nah reugwame pelane de cipaunai ngkap dizie, aide Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ndugai.”<verse eid="JER 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27" />Kedanemene Ih Damascus kirie gage mi twa gai zie, nah cide Ben Hadad kuda kengkiengdung de ru ngkau dizie.”<verse eid="JER 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kedar penai Hazor Ha Sam ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28" />Kedar leuhme nah Hazor gwangramdung ziemne RAMPAUBE aide Nebuchadnezzar dage ranggai. (Cu Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar hegwangram aidungde de gwaketang lai eh bam):</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:28">“Cuhlu nah Kedar de gwaketang cu nah naimiak kepetle leuhdung de ngkap dilu.<verse eid="JER 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29" />Penui paikidung nah penui kauruine dung tui teu dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:29">penui paiki paidung nah penui nia maleune dung de si eh;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:29">penui utdung de penui dade teu tet dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:29">nah minadung penui dage sah gai zie, “Kengngi le twagwa puipung bam dida!”<verse eid="JER 49:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30" />Paklu! Cikemak kemdei gage! Hangdeu koiki ga bamlu, Hazor ga kelungh minadung, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:30">kedanemene Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar nnuide mmau kerane heciem ge riem luda. Paklu! Caili dilu!<verse eid="JER 49:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31" />Cuhlu! Heleuh sünne eh kwak eh lungh kebamme de gwaketang kera,” de eh RAMPAUBE ranggai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:31">“Penui au kiriekidung mede pecapdung gah, nah pe minadung katei lungh bam.<verse eid="JER 49:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32" />Kedanemene penui gu utdung tuiteu dizie, nah penui gunia kekiee ge hereu gade ngkap dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:32">Pecai Ih mina penui tam biet dui kedime de lule ailam pelane gage tei zangra dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:32">nah Ih kengkap penui dage maleune gade teugwang gai zie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33" />Hazor de maiserung rünne kelungh ni ge tei dizie, kelunghta kemta deu ge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:33">Migede cika lungh lak; mina migede cika bamlak.”<verse eid="JER 49:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34" />Aide Elam deudi ziemne RAMPAUBE sam caihakecibe Jeremiah da kegwang. Aide Judah gwangpei Zedekiah hegwang tei kelu kerai dau rang kegai sam ge, nah pa ranggai, <verse eid="JER 49:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35" />“Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangzeu: pielo, Ih Elam de tei ngkiengsüt kebam, lakpi kepwame de teipang gai lauda.<verse eid="JER 49:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36" />Kedanemene Ih tingkai tinggim tu mdai gade keugwang gui gaizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:36">nah Ih Elam minadung de tu mdai gage tei zangra gaizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:36">Tei zangra kegai Elam minadung deudi ket gade mie kemak bamlak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:1">Keu. 7:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 49:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37" />Cine Ih Elamme de teipang pop gai zie, penui ngauraume nah penui de teitset dizie lie kelame dwa gade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:37">kedanemene Ih a rata süt kedi ziemne penui reu gage kengkap teugwang gai zie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 49:37">nah Ih penui dage kingtie langgai zie Ih penuide ngkap ciakdi kemaktane.<verse eid="JER 49:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38" />Pecai Ih Elam gage a kedi bam dwa luzie nah penui gwangpei nah muiteumedung de cikade ngkap dizie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai,<verse eid="JER 49:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39" />nah pecai tingbaziedung ge cai Ih Elam minadung de peu lunghyi dai luzie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.”<verse eid="JER 49:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50" />
  <para style="s">Babylon Ha Sam ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1" />RAMPAUBE sam aide caihakecibe Jeremiah dade Babylon namdi nah Babylonme deu ha rang ndu kegai,<verse eid="JER 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2" />“Heleuhdung dage ranglia beulu nah peu kingnei lu. Marehi ge pwa cuh hugai nah peu kingnei lu. Cide pwa mbai diso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:2">Aide ranglu, ‘Babylon de ngam luda. Bel de hengam tei dida, Marduk lungrei tei dida. Pegu mamiedung hengam tei dida; pe miedung suisiet ge tei dida.’<verse eid="JER 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3" />Heleuh ge tingtünle de renia kera cuh zie, nah penui deu de hetaideu ge tei dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:3">Cika migede lungh lak; mina nah makaunedung de pak tet dizie.<verse eid="JER 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4" />Aide RAMPAUBE ndugai, cipau tingdau nah tingbazie kegwang benai, Israel nah Judah ga minadung</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:4">gwang ngkwa dizie, penui Tinggwang RAMPAUBE de peei kera ziemne hap eh tet gaizie.<verse eid="JER 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5" />Penui Zion lampui keteu zie nah cilam ge tet gai zie, penui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:5">anui mie zie nah anui RAMPAUBE de ngngwa kelunghta nsungta di kelak samkak kelu ge tei zie,” de rang eh.<verse eid="JER 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6" />A minadung gah kedi meurün hau ge tei dida. Penuide kekwame penuide lamlwatuhdung gage zang gai dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:6">penui penuide kideutu ge gade kideutu keda ge gage ngngwa gai dida. Penui mie, dede penui dai ga lungh bi nsungta dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:6">Mat. 10:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7" />Penui da kemie leune ne penuide ngkapdi. Penui ngauraume ranggai, ‘Anui au mau ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:7">kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE, penui ki kesangbe, RAMPAUBE, penui paupaime kereguibe de mcau eh kemau tei kedine.’<verse eid="JER 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8" />Babylon gade tet dilu; Chaldeame deu gade tet mpetlu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:8">hemeuseudung pehau dwa tet rai kelade nzwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:4">Keu. 18:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9" />Kedanemene pielu, Ih tingtünle de heleuhdung maadi ge ncuhlu eh Babylon de gwaketang zieda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:9">Penui katei penuide mtei luzie Babylon de mcau kerane. Babylon de cikade tui luzie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:9">Penui au teihkap keyime lakpitsi madaude gizeu dila kemak nzwa da.<verse eid="JER 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10" />Chaldea au hema tui kedi nam ge dizie. Hema ketuime leune mnung lu zie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Nnui suiyi eh nnui a leuhme niadung tui kelude teu hengyi bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:11">nnui ketumseuna tsehei kemdiak luh ga nsün twagwa kebam nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:11">nnui hekwen kengkieng ge mra mteisüt kegai nzwa mra bam dida.<verse eid="JER 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12" />Cine nnui pui ngngam süt dizie; nnuide mna kebeu be ngngam dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:12">Pielo, pa heleuhdung dade ceutu ge tei dizie, hetaideu ge, hangdeu kecangh ge, nah kideu ketsai ge dizie.<verse eid="JER 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13" />RAMPAUBE rata ziemne, Babylon ga mina lunghta dizie, dede ngkap cangsiak kedi nam ge dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:13">Babylon ngkap msiasüt kedi ziemne cika tetkah kegwang leune mbeu nah keheu dizie.<verse eid="JER 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14" />Nnui Babylon twagwa kebam pelane de ketang kera mteilu, keheibede lakpi kap kera teu kelume pe dage kapgai maisia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:14">Nnui lakpitsi kette keu caili dai so, kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE dage kemau tei gaidi delu.<verse eid="JER 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15" />Penuide twakengwa pelane gade hereu kwa sah gai lulo! Penui mikang nlüt dida; penui reketbam kau dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:15">penui kiriedung tei ngkau dida, kedanemene aide RAMPAUBE hekum kepeei gelu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:15">Pe dade hekum peeilu! Pa tei kegai nzwa pe dage teigai lu!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:6">Keu. 18:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16" />Babylon ga luhlüt tingdau, heta ketame heleuh ling kelame nah tangkane teu luhget kelame hangna na gunia ngkap dilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:16">Peu penuide penui leuhme da cailigwang dilu, peu gwaketang kela kingtie dwa gade pak penui deu ga gwang dilu.<verse eid="JER 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17" />Israel au meurün hinghodung ne gwa gidi nah tei zangra kedi ge nzwa da. Keraibe Assyria gwangpei ne penui de ngkap di;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:17">pecai Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ne pe radung tei pangdi. <verse eid="JER 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18" />Cine Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide ranggai: Pielo, Ih Babylon gwangpei nah pe deu de saja peu zie da, Ih Assyria gwangpei de saja kepeu nzwa.<verse eid="JER 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19" />Ih Israel de ndaa nzwa teu cuh dai luzie penui tingdeu gage; pa Carmel Deutu nah Bashan cuikui ga taktyeidung lungh kelube tyei zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:19">Pecai penui Ephraim nah Gilead kideutu deudidung gade de mnung luzie.<verse eid="JER 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20" />Cipau tingdau, RAMPAUBE ranggai, Israel ga kemau kesia peei zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:20">dede kette ngaugai lak. Ih Judahme maudung keteu zie, dede kette ngaugai lak, kedanemene Ih püt gai kebeu bangh kebamme maudung gibeu zie kecune.”<verse eid="JER 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Cuhlu delwe Merathaim deu nah Pekod ga kelunghme de mcaulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:21">Penuide kingtie gage kailu nah penuide ngkapdi kerane teu tsam dilu, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai, Ih nnuide teilo rang kebeu leune tei lu.<verse eid="JER 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22" />Hereu ketei kwa nah kengkap kedi ge kideu ga bam dida.<verse eid="JER 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23" />Dainzwa kideu pelane gu tsudiak tei pang takcai nah tei ngkapdi dino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:23">Dainzwa Babylon heleuhdung kakgade ngkap kedi nam ge tei dino.<verse eid="JER 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24" />Babylon Ih nnui tak teigai nah nnuide keulu, dede nnui cilu ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:24">Nnui de peei lu nah tuilu, kedanemene nnui RAMPAUBE de mlai kedine.<verse eid="JER 50:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25" />RAMPAUBE pe reunet nia kaipwa kebam de letgai dida nah reunet niadung keumpet luda pe rata kaigai kera ziemne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:25">Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang Babylonme deu ga heta tei kera bam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">50:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 13:5</char></note><verse eid="JER 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26" />Kemdei gade penuide gwaketang lu. Penui tsiukidung let lu nah penuide cikage kailu tsiu pung kebau kelube nzwa eh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:26">Penuide ngkapdi kerane keu ntsamlu. Penui migede de bangh nzeu so.<verse eid="JER 50:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27" />Penui tumseudung gitset ciak dilu. Gitset kera bam gage penuide lang nghung gai lu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:27">Lungrei penui da gwang zie, kedanemene penui tingbazie gwang bam dide lu, penuide saja peu kera ting de.<verse eid="JER 50:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28" />Ringkelumedung kepak kwa siu bam dida, Babylon deu gade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:28">Aidungde ne RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang Zion ziemne, nah pe kerecaki ziemne hekum kepeei ha paulia zie”.<verse eid="JER 50:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29" />“Lakpi kekapme de Babylon gwaketang lo rang beulu, lakpidung kap kera teu mtei kelu leu de.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:29">Penuide ramzeuki tei twagwa lu eh mcau lu, nah peu migede de pak diso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:29">Penui tei kegai nzwa penui pau rui beulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:29">Penui pwa tei kegai kiee ge mdetlwe penui dage tei gai lu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:29">Kedanemene penui Israel kemci RAMPAUBE de renia kecu ziemne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:6">Keu. 18:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 50:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30" />Cine penui reugwamedung namdi puididung ga kau zeu dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:30">nah pe reugwamedung pelane de cipau nai ngkap dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:30">Aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.”<verse eid="JER 50:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31" />“Pielo, nnui ngang kelame de Ih mmaula, aide Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ne ndugai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:31">kedanemene nnui tingba gwang bam dida, ngang kelamedung, Ih nnuide saja peu kera ting gwangbam dida.<verse eid="JER 50:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32" />Cine ngang kelame pi nsui nah kau dizie. Migede penui de kwak ncuh beulak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:32">Ih penui namdidung gage mi twa gaizie; cide penuide twagwapung kebam pelane ru ngkap dizie.<verse eid="JER 50:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33" />Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide ranggai: Israel nah Judah ga minadung de tei keherei bam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:33">Penuide tui kelume penuide baang pwa bam dida; penui penuide peu tet meda.<verse eid="JER 50:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34" />Penuide kelibeu kelabe au ngkieng. Pezi au Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE. Pa penui ziemne pe nggia kie zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:34">peu penui deu ziemne kemtak teugwang beu kera ziemne nah Babylon ga mina kelunghme dage au keherei teugwang beu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:8">Keu. 18:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 50:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35" />Kingtie ge Chaldeame, nah Babylon ga mina kelunghme, penui muiteume nah makecimedung dage mcau bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:35">aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 50:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36" />Kemta sam kerangme de kingtie le mcau zie! I ciu eh penui kemieme dizie!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:36">Reugwamedung de kingtie le mcau zie! Penui kehing le pui dizie.<verse eid="JER 50:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37" />Kingtie ge penui hekwendung, penui bagidung nah Babylon ga mina kelunghme pelane de mcau kera gwangla dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:37">cine penui mipuidung nzwa dizie. Kingtie ge penui mabam kibungdung ziemne gwangla dida, nah cidungde tui luzie.<verse eid="JER 50:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38" />Tingrui kelak ge gwangla dida, cine penui deu cangh dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:38">Kedanemene penui deu au kemta miedung de kereca deu ge di delu, nah penui tatei kemieme nzwa dida penui teikelu kehing mamiedung de reca kecune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:12">Keu. 16:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 50:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39" />Cine kideu ketsai kaudung penai heneudung ne cika lungh dizie, nah ruitie ne penuide ngngwa lungh dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:39">Madaude, cika mina lungh si lakta. Ceheu ceheu caide mina cika lungh gwang dai lakta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:2">Keu. 18:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 50:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40" />Sodom penai Gomorrah nah pe namdamedung de Tinggwang ngkap kedi nzwa, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:40">migede mina cika lungh lak; migede cika bamta dizie.”<verse eid="JER 50:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41" />“Pielo, tingtünle de heleuh kedi ge nah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:41">hegwangpei kekiee ge ncütlu eh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:41">kideu mdeitu gade mina gwangla dida.<verse eid="JER 50:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42" />Penui lakpi nah hengeidung pwa cuh luzie. Penui au penui zai sia nah ngaugia gah.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:42">Penui kwa au jaaidi kwa nzwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:42">nah penui hekwendung ga cwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:42">hereu ziemne mina mteilu eh tetpet dida, ncu mcau kerane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:42">Babylon napui.<verse eid="JER 50:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43" />Babylon gwangpei da penui ha paukegai sam siu gwangdi nah pe lung keherei eh pe ba kenana sia eh kezumie mlailu tadi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:43">Mipui ge mna tedteei keteei nzwa pa teeizu eh mlai gai lakdi.<verse eid="JER 50:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44" />Ainie! Pa hingho ge nzwa hang eh Jordan deutuh gade heidiak deu ga mie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:44">Kedanemene Ih mzetsüt eh penuide peu cikade pak tetdi kera tei zie, nah Ih ne kedet kelube de ne heleuh be muiteu tei zie .</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:44">Kedanemene cauge Ih nzwa no, nah cauge acu gwanglo qu lai? Meurün kekwabe cauge acu renia lulai?<verse eid="JER 50:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45" />Cine Babylon de mcau kera RAMPAUBE riem kelude kingnei lulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:45">Chaldeame deu de mcau kera riem keludung de. Penuide teukerei tet bi dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:45">ceutu nabe kauruine kecang de. Penui gu heidiak deudung de ngkap kedi nidung dizie.<verse eid="JER 50:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46" />Babylon ngamkelu kwa dene kideu mlaidi, nah penui kenrim kwa sah kegaide heleuhdung kakga siu gwangdi.”<verse eid="JER 50:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1" />RAMPAUBE aide ranggai: Pielo, Ih Babylonme reuga kengkap tingkai ge teugwang lai zeu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:1">nah Leb Kamai ga lungh kebamme da.<verse eid="JER 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2" />Ih sangmedung de Babylon gage langgai dizie. Penui pecu teizang dizie nah pe deu teimsia dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:2">kedanemene teikemsia tingba benai penui pecu twagwa kebam leune gade ketang kera gwang zie.<verse eid="JER 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3" />Lakpi kepwame de penui lakpidung gaa kera ting peuso; peu penuide reunet kaiso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:3">Pe rehangmedung de mbaibeu so; pe reugwame pelane de teingkap ciak de dilu.<verse eid="JER 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4" />Kedanemene mina rezam kedidung au Chaldeame deu ga kaumie zie; tsai kedimedung pe puidikidung ga kaumie zie.<verse eid="JER 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5" />Kedanemene Israel penai Judah de penui Tinggwang Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE gi dima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:5">penui deu ga au Israel Kemci Tinggwang dage hetakesia ketei le pui bam liede.<verse eid="JER 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6" />Israel nah Judah ga minadung nnui Babylon dade paklu; peu hangge gede pekatei pecu kelilu. Pemau ziemne nnuide peu ngkap diso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:6">Kedanemene cu au RAMPAUBE hekum kepeei ting. Pa ngaulu kebui nsam gade RAMPAUBE pecu saja peu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:4">Keu. 18:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7" />RAMPAUBE ba gade Babylon au kideu pelane de tei mie di kela kecak piak ge;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:7">heleuhdung pe zau saklu nah kemieme nzwa dila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">51:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 14:8, 17:2,4, 18:3</char></note><verse eid="JER 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8" />Babylon kau zette dizie nah ngkap dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:8">Pe ziemne haplu! Pa teei kebam ziemne reheu peu beulu; pa yi ngkei di lubui.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">51:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 14:8,18:2</char></note><verse eid="JER 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9" />Cika sangme lungh kebamdung rangdi, ‘Anui Babylon de peu yi ngkei luneu lie, dede pa au yi ngkeilu meda. Anui pelane pecu pütdi eh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:9">anui deu gage tetgai digo. Kedanemene pe mau tinggimdung ga hang cang dida; cide hemwadung ga cuh eh ngkwa bam dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:5">Keu. 18:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10" />Anui mau kemak de RAMPAUBE ndugai dida. Gwanglu, Zion ga mie ranggo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:10">RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang batadung de.’<verse eid="JER 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11" />Lakpitsidung tui nzaulu delwe hegeudung de keu cuhlu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:11">RAMPAUBE Medes gwangpei de peu Babylon de ngkapti kera pe lung teigai bam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:11">Aide RAMPAUBE hekum kepeei, pe kerecaki ngkap kedi ziemne hekum kepeei ge zie.<verse eid="JER 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12" />Babylonme kirie reu gage pailim ge keu cuhlu; reketme kaisilu; kekwame kailu; gwaketang kera mteilu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:12">kedanemene Babylon ga lungh kebamme ziemne RAMPAUBE pa rang kegaide teicang zielu.<verse eid="JER 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13" />Nnui minadung receunadung kekieege taiga lungh kebamme, nnui minadung mabamdung bam eh mahei kebamme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:13">nnui gu penli gwang cang bamda. Nnui teilung ria de dang ndui dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:1">Keu. 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="REV 17:15">15</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE pe zi teu sampet gai, ‘Ih nnuide tangriemdung nzwa mina le teipui beu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:14">nah penui reutak kwa n dage sah gaizie.’<verse eid="JER 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15" />Pa pe kengkieng le kideube teilu; pa pe maci le kideube de damgai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:15">Pe kecikecet le tinggimdung tei mdilu.<verse eid="JER 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16" />Pa mrung kegaidau, cika tinggimdung gade duidung mra dila, kedanemene pa kideu penli gade hemwa keu cuhla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:16">Pa tingrui ziemne tingkehepik teigai nah pe kehekwakidung gade tingkai langmpet gaila.<verse eid="JER 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17" />Mileune de mang dida nah maci gah da. Hegeuta ketei leune de pa reca kela dene hengam tei dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:17">Kedanemene pe miedung au kenret, nah penui da keringria gah.<verse eid="JER 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18" />Mamiedung au kemta ge, mlai kerabe ge; penuide saja kebeu tingdau penuide ngkap dizie.<verse eid="JER 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19" />Dede Tinggwang, Jacob mpaube, au cidungde nzwa ma, kedanemene pa au maleune tei kegaibe. Israel leuh au pe minadung;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:19">Pe zi au Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE.<verse eid="JER 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Babylon, nang au a reugwa geuteisang, a reugwa ziemne reunet.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:20">Ncu ngngwa Ih heleuhdung de gwaketang nah hegwangramdung de ngkap zie.<verse eid="JER 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21" />Ih ncu ngngwa hekwendung nah keteumedung de tei kecai dizie; Ih ncu ngngwa bagidung nah cidungde keteume de tei kecai dizie.<verse eid="JER 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22" />Ih ncu ngngwa mipei nah mipui ketket de tei takcai dizie; Ih ncu ngngwa kecingme nah hename de tei takcai dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:22">Ih ncu ngngwa rehangmedung nah relei kemcimedung de tei takcai dizie.<verse eid="JER 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23" />Ih ncu ngngwa meurün kekwame nah pe kauhaudung de tei takcai dizie; Ih ncu ngngwa luh kepume nah pe zangmedung de tei takcai dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:23">Ih ncu ngngwa deuceudibe nah kedimedung de tei takcai dizie.<verse eid="JER 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “N miakngau gade Ih Babylon nah Chaldea ga lunghkebam pelane de penui Zion gade</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:24">kesia tah tei kedi leune ziemne saja peu zie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 51:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25" />Pielo, Ih ncu renia bam, kengkap lamlwatu, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai, kideu pelane de ngkap kedibe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:25">Ih a ba nzang pet ncu keraklwe tsura reu gade kela nghung dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:25">nah ncu lamlwa ru kedi nzwa ge tei dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:8">Keu. 8:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 51:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26" />Cine penui n dade tangtsu keu kimiak tsu tei mede pe sing kam lak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:26">kedanemene nang kelunghta kengkap ge dizie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 51:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27" />Hangdeu reu ga pailim ge keu cuhlu. Heleuhdung reu ga hereu tei kerane telui kwa gailu. Pecu gwaketang kera heleuhdung de qu gai:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:27">Ararat, Minni, nah Ashkenaz.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:27">Pecu gwaketang kerane reugwa muibe hangge de kedetlu; tangriem maa nzwa hekwendung ngngwa gwanglu.<verse eid="JER 51:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28" />Pecu gwaketang kerane heleuhdung de mteilu: Medes gwangpeidung nah deuceudibe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:28">pe kangga kedime pelane nah pe kangga kebam deudung pelane.<verse eid="JER 51:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29" />Kedanemene hangdeu mlai nah keherei dizie, RAMPAUBE Babylon de mmau kera riembam dide kecune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:29">Babylon deu de mina lungh kemak kemtadeu ge teidi kerane.<verse eid="JER 51:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30" />Babylon ga reugwamedung regi mtak dida; penui au penui kengkiengbam ga bam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:30">Penui kengkieng au mnei dida; penui mipuidung nzwa dida, pe kidung au heu bam dida, pe kirie tsiadung au pang dida.<verse eid="JER 51:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31" />Samgwame ge samgwa kedage da pakmie ranggai, nah hegwaketeime ge hegwaketei kedage dage rang</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:31">Babylon gwangpei dage pe namdi de penli ga kecang keuteu pwadi delie ranglia kera.<verse eid="JER 51:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32" />Cine hereuki reuga kebam lampuidung de tui luda; ngauraume tseheibuidung de ru bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:32">nah Babylon reugwame de kebwak dida.<verse eid="JER 51:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33" />Kedanemene Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, aide ranggai: Babylon napui au hecaipung ge nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:33">Pecu neu kera ting dida. Peting tie mene pe da luhlüt ting gwang zieda.<verse eid="JER 51:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34" />‘Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ne acu tei ngkau dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:34">pa acu kehebwak gage ngngwa gai dida nah libung kemrwa ge tei dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:34">Neidi ge nzwa eh pa acu mnwalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:34">a taktyeidung keyi le pe za teipui lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:34">delwe pa acu mlwak mpet dida.’<verse eid="JER 51:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35" />Zion ga lungh kebamme rang zie, ‘A dage zaisiet tei kegaide nah a pumteih tei keherei kegaide peu Babylonme reuga gwang lulo.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:35">Jerusalem rang zie, ‘Peu a jai Chaldea ga kelunghme reuga bam lulo.’<verse eid="JER 51:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36" />Cine RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Pielo, Ih n tu tiak kecu ga ncu ngha zie nah n ziemne hekum teugwang beuzie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:36">Kedanemene Ih Babylon duidung tei cangh dizie nah pe duirwakdung tei cangh dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:12">Keu. 16:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 51:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37" />Babylon au sia kedidung kebau pwakebam ge, maiseurungdung bam nige, kengngi ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:37">nah mine rang kemsia ge dizie, cika migede lungh bam lak.<verse eid="JER 51:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38" />Babylonme hingho nzwa ngngwa mrung zie. Penui hingho nadung nzwa mra zie.<verse eid="JER 51:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39" />Penui mahengin süt cuh kecudau, Ih penui ziemne taktyei mtei beuzie; Ih penuide peu sakmie zie iciu eh penui sui yilu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:39">nah madaude cuhdai kelak zip ge zip dizie nah mrak cuh lak, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai,<verse eid="JER 51:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40" />Ih penuide daptset kerane meuründung nzwa nah, hemeu nah meurünseudung nzwa lang nghung gaizie.<verse eid="JER 51:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41" />Babylon de tuilu da! Cine kideu pelane hetwa de tuiteu dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:41">Heleuhdung kakgade Babylon sia kedi heni ge dida.<verse eid="JER 51:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42" />Babylon reuga jaaidi gwang bam dida! Pe mrung cui ne pecu tei cim dida.<verse eid="JER 51:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43" />Pe namdidung au mta mrwa ge dida, hangdeu kecangh ge nah hetaideu ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:43">migede lunghkemak deu ge, nah mina tetkah gwangla kemak ge dida.<verse eid="JER 51:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44" />Cine Ih Babylon gade Bel de saja peu zie; Ih pa mnwa kedide pe mui gade keu mpet dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:44">nah heleuhdung penui recadung teu eh pe da gwang ta dizie. Babylon kiriedung kau dizie.<verse eid="JER 51:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45" />Pe dade tet dilu, a minadung. A lunghop kesia gade nnui hangge ge kecu nnuikatei nnui teilung keli kaplu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">51:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Cor. 6:17</char></note><verse eid="JER 51:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46" />Kideu gade hacidung siukelu ziemne nnui lung ceu mede ngngi diso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:46">kedanemene mmi ge hacidung gwang zie. Cipau cai pecia bekum cika hacidung bam zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:46">nah keregi kecu kideu ga bam dizie. Hegwang ge hegwang keda de renia zie.<verse eid="JER 51:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47" />Cine, pielo, Ih Babylon gu tei kelu mamiedung de saja peu kera tingbadung gwangla dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:47">Pe deu leune hengam tei dizie, nah daptset kedi pe mina leune pe da kaumie zie.<verse eid="JER 51:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48" />Pecai tinggimdung nah kideube, nah penui da kebam pelane Babylon ziemne penui suiyi dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:48">Kedanemene pe ziemne kengkapbe tingtünle de gwang zie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:20">Keu. 18:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 51:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49" />Babylon ne Israelme de teitset kedi nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:49">cine Babylonme de de teitset dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:24">Keu. 18:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 51:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50" />Kingtie gade ringkelume, tetdi lu! Bam si tadi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:50">Kemdei gade RAMPAUBE de nsunglu; nah Jerusalem de nsunglu.<verse eid="JER 51:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51" />Anui au ngngam dida, kedanemene anuide kekii kwa siu delu; hengam ne anui zudung cim dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:51">kedanemene sangmedung RAMPAUBE ki kemci ni ga lüt kedine.<verse eid="JER 51:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52" />Cine, pielo, tingbadung gwang zeu, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai, tei kelu pe miedung de Ih saja kepeu dau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:52">nah pe deu leune ga rezam kedimedung mra dizie.<verse eid="JER 51:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53" />Kedanemene Babylon tinggimdung ga mede rie pwa kebam pe kengkieng reketbam ga hang liede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:53">kengkapbe a dade pe da gwang di lubui, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai.<verse eid="JER 51:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54" />Babylon gade lungrei kwa ge gwang, Chaldeanme deu gade kengkap kedi ge.<verse eid="JER 51:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE Babylon de teingkap bam. Pa pe kwa keci de tei nggah bam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:55">Penui ngauraumedung au duidung kekieege cuidung nzwa mrung bam; penui kwa ngkieng süt dida.<verse eid="JER 51:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56" />Kedanemene ngauraume penuide ngkapdi kera gwangzeu, Babylon de!, nah pe reugwame de tuiteu dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:56">Penui lakpidung au pang dida, kedanemene RAMPAUBE au hekum kepeei Tinggwang; pa Babylon de ngaulu kebui nzüt gade saja peu zie.<verse eid="JER 51:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57" />Kedanemene Ih pe gwangpeidung, makecime, pe kangga kedime, nah pe reugwame de peu sak mie zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:57">nah penui zip dizie nah madaude mrak cuh lak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:57">aide Hegwangpei ndugai: pe zi au Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE.<verse eid="JER 51:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58" />Aide Tinggim reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rangzeu: Babylon kirie kedi de teingkap zing dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:58">nah pe kirie kehudung de ru dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:58">Ciu eh minadung pecu ngha kera gwang kecume kemta gage heta teigai dizie; heleuhdung pe ziemne tei kegai pelane ru kap dizie.”<verse eid="JER 51:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59" />Aipau sam de caihakecibe Jeremiah Neriah napei nah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:59">Mahseiah capei Seraiah de Judah gwangpei Zedekiah pa hegwang teikelu mmi mdai bekum pecu ngngwa lwe Babylon ga kemie dau kepeu sam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:59">Cidau Seraiah kedi teibam. <verse eid="JER 51:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60" />Kedanemene Babylon ga kengkap gwang kera ha Jeremiah laisiudum gage rau pwabam kecune, Babylon ha rau pwa kebam sam aidung pelane. <verse eid="JER 51:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61" />Jeremiah Seraiah dage rangdi, “Nang Babylon ga mie kecudau, cipau samdung de pei sahbak gailo. <verse eid="JER 51:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62" />Ciu eh nang kielo, ‘RAMPAUBO, nang aipau ni de teimsia di kera, nah mina mede makaune cika lungh bam lak, nah cide kelunghta mrwa bam kera ndugai da.’ <verse eid="JER 51:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63" />Ciu eh nang laisiudum aide pei cang keludau, tangtsu ge cika kanggai lu eh Euphrate Reuki sum gage kelien gaidi. <verse eid="JER 51:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64" />Pecai, ainzwa ranglu, ‘Babylon ainzwa nliem mie dizie. Cide cuh gailak dizie, nah penui kau zie, Ih kengkap langgai kebam de ziemne.’” Jeremiah samdung aikade cang dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:21">Keu. 18:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="JER 51:64" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Kekau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1" />Zedekiah mmi ngkaiehket dau pa hegwang tei mdeulu; pa Jerusalem ga mmi kereiehket hegwang tei. Pe pui zi cai Hamutal; pa au Jeremiah napui Libnahme. <verse eid="JER 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2" />Hegwangpei Zedekiah, RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade petau kemakbe tei gwang; pa hegwangpei Jehoiakim ketei leune tei gwang. <verse eid="JER 52:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3" />RAMPAUBE rata gade, aidung pelane Jerusalem penai Judah da canggwang, pa penuide pe dwa gade keugi di kemaktane. Pecai Zedekiah, Babylon gwangpei de renia cuhdi. <verse eid="JER 52:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4" />Hegwangpei Zedekiah hegwang tei kelu mmi hekui bekum, kei kerei, nah hekeizie ziangrei benai, Babylon gwangpei, Nebuchadnezzar, pe reugwame pelane de ngngwa gwang Jerusalem de gwaketangdi. Penui Jerusalem de mcwalwe paiki teilwe bam, nah cika penui reugwa kirie tei twagwalu. <verse eid="JER 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5" />Cine Hegwangpei Zedekiah hegwang tei kelu mmi kereiehket kecang namdi de reugwame ne twagwa pwa bamdi. <verse eid="JER 52:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6" />Kei mdai bekei lang hekuine benai herakum siasüt kecu Jerusalem namdi ga gwang eh cipau deu ga minadung ziemne taktyeipok gahdi. <verse eid="JER 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7" />Cine namdi de pangpop di, nah mina keregi kebamdung pak tetdi nah tingmui namdi kirie kena kakga hegwangpei gurie gade tetdi, Chaldeame namdi pelane ga twagwa bam liede. Cine penui Arabah lambie ge tet gaidi. <verse eid="JER 52:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8" />Dede Chaldeame reugwame, hegwangpei de zuimie eh Jericho taiga Jordan Reuki langkam gade Zedekiah de gwakahlu. Pe reugwame pelane pe dade tet zangra di. <verse eid="JER 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9" />Penui hegwangpei Zedekiah de tuilu nah pecu Hamathme deu Riblah namdi ga Babylon gwangpei da ngngwa gwang, cikade pa pecu tutiak sam peugai. <verse eid="JER 52:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10" />Babylon gwangpei, Zedekiah napeidung de pe miakdwa gade gitsetdi, nah Riblah gade pa Judah muiteume pelane de gitsetdi. <verse eid="JER 52:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11" />Pecai pa Zedekiah miak let mpetdi, hetageu riadung le pecu kanglu, delwe pecu Babylon ga ngngwa gwang. Pa tsai kecu tingba kecang Babylon gwangpei pecu hebaangki gage kaidi.<verse eid="JER 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12" />Cu kei mengei bekei, ziangrei benai, Hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar hegwang ketei mmi kereiehekui bekum, Babylon gwangpei, Nebuzaradan Jerusalem ga gwang. Pa au hegwangpei pum kekwame reu muibe nah Babylon gwangpei kila ge. <verse eid="JER 52:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13" />Nebuzaradan RAMPAUBE ki rudi, hegwangpei kidung, nah Jerusalem kidung pelane; namdi ga kemlang kidung de pa ru di. <verse eid="JER 52:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14" />Jerusalem twagwa kebam kiriedung de, Babylon reugwame pelane, pum kekwame reu muibe de ngngwa kelame ne tei msiadi. <verse eid="JER 52:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15" />Mina magahtume ziemne, namdi ga mina bangh kelume pelane, Babylon gwangpei de püt eh tet kedime, nah heciemta ketei pe kebanghmedung, Nebuzaradan, pum kekwame reu muibe, penui kangge de hebaang tei kera tuiteu tetdi. <verse eid="JER 52:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16" />Dede Nebuzaradan, pum kekwame reu muibe, magahtume kangge de kubeluh nah luhdung ga heta tei kerane kai nzeudi.<verse eid="JER 52:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17" />RAMPAUBE ki ga kebam hetageu tsiadung de, nah pe sapdung, nah hetageu li kedi de “Jaaidi” de qu kelade RAMPAUBE kiga kebam de, Chaldeame cide teipang takcaidi delwe Babylon ga hetageu pelane pung cailigwang di. <verse eid="JER 52:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18" />Lidung, peitwakdung, mibung kentau netdung, nah kerecaki ga cingkume keu heta teikela hetageu niadung pelane, Chaldeame cidungde keuteu ciakdi. <verse eid="JER 52:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19" />Lidung nah kehengui rim keru bungdung, hekwakdung, mabungdung, mitaubungtiedung, hegeulidung, nah kecak le tei kelu lidung, nah rangkanggeu le tei keludung, cidungde de hegwangpei pum kekwabe ne keuteudi. <verse eid="JER 52:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20" />Hetsia kena, hetageu li kedi cide “Jaaidi,” de qu kelade nah hetageu hetumseu kereiehkena hetsiadung kangga kebam de, RAMPAUBE kerecaki ziemne hegwangpei Solomon tei kegaidung, hetageu perüt mdet canggai kelak ge bam. <verse eid="JER 52:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21" />Pe tsiadung pehu ketket kecu cubit kereieheset<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit kereieheset: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">feet ngkaiehena</char></note>, nah ketket de twagwa kebam petie cubit kereiehkena.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit kereiekena: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">feet kereieheset</char></note> Ketket kecu miba zurang mdai dige nah pelung ki au mrwa. <verse eid="JER 52:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22" />Hetageu peukang petün ga bam. Cide pehu cubit mengei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit mengei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">feet hena pie</char></note>, pwakelu rehi nah kuraletsi ne pelane twagwa pungbam. Cide au pelane hetageu le teilu. Tsiapum kedabe de nah kuraletsidung de kerai de nzwa da. <verse eid="JER 52:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23" />Cine tsiapum peukang taiga kuraletsidung riakhekuieherok bam, nah pwakelu reu ga kuraletsi haige bam.<verse eid="JER 52:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24" />Pum kekwame reu muibe hebaang tei kebam Seraiah de ngngwa lu, cingku kedibe, Zephaniah de si eh, cingku pekenabe, nah kirie kekwame hangcum de ngngwalu. <verse eid="JER 52:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25" />Namdi gade pa hebaangki reu kedibe de reugwame de pie rengei kebambe de ngngwa lu, nah hegwangpei de ledeu kelame mipeidung hang hena, namdi ga kebamme de. Pa hebaangme hegwangpei reugwame reu kedibe, mina de reugwame gage kedet gai kelabe de ngngwa lu, namdi ga kebam cipau deu ga mina kemlang riakherok gede si eh. <verse eid="JER 52:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26" />Pecai Nebuzaradan, pum kekwame reu muibe, penuide ngngwa lwe Riblah ga Babylon gwangpei da penuide ngngwa gwang. <verse eid="JER 52:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27" />Riblah ga Hamathme deu gade Babylon gwangpei penuide teitsetdi. Ainzwa eh, Judahme de penui deu gade lang gidi.<verse eid="JER 52:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 52:28" />Mina aidungde Nebuchadnezzar ne langgi kedimedung: Pa hegwang tei kelu mmi hena bekum, Judahme 3,023 de lang gidi. <verse eid="JER 52:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 52:29" />Nebuchadnezzar hegwang tei kelu mmi kereieheset bekum pa Jerusalem gade mina 832 de ngngwalu. <verse eid="JER 52:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 52:30" />Nebuchadnezzar hegwang tei kelu mmi ngkaiehkecum bekum, Nebuzaradan, hegwangpei pum kekwame reu muibe, Judahme mina 745 de lang gidi. Langgi kedi mina pelane ge 4,600.<verse eid="JER 52:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoiachin de Lungmpetkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31" />Judah gwangpei, Jehoiachin de langgi kedi mmi camreiehena cai, kei kereiekena bekei, zie ngkaiehmengei benai, Awel-marduk, Babylon gwangpei hebaangki gade Judah gwangpei Jehoiachin de lungmpet beu. Aide Awel-Marduk hegwang tei ndeu kelu bekum. <verse eid="JER 52:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32" />Pa pe zaiyi eh pecu resiu gai nah Babylon ga kebam hegwangme kedamedung swade herüt kepeu bam ge pecu pwapeu. <verse eid="JER 52:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33" />Awel-Marduk, Jehoiachin dade hebaangme paini niadung keu mpetdi, delwe Jehoiachin pe teilung kebanghbe hegwangme taktyeibam gade matyei jüja eh lunghdi, <verse eid="JER 52:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34" />nah pe teilungh kelunghta, pa tsai cu kecang, Babylon gwangpei tingnai ramsangne, taktyeipok teu maikesia pecu pwapeu.<verse eid="JER 52:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52" />
</usx>